1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:26,700
There is a technique I have not often spoken of publicly, though I have used it myself for years and taught it to a small number of students who came to me in private. I call it the falling backward technique. And I tell you now, if you have been struggling to enter the state akin to sleep, if you lie down at night with your desire clearly in mind but cannot seem to impress it upon your deeper self, this technique will solve that problem.

2
00:00:26,700 --> 00:00:54,220
But only if you understand why it works. Most who attempt to change their state make a fundamental error. They try to think their way into the new state. They visualize, they affirm, they use the mind against the mind, and all the while the body, the body with its insistent testimony of present circumstances, keeps them locked exactly where they are. You cannot assume a new state while your body shouts the evidence of the old. Do you see the problem?

3
00:00:54,220 --> 00:01:20,540
The falling backward technique works because it uses the body itself as the doorway. It quites the tyranny of the senses by giving them a single, absorbing sensation, the sensation of falling. And in that moment of surrender, when the body releases its grip, assumption enters unopposed. Tonight I will show you exactly how to do this. But first, you must understand what you are actually entering when you fall backward.

4
00:01:20,540 --> 00:01:26,660
Pause. Now let me tell you why the body is the problem and why this falling backward technique solves it.

5
00:01:26,660 --> 00:01:34,900
You live in a body. You live in a body. And that body, with its five senses, testifies constantly to the reality of your present circumstances.

6
00:01:35,440 --> 00:01:42,220
You see the bank statement. You feel the empty bed beside you. You hear the voice of the employer who refuses your raise.

7
00:01:42,600 --> 00:01:49,900
And all day long, my friend, your body is collecting evidence. Evidence that shouts, this is what is real, this is what is true.

8
00:01:49,900 --> 00:02:03,460
And then at night you lie down. You close your eyes. And you attempt to assume a new state. You try to feel yourself wealthy. You try to imagine yourself loved. You try to convince your deeper self that the wish is fulfilled.

9
00:02:03,460 --> 00:02:17,260
But the body will not cooperate. The body remembers the evidence of the day. It holds tension in its muscles. It keeps you locked in waking consciousness with its insistent signals of discomfort, hunger, restlessness.

10
00:02:17,940 --> 00:02:24,920
You cannot think your way past the body. This is what most do not understand. They believe imagination is purely mental.

11
00:02:24,920 --> 00:02:37,420
They sit in a chair and strain to visualize while their body fidgets and resists. Or they lie in bed and try to picture scenes while their body remains rigid, alert, fully identified with present facts.

12
00:02:37,600 --> 00:02:48,680
Now I must insist on this, my friend, because I have seen too many fail for lack of understanding it. The body is not your enemy. It is not an obstacle to overcome through willpower.

13
00:02:48,680 --> 00:03:03,460
It is the very instrument through which consciousness operates in this world. And if you try to assume a new state while ignoring the body or fighting against it, you will fail. Not sometimes. Always. The body must be enlisted, not defeated.

14
00:03:03,460 --> 00:03:16,360
My old teacher Abdullah taught me this many years ago. I was young then, living in New York, and I came to him with a problem. I wanted to travel to Barbados to see my family. I had no money. I had no ticket.

15
00:03:16,900 --> 00:03:25,340
And though I had been studying the law, I could not seem to assume the state of being in Barbados while my body sat in a cramped apartment in Manhattan.

16
00:03:25,340 --> 00:03:40,180
Abdullah looked at me and said, Neville, you are in your head. You think if you imagine hard enough the body will follow. But it does not work that way. The body must be quieted first. You cannot enter the state while the body shouts at you.

17
00:03:40,180 --> 00:03:51,720
I did not understand him at first. I thought visualization was enough. But he insisted, feel it, he told me, not with your mind, with your body. Your body knows before your mind accepts.

18
00:03:52,220 --> 00:04:04,640
He taught me to work with sensation, not to fight the body but to use it, to give it something so absorbing, so natural, that it would release its grip on present circumstances and allow consciousness to shift.

19
00:04:04,640 --> 00:04:12,360
And one of the techniques he showed me, though I have not often spoken of it in my public lectures, was this falling backwards sensation.

20
00:04:13,020 --> 00:04:17,420
It works, my friend, because it mimics something the body already knows.

21
00:04:17,940 --> 00:04:27,640
The surrender into sleep. Do you see? Every night of your life, your body falls into sleep. It knows how to let go. It knows how to release the grip of the senses.

22
00:04:27,640 --> 00:04:38,000
But most people cannot control this process. They wait for sleep to take them. They cannot induce it at will, while remaining conscious enough to direct their imagination.

23
00:04:38,600 --> 00:04:53,180
The falling backward technique gives you control. You deliberately induce the sensation of falling. Not a mental picture of falling, but the physical sensation, the feeling in your body of tipping backward, of surrendering, of letting go.

24
00:04:53,180 --> 00:05:05,680
And the moment you do this, the body recognizes the pattern. It begins to release. The sense is quiet. And in that suspension, that moment between waking and sleeping, assumption can enter unopposed.

25
00:05:06,220 --> 00:05:13,760
But hold this thought. There is a specific signal, a physical signal in your body, that tells you the assumption has taken root.

26
00:05:13,760 --> 00:05:23,380
Without recognizing that signal, you will practice this technique blindly, never knowing whether you have succeeded or merely relaxed your body into sleep.

27
00:05:23,860 --> 00:05:30,360
I will give you that signal in just a moment. But first you must understand the mistakes that prevent it from appearing.

28
00:05:31,100 --> 00:05:35,240
Now hold this thought. I will give you the exact method in a moment.

29
00:05:35,660 --> 00:05:42,180
But first I must tell you what most people do wrong. Because if you make these errors, the technique will not work.

30
00:05:42,180 --> 00:05:46,300
The first error is this. They try to think their way into the state.

31
00:05:46,840 --> 00:05:53,500
Even when they lie down to practice, even when they close their eyes, they are still using the mind against the mind.

32
00:05:53,700 --> 00:05:57,260
They visualize, they affirm, they mentally rehearse scenes.

33
00:05:57,720 --> 00:06:01,600
And all the while the body remains tense, alert, unconvinced.

34
00:06:01,720 --> 00:06:04,140
I tell you, and this is not opinion but law.

35
00:06:04,600 --> 00:06:07,200
Visualization has its place but it is not the doorway.

36
00:06:07,420 --> 00:06:07,900
Sensation.

37
00:06:07,900 --> 00:06:14,840
Sensation is the doorway. A physical feeling carries more conviction to the subconscious than any mental picture.

38
00:06:15,180 --> 00:06:19,640
Why? Because the body does not argue with sensation. It accepts it.

39
00:06:19,880 --> 00:06:24,100
When you feel yourself falling, the body responds as though you are falling.

40
00:06:24,600 --> 00:06:26,880
And where the body goes, consciousness follows.

41
00:06:26,880 --> 00:06:32,760
Do not be misled by the teachers who tell you to visualize harder, longer, more vividly.

42
00:06:33,200 --> 00:06:35,080
They have not understood this principle.

43
00:06:35,660 --> 00:06:39,500
They are asking you to use the weakest tool when the strongest is available.

44
00:06:40,480 --> 00:06:41,680
The second error is this.

45
00:06:42,160 --> 00:06:44,400
They attempt to force the state through effort.

46
00:06:45,100 --> 00:06:47,040
They lie down with clenched determination.

47
00:06:47,820 --> 00:06:52,420
They grit their teeth and try to make themselves feel wealthy, loved, successful.

48
00:06:52,420 --> 00:06:55,200
But assumption does not come through force.

49
00:06:55,680 --> 00:07:01,400
It comes through surrender, through letting go, through falling backward out of the old state

50
00:07:01,400 --> 00:07:04,040
and trusting that the new state will catch you.

51
00:07:04,460 --> 00:07:07,000
Make no mistake, this requires trust.

52
00:07:07,320 --> 00:07:12,140
When you feel yourself falling backward, there is a moment, just a moment, when the ego resists.

53
00:07:12,700 --> 00:07:13,880
It fears annihilation.

54
00:07:14,400 --> 00:07:15,800
It fears the loss of control.

55
00:07:15,800 --> 00:07:21,540
And if you tense against the sensation, if you fight it, you will snap back into waking consciousness

56
00:07:21,540 --> 00:07:23,200
and the technique will fail.

57
00:07:23,620 --> 00:07:24,980
You must surrender to the fall.

58
00:07:25,280 --> 00:07:26,100
You must let go.

59
00:07:26,540 --> 00:07:28,620
Not recklessly, but deliberately.

60
00:07:29,320 --> 00:07:30,840
You are not falling into darkness.

61
00:07:31,440 --> 00:07:33,580
You are falling into the state you have chosen.

62
00:07:34,220 --> 00:07:36,120
You are falling into the wish fulfilled.

63
00:07:36,640 --> 00:07:37,360
Pause now.

64
00:07:37,620 --> 00:07:42,440
Let me tell you of a woman who came to me through correspondence in the late 1950s.

65
00:07:42,440 --> 00:07:48,400
She lived in the Midwest, and she wrote to me because she had been trying for nearly a year

66
00:07:48,400 --> 00:07:50,240
to assume the state of being married.

67
00:07:50,880 --> 00:07:55,760
She wanted marriage desperately, but every technique she tried seemed to fail.

68
00:07:56,300 --> 00:07:58,380
She would visualize the ring on her finger.

69
00:07:58,900 --> 00:08:01,160
She would imagine conversations with a husband.

70
00:08:01,720 --> 00:08:07,040
She would feel herself loved, and yet month after month nothing changed in her outer world.

71
00:08:07,560 --> 00:08:10,180
She came to hear me lecture when I spoke in her city.

72
00:08:10,180 --> 00:08:14,620
After the lecture, she approached me, discouraged and near tears.

73
00:08:14,740 --> 00:08:16,920
I have done everything you teach, she said.

74
00:08:17,220 --> 00:08:18,600
I have imagined the end.

75
00:08:19,040 --> 00:08:20,120
I have felt it real.

76
00:08:20,560 --> 00:08:21,460
But nothing happens.

77
00:08:21,860 --> 00:08:22,860
What am I doing wrong?

78
00:08:23,080 --> 00:08:27,760
I asked her to describe her practice, and as she spoke, I saw the problem immediately.

79
00:08:28,180 --> 00:08:31,140
She was spending hours each day visualizing hours.

80
00:08:31,560 --> 00:08:37,100
She would sit in a chair and strain to hold mental pictures of her wedding, her home, her husband.

81
00:08:37,100 --> 00:08:41,180
But she admitted that her body was always tense during these sessions.

82
00:08:41,760 --> 00:08:43,240
She could never fully relax.

83
00:08:43,860 --> 00:08:47,620
She could never enter that drowsy state I had described in my lectures.

84
00:08:48,180 --> 00:08:50,220
You are trying too hard, I told her.

85
00:08:50,640 --> 00:08:53,560
The state you seek does not require hours of effort.

86
00:08:53,860 --> 00:08:59,240
It requires one moment of complete acceptance, and you cannot reach that moment while your body

87
00:08:59,240 --> 00:09:01,320
is tense and your mind is straining.

88
00:09:01,720 --> 00:09:03,540
At first, she resisted this.

89
00:09:03,540 --> 00:09:06,620
She believed that more effort meant more power.

90
00:09:06,960 --> 00:09:12,600
She thought if she could just visualize longer, more vividly, with more detail, the law would

91
00:09:12,600 --> 00:09:13,500
finally respond.

92
00:09:13,920 --> 00:09:16,140
I told her forget visualization for now.

93
00:09:16,560 --> 00:09:19,540
Tonight, when you go to bed, I want you to do only this.

94
00:09:19,940 --> 00:09:23,000
Lie down and induce the sensation of falling backward.

95
00:09:23,420 --> 00:09:24,700
Not a picture of falling.

96
00:09:25,040 --> 00:09:26,000
The feeling of falling.

97
00:09:26,460 --> 00:09:29,100
As though you are tipping backward into a deep cushion.

98
00:09:29,100 --> 00:09:33,160
And as you fall, assume the simple feeling of being a married woman.

99
00:09:33,680 --> 00:09:34,320
Not scenes.

100
00:09:34,960 --> 00:09:35,780
Not conversations.

101
00:09:36,360 --> 00:09:37,100
Just the feeling.

102
00:09:37,480 --> 00:09:38,980
The naturalness of being married.

103
00:09:39,400 --> 00:09:41,960
Let the fall carry you into sleep from that state.

104
00:09:42,300 --> 00:09:45,280
She looked uncertain, but she agreed to try.

105
00:09:45,660 --> 00:09:48,100
Three weeks later, I received a letter from her.

106
00:09:48,540 --> 00:09:50,600
She had practiced the technique every night.

107
00:09:50,900 --> 00:09:54,880
The first few nights, the sensation startled her back to wakefulness.

108
00:09:54,880 --> 00:09:59,040
She would feel herself falling and instinctively tense against it.

109
00:09:59,460 --> 00:10:00,500
But she persisted.

110
00:10:00,880 --> 00:10:05,300
And by the fourth or fifth night, she learned to surrender to the fall without fear.

111
00:10:05,760 --> 00:10:06,240
She wrote,

112
00:10:06,640 --> 00:10:11,520
The moment I stopped fighting the sensation and let myself fall, something shifted.

113
00:10:12,020 --> 00:10:16,460
I cannot describe it except to say that for the first time, I felt married.

114
00:10:16,800 --> 00:10:18,160
Not hopeful of being married.

115
00:10:18,620 --> 00:10:20,240
Not visualizing being married.

116
00:10:20,560 --> 00:10:23,200
But actually feeling the state as natural and real.

117
00:10:23,200 --> 00:10:30,200
Within two weeks of that shift, a man she had known casually for years began pursuing her with sudden intensity.

118
00:10:30,800 --> 00:10:33,960
They were engaged within a month and married shortly after.

119
00:10:34,380 --> 00:10:36,860
She wrote to me again months later and said,

120
00:10:37,200 --> 00:10:39,240
It was not the visualization that did it.

121
00:10:39,520 --> 00:10:40,440
It was the falling.

122
00:10:40,880 --> 00:10:41,460
The surrender.

123
00:10:42,100 --> 00:10:47,720
The moment I stopped trying to make it happen and simply let myself fall into the state, it became real.

124
00:10:48,200 --> 00:10:49,420
Do you see what happened?

125
00:10:49,980 --> 00:10:52,160
She stopped using the mind against the mind.

126
00:10:52,160 --> 00:10:53,300
She stopped straining.

127
00:10:53,820 --> 00:11:00,880
And she used the body, the falling sensation, to quiet the ego and enter that drowsy state where assumption takes root.

128
00:11:01,380 --> 00:11:03,920
In that state, assumption hardened into fact.

129
00:11:04,260 --> 00:11:04,660
Pause.

130
00:11:04,820 --> 00:11:06,740
Now I will give you the exact method.

131
00:11:07,240 --> 00:11:10,460
And here is where I will show you that signal I spoke of earlier.

132
00:11:10,880 --> 00:11:14,300
The physical signal that tells you the assumption has been impressed.

133
00:11:14,300 --> 00:11:17,640
Listen carefully, because every detail matters.

134
00:11:18,320 --> 00:11:21,180
Tonight, when you retire to bed, you will do this.

135
00:11:21,540 --> 00:11:23,900
First, you will lie down in a comfortable position.

136
00:11:24,380 --> 00:11:28,780
On your back is best, with your arms at your sides or resting on your abdomen.

137
00:11:29,280 --> 00:11:34,200
You are preparing for sleep, so the room should be dark and you should be alone and undisturbed.

138
00:11:34,740 --> 00:11:38,520
Second, you will close your eyes and begin to relax your body.

139
00:11:38,520 --> 00:11:39,980
Do not rush this.

140
00:11:40,360 --> 00:11:41,280
Let your breath slow.

141
00:11:41,540 --> 00:11:44,140
Let your muscles release their tension one by one.

142
00:11:44,660 --> 00:11:45,760
This is not meditation.

143
00:11:46,200 --> 00:11:47,740
This is preparation for sleep.

144
00:11:48,000 --> 00:11:55,300
You are moving toward that drowsy state where the conscious mind begins to fade and the subconscious becomes impressionable.

145
00:11:55,800 --> 00:11:56,920
Third, and this is the key.

146
00:11:57,380 --> 00:11:59,920
You will induce the sensation of falling backward.

147
00:12:00,360 --> 00:12:01,460
Not a mental picture.

148
00:12:01,900 --> 00:12:03,160
The physical sensation.

149
00:12:03,160 --> 00:12:09,500
Imagine that the bed beneath you is tipping, that you are falling backward into a soft, infinite cushion.

150
00:12:10,000 --> 00:12:18,220
Or imagine that you are sitting in a chair and suddenly it tips backward and you feel that lurch in your stomach, that surrender of control.

151
00:12:18,640 --> 00:12:20,580
Let the sensation fill your awareness.

152
00:12:20,860 --> 00:12:23,340
Let it become so real that your body responds.

153
00:12:23,720 --> 00:12:25,800
Fourth, do not resist the sensation.

154
00:12:26,040 --> 00:12:26,720
This is critical.

155
00:12:27,180 --> 00:12:30,140
The first few times you do this, your body may startle.

156
00:12:30,140 --> 00:12:33,820
You may feel a jolt and snap back to full waking consciousness.

157
00:12:34,320 --> 00:12:35,680
This is the ego resisting.

158
00:12:36,200 --> 00:12:37,280
Do not be discouraged.

159
00:12:37,560 --> 00:12:38,580
Simply begin again.

160
00:12:39,120 --> 00:12:43,240
Induce the sensation once more and each time surrender a little more deeply.

161
00:12:43,480 --> 00:12:44,220
Trust the fall.

162
00:12:44,420 --> 00:12:49,020
Fifth, as you feel yourself falling backward, assume the feeling of the wish fulfilled.

163
00:12:49,520 --> 00:12:52,700
Not a scene, not a conversation, just the feeling.

164
00:12:53,180 --> 00:12:57,080
If you desire wealth, feel the ease and security of wealth as you fall.

165
00:12:57,080 --> 00:13:01,980
If you desire love, feel the warmth and naturalness of being loved as you fall.

166
00:13:02,500 --> 00:13:06,700
If you desire health, feel the vitality and strength of health as you fall.

167
00:13:07,180 --> 00:13:11,580
Let the falling carry both the sensation and the assumption together into sleep.

168
00:13:11,940 --> 00:13:16,080
And sixth, let yourself drift into actual sleep from that assumption.

169
00:13:16,600 --> 00:13:18,720
Do not try to hold the feeling with effort.

170
00:13:18,960 --> 00:13:20,060
Simply rest in it.

171
00:13:20,060 --> 00:13:23,520
Let the fall carry you all the way into unconsciousness.

172
00:13:24,040 --> 00:13:28,080
And let the last thing your awareness knows be the feeling of the wish fulfilled.

173
00:13:28,780 --> 00:13:31,100
Now here is the signal I promised you.

174
00:13:31,440 --> 00:13:35,880
When the assumption has truly been impressed, when it has taken root in your subconscious,

175
00:13:36,420 --> 00:13:38,880
you will feel a release, a letting go.

176
00:13:39,380 --> 00:13:42,300
It is as though something inside you exhales and says,

177
00:13:42,400 --> 00:13:43,660
Yes, this is done.

178
00:13:43,940 --> 00:13:45,580
Your body will relax completely.

179
00:13:45,580 --> 00:13:46,920
Your breath will deepen.

180
00:13:47,460 --> 00:13:52,040
And you will drift into sleep with a sense of peace, of completion, of naturalness.

181
00:13:52,520 --> 00:13:54,520
That signal, my friend, is your confirmation.

182
00:13:55,160 --> 00:13:58,440
When you feel it, you know the law is now in operation.

183
00:13:59,220 --> 00:14:00,100
This is the technique.

184
00:14:00,580 --> 00:14:01,340
Simple is it not?

185
00:14:01,520 --> 00:14:03,800
But do not mistake simplicity for weakness.

186
00:14:04,440 --> 00:14:06,800
I have tested this method in my own experience.

187
00:14:07,280 --> 00:14:08,820
I have seen it work for others.

188
00:14:08,820 --> 00:14:14,160
And I tell you now, if you persist in this practice, if you do it nightly without doubt,

189
00:14:14,260 --> 00:14:16,340
your assumption will harden into fact.

190
00:14:17,100 --> 00:14:18,960
But there are mistakes you must avoid.

191
00:14:19,380 --> 00:14:24,520
I have seen students fail with this technique because they misunderstood one critical detail.

192
00:14:24,980 --> 00:14:26,480
The first mistake is this.

193
00:14:27,040 --> 00:14:28,660
They fall backward into nothing.

194
00:14:29,200 --> 00:14:31,120
They induce the sensation of falling.

195
00:14:31,560 --> 00:14:33,640
But they do not know where they are falling to.

196
00:14:33,920 --> 00:14:36,640
My friend, you are not falling into emptiness.

197
00:14:36,640 --> 00:14:39,320
You are falling into a specific state.

198
00:14:39,680 --> 00:14:44,380
Before you begin the technique, you must decide upon the state you wish to assume.

199
00:14:44,720 --> 00:14:46,060
Name it, feel it, know it.

200
00:14:46,360 --> 00:14:48,680
Then as you fall, you fall into that state.

201
00:14:49,140 --> 00:14:50,540
The falling is not the goal.

202
00:14:51,080 --> 00:14:53,860
The falling is the vehicle that carries you to the goal.

203
00:14:54,320 --> 00:14:59,600
The second mistake is trying to physically fall or tensing against the sensation out of fear.

204
00:14:59,900 --> 00:15:02,900
You must understand, this is an imagined sensation.

205
00:15:03,440 --> 00:15:04,720
You are not actually moving.

206
00:15:04,720 --> 00:15:07,180
Your body remains still on the bed.

207
00:15:07,680 --> 00:15:11,040
But your consciousness is experiencing the sensation of falling.

208
00:15:11,540 --> 00:15:18,340
When students confuse this and either try to make their body move or resist the sensation because it feels too real,

209
00:15:18,700 --> 00:15:21,100
they break the trance and the technique fails.

210
00:15:21,600 --> 00:15:24,600
The third mistake is attempting to visualize while falling.

211
00:15:25,060 --> 00:15:28,540
I tell you, let go of visualization for this technique.

212
00:15:29,180 --> 00:15:32,560
The falling backward method works through sensation, not sight.

213
00:15:32,560 --> 00:15:38,940
You are giving the body an absorbing physical feeling that captures attention and induces surrender.

214
00:15:39,500 --> 00:15:45,560
If you try to add mental pictures on top of the sensation, you divide your attention and weaken the effect.

215
00:15:45,860 --> 00:15:47,600
Feel the fall, feel the assumption.

216
00:15:48,120 --> 00:15:48,860
That is all.

217
00:15:49,260 --> 00:15:50,440
Pause now, my friend.

218
00:15:50,560 --> 00:15:53,600
I want you to understand something deeper about why this works.

219
00:15:53,600 --> 00:15:56,400
It is not merely a trick to relax the body.

220
00:15:56,560 --> 00:15:58,800
It is a rehearsal of something profound.

221
00:15:59,600 --> 00:16:03,960
You have heard me speak of dying to the old state, and some have misunderstood me.

222
00:16:04,440 --> 00:16:06,140
They think I speak metaphorically.

223
00:16:06,300 --> 00:16:07,100
Let me be plain.

224
00:16:07,540 --> 00:16:11,540
Every assumption requires an actual death, a death of the old state.

225
00:16:11,540 --> 00:16:13,720
You cannot be two states at once.

226
00:16:14,140 --> 00:16:16,680
To assume you are wealthy, you must die to poverty.

227
00:16:16,960 --> 00:16:19,400
To assume you are loved, you must die to loneliness.

228
00:16:20,080 --> 00:16:23,020
To assume you are healed, you must die to illness.

229
00:16:23,580 --> 00:16:26,520
This is what I mean when I tell you that you must be born again.

230
00:16:27,020 --> 00:16:29,080
The old must die so the new can live.

231
00:16:29,460 --> 00:16:31,000
There is no gradual transition.

232
00:16:31,520 --> 00:16:35,180
There is no middle ground where you are partly the old and partly the new.

233
00:16:35,620 --> 00:16:38,440
There is only the death of one and the birth of the other.

234
00:16:38,440 --> 00:16:42,500
And this falling backward, this surrender, is as a little death.

235
00:16:42,940 --> 00:16:44,760
It is the ego releasing its grip.

236
00:16:45,140 --> 00:16:47,220
It is the body letting go of what was.

237
00:16:47,500 --> 00:16:52,000
And in that moment of suspension, that moment of falling, you are between states.

238
00:16:52,200 --> 00:16:54,680
You are no longer the old and not yet fully the new.

239
00:16:54,820 --> 00:16:57,460
You are malleable, impressionable, open.

240
00:16:57,660 --> 00:17:03,620
And if in that moment you assume the feeling of the wish fulfilled, you will land in that state.

241
00:17:04,060 --> 00:17:07,760
You will be caught by your own imagination and resurrected in the new.

242
00:17:07,760 --> 00:17:10,040
This is the secret of the technique.

243
00:17:10,520 --> 00:17:16,260
It works not because it is clever, but because it mirrors the actual mechanism of transformation.

244
00:17:16,780 --> 00:17:19,340
Consciousness cannot shift while clinging to the old.

245
00:17:19,560 --> 00:17:20,500
It must let go.

246
00:17:20,660 --> 00:17:21,480
It must fall.

247
00:17:21,940 --> 00:17:27,660
And the falling backward technique teaches your body and your consciousness to surrender together.

248
00:17:28,120 --> 00:17:28,520
Pause.

249
00:17:28,640 --> 00:17:33,620
But before I tell you how to apply this tonight, there is one final thing I must address.

250
00:17:33,620 --> 00:17:44,100
It is the thing that separates those who practice this technique once and see their world respond within days from those who practice it for months and see nothing.

251
00:17:44,620 --> 00:17:45,280
It is this.

252
00:17:45,620 --> 00:17:47,540
What you do the moment you wake in the morning.

253
00:17:48,020 --> 00:17:52,500
Most who study the law sabotage themselves in the first 60 seconds of waking.

254
00:17:53,100 --> 00:17:56,760
I must tell you what happens in that moment and how to guard against it.

255
00:17:56,760 --> 00:18:01,000
Remember what I told you earlier about the woman from the Midwest.

256
00:18:01,580 --> 00:18:04,860
She spent a year trying to visualize her way into marriage.

257
00:18:05,160 --> 00:18:05,600
A year.

258
00:18:05,980 --> 00:18:10,020
And nothing changed until she learned to fall backward into the assumption.

259
00:18:10,500 --> 00:18:12,140
Do you see now why that worked?

260
00:18:12,480 --> 00:18:13,520
She stopped fighting.

261
00:18:13,720 --> 00:18:14,700
She stopped straining.

262
00:18:14,860 --> 00:18:15,440
She surrendered.

263
00:18:15,440 --> 00:18:18,740
And in that surrender, the state became hers.

264
00:18:19,220 --> 00:18:21,580
Now let me tell you how to apply this tonight.

265
00:18:21,980 --> 00:18:22,780
Do not wait.

266
00:18:23,080 --> 00:18:26,820
Do not tell yourself you will try this next week or when conditions are better.

267
00:18:27,320 --> 00:18:27,660
Tonight.

268
00:18:28,200 --> 00:18:30,880
When you lie down to sleep tonight, you will test this.

269
00:18:31,120 --> 00:18:34,540
Before you begin, decide upon one state, one assumption.

270
00:18:35,080 --> 00:18:37,560
Do not try to assume five things at once.

271
00:18:37,900 --> 00:18:39,560
Choose one thing you desire to be.

272
00:18:39,680 --> 00:18:40,740
Reduce it to a feeling.

273
00:18:41,160 --> 00:18:43,380
Not a complicated scene with many details.

274
00:18:43,380 --> 00:18:45,020
Just a single feeling.

275
00:18:45,340 --> 00:18:46,760
The feeling of the wish fulfilled.

276
00:18:47,160 --> 00:18:47,960
Then lie down.

277
00:18:48,100 --> 00:18:48,920
Relax your body.

278
00:18:49,320 --> 00:18:51,580
And induce the falling backward sensation.

279
00:18:51,980 --> 00:18:52,760
Surrender to it.

280
00:18:53,100 --> 00:18:57,460
And as you fall, wrap yourself in that feeling as though it were a garment.

281
00:18:57,920 --> 00:19:01,080
Let the fall carry you and the feeling together into sleep.

282
00:19:01,460 --> 00:19:02,400
Do this every night.

283
00:19:02,620 --> 00:19:03,280
Not occasionally.

284
00:19:03,640 --> 00:19:04,120
Every night.

285
00:19:04,340 --> 00:19:05,860
Persist in the assumption.

286
00:19:06,160 --> 00:19:11,260
And I tell you, an assumption though false, if persisted in, will harden into fact.

287
00:19:11,600 --> 00:19:12,460
This is the law.

288
00:19:12,460 --> 00:19:14,480
The world is yourself pushed out.

289
00:19:14,920 --> 00:19:20,640
And when you fall backward into a new state and persist in dwelling there, the world must reflect it.

290
00:19:21,000 --> 00:19:22,940
You do not need to believe it is true.

291
00:19:23,320 --> 00:19:26,600
You need only to persistence the assumption as though it were true.

292
00:19:27,060 --> 00:19:32,240
And this falling backward, this nightly practice, is persistence in physical form.

293
00:19:32,240 --> 00:19:35,160
Now here is what you must guard against in the morning.

294
00:19:35,700 --> 00:19:46,100
When you wake, your conscious mind rushes back in, and with it comes the memory of your circumstances, the evidence of the senses, the problems you fell asleep trying to solve.

295
00:19:46,100 --> 00:20:00,020
And if, in that first waking moment, you allow your attention to return to the old state, if you immediately begin thinking about bills, loneliness, illness, lack, you have dissolved the assumption you impressed the night before.

296
00:20:00,020 --> 00:20:03,620
Instead, the moment you wake, lie still for a moment.

297
00:20:04,100 --> 00:20:05,280
Do not leap out of bed.

298
00:20:05,440 --> 00:20:06,800
Do not reach for concerns.

299
00:20:07,420 --> 00:20:14,080
Simply recall the feeling you fell asleep in, the assumption, and rest in it for just a few seconds before you rise.

300
00:20:14,080 --> 00:20:15,660
This protects the impression.

301
00:20:16,260 --> 00:20:18,560
This allows it to harden throughout the day.

302
00:20:18,960 --> 00:20:23,800
I give you this technique, not because you need it forever, but because you need it now.

303
00:20:24,260 --> 00:20:27,580
You have not yet learned to simply be the state without effort.

304
00:20:28,180 --> 00:20:32,620
So, practice this falling backward until the day comes when you no longer fall.

305
00:20:33,040 --> 00:20:34,020
You simply are.

306
00:20:34,640 --> 00:20:34,900
Pause.

307
00:20:35,240 --> 00:20:39,340
And now I tell you my friend, the secret you have just heard is simpler than you imagined.

308
00:20:39,880 --> 00:20:43,800
You have been looking for complicated methods, advanced techniques,

309
00:20:43,800 --> 00:20:44,780
special knowledge.

310
00:20:44,780 --> 00:20:46,220
But the truth is this.

311
00:20:46,700 --> 00:20:48,700
The falling backward is not the power.

312
00:20:49,200 --> 00:20:52,860
The power is in what you are falling into, always the state.

313
00:20:53,360 --> 00:20:57,200
When you fall backward tonight and assume the feeling of the wish fulfilled,

314
00:20:57,700 --> 00:20:59,280
you are not performing a technique.

315
00:20:59,880 --> 00:21:01,600
You are entering a state of consciousness.

316
00:21:02,240 --> 00:21:05,700
And from that state, the world has no choice but to conform.

317
00:21:06,280 --> 00:21:08,060
The world is yourself pushed out.

318
00:21:08,400 --> 00:21:10,660
Change the state and the world must change.

319
00:21:10,800 --> 00:21:11,480
This is law.

320
00:21:11,480 --> 00:21:16,400
The falling backward simply makes the shift possible when you have not yet learned to

321
00:21:16,400 --> 00:21:17,160
shift at will.

322
00:21:17,480 --> 00:21:18,440
It quiets the body.

323
00:21:18,920 --> 00:21:20,140
It suspends the ego.

324
00:21:20,640 --> 00:21:21,560
It opens the door.

325
00:21:21,980 --> 00:21:25,120
But you must walk through that door into the state you have chosen.

326
00:21:25,380 --> 00:21:27,000
That is where creation happens.

327
00:21:27,180 --> 00:21:28,020
In the state.

328
00:21:28,880 --> 00:21:31,460
Tonight, when you lie down to sleep, test this.

329
00:21:31,620 --> 00:21:32,320
Just once.

330
00:21:32,660 --> 00:21:34,960
Induce the sensation of falling backward.

331
00:21:35,160 --> 00:21:35,920
Surrender to it.

332
00:21:35,920 --> 00:21:39,340
And as you fall, assume the feeling of your wish fulfilled.

333
00:21:39,800 --> 00:21:41,740
Let that feeling carry you into sleep.

334
00:21:42,020 --> 00:21:42,660
That is all.

335
00:21:42,940 --> 00:21:44,000
Do not analyze it.

336
00:21:44,380 --> 00:21:46,500
Do not question whether you did it correctly.

337
00:21:47,020 --> 00:21:48,320
Do not wonder if it worked.

338
00:21:48,640 --> 00:21:50,480
Simply do it and then let it go.

339
00:21:50,880 --> 00:21:51,840
Sleep in the assumption.

340
00:21:52,400 --> 00:21:53,420
Rest in the state.

341
00:21:53,420 --> 00:21:57,000
And let consciousness do its perfect work while you sleep.

342
00:21:57,600 --> 00:22:02,800
If in the morning you find that nothing has changed in your outer world, do not be discouraged.

343
00:22:03,040 --> 00:22:03,520
Persist.

344
00:22:04,040 --> 00:22:08,580
Fall backward again the next night and the next until the assumption becomes natural.

345
00:22:09,040 --> 00:22:12,500
Until you no longer need to fall because you simply are the state.

346
00:22:12,500 --> 00:22:25,280
But I tell you, if you do this with full surrender, if you truly let yourself fall into the wish fulfilled and sleep there, you will know in your own experience that what I have told you, Nate, it is true.

347
00:22:25,960 --> 00:22:27,560
Consciousness is the only reality.

348
00:22:27,900 --> 00:22:28,900
Imagining reality.

349
00:22:29,460 --> 00:22:33,240
An assumption though false, if persisted in, will harden into fact.

350
00:22:33,620 --> 00:22:36,820
May you fall tonight into the arms of your own fulfilled desire.

351
00:22:37,400 --> 00:22:38,880
May you awaken in the state.

352
00:22:38,880 --> 00:22:42,460
If you believe that money is the root of all evil, you will never have it.

353
00:22:43,140 --> 00:22:47,580
Not because money itself is evil, but because your consciousness of money is poisoned.

354
00:22:48,100 --> 00:22:50,780
I learned this from my teacher Abdullah many years ago.

355
00:22:51,220 --> 00:22:55,980
But I tell you honestly, for six months after he told me, I did not understand what he meant.

356
00:22:56,720 --> 00:23:02,760
Six months of struggle, six months of applying what I thought was his teaching, and nothing changed in my financial world.

357
00:23:03,080 --> 00:23:08,300
Then one morning as I was walking down the street in New York, the meaning struck me like lightning.

358
00:23:08,800 --> 00:23:12,420
What Abdullah had told me was not what I thought he had told me at all.

359
00:23:12,500 --> 00:23:18,420
The moment I grasped his real meaning, everything changed, not gradually, immediately.

360
00:23:18,860 --> 00:23:23,980
Tonight I will give you his exact words, and I will tell you why I misunderstood them for so long.

361
00:23:24,640 --> 00:23:31,320
Because the misunderstanding I had is the same misunderstanding that keeps most people in financial bondage their entire lives.

362
00:23:31,320 --> 00:23:34,120
They think they know what it means to feel wealthy.

363
00:23:34,680 --> 00:23:35,500
They do not.

364
00:23:35,900 --> 00:23:38,940
They are feeling the very opposite, and calling it wealth.

365
00:23:39,800 --> 00:23:40,580
Listen carefully.

366
00:23:41,000 --> 00:23:46,500
I will tell you exactly what Abdullah said to me, and why it took me six months to understand his meaning.

367
00:23:46,500 --> 00:23:51,940
I had gone to him, as I did so many times in those early years, troubled about money.

368
00:23:52,300 --> 00:23:58,400
I was a young man then, living in New York, and like most young men, I thought my problem was that I did not have enough money.

369
00:23:58,500 --> 00:24:01,440
I thought if I could just get more money, I would feel secure.

370
00:24:01,740 --> 00:24:08,600
If I could just find the right opportunity, the right job, the right investment, then I would have peace of mind about my finances.

371
00:24:08,600 --> 00:24:14,520
Abdullah listened to me with those penetrating eyes of his, when I finished explaining my situation.

372
00:24:15,020 --> 00:24:16,960
He said something I will never forget.

373
00:24:17,360 --> 00:24:20,140
He said, Neville, you are putting the cart before the horse.

374
00:24:20,860 --> 00:24:23,080
You think you need money to feel wealthy.

375
00:24:23,520 --> 00:24:26,220
I tell you, you must feel wealthy to have money.

376
00:24:26,440 --> 00:24:28,860
At the time, I thought I understood what he meant.

377
00:24:29,720 --> 00:24:34,040
Of course, I said to myself, I must feel confident about money.

378
00:24:34,360 --> 00:24:36,760
I must think positive thoughts about prosperity.

379
00:24:36,760 --> 00:24:39,480
I must visualize having wealth.

380
00:24:40,260 --> 00:24:42,340
And so I began to do exactly that.

381
00:24:43,000 --> 00:24:44,140
Or so I thought.

382
00:24:44,400 --> 00:24:48,900
For the next six months, my friend, I practiced what I believed Abdullah had taught me.

383
00:24:49,600 --> 00:24:53,060
Every morning I would look in the mirror and tell myself I was wealthy.

384
00:24:53,440 --> 00:24:55,860
I would visualize money in my bank account.

385
00:24:56,360 --> 00:24:59,920
I would imagine myself spending freely, buying whatever I wanted.

386
00:25:00,420 --> 00:25:03,800
I would repeat affirmations about abundance and prosperity.

387
00:25:03,800 --> 00:25:05,300
But nothing changed.

388
00:25:05,740 --> 00:25:06,020
Nothing.

389
00:25:06,760 --> 00:25:10,000
My financial situation remained exactly as it had been.

390
00:25:10,500 --> 00:25:12,620
I became frustrated then discouraged.

391
00:25:13,080 --> 00:25:16,640
Had Abdullah been wrong, was I not applying his teaching correctly?

392
00:25:17,640 --> 00:25:18,800
But hold this thought.

393
00:25:19,460 --> 00:25:25,440
There is one specific emotion that reveals whether you are truly feeling wealthy or merely hoping to become wealthy.

394
00:25:25,440 --> 00:25:30,940
Without recognizing this emotion in yourself, you will practice for years and see no change.

395
00:25:31,300 --> 00:25:35,960
I will show you exactly what that emotion is and how to detect it in just a moment.

396
00:25:35,960 --> 00:25:39,200
I remember the morning when the truth finally struck me.

397
00:25:39,200 --> 00:25:44,620
I was walking down 5th Avenue and I passed by a store window displaying expensive suits.

398
00:25:44,620 --> 00:25:52,480
As I looked at those suits, I caught myself thinking, someday when I have money I will be able to afford clothes like that.

399
00:25:52,480 --> 00:26:01,160
In that moment, you see my friend, all those months I thought I was feeling wealthy, but I was actually feeling the exact opposite.

400
00:26:01,160 --> 00:26:09,820
I was feeling the lack of wealth, I was feeling the waiting for wealth, I was feeling the hoping for wealth, but I was not feeling wealth itself.

401
00:26:10,200 --> 00:26:12,780
Abdullah had not told me to think about having money.

402
00:26:13,380 --> 00:26:16,200
He had not told me to hope for money or to wait for money.

403
00:26:16,540 --> 00:26:18,140
He had told me to feel wealthy.

404
00:26:18,540 --> 00:26:25,360
Not to feel like I was going to be wealthy, but to feel wealthy now, in this moment, regardless of what my bank account showed.

405
00:26:25,680 --> 00:26:27,560
The difference, my friend, is everything.

406
00:26:28,460 --> 00:26:31,240
When you hope for something, you are affirming its absence.

407
00:26:31,860 --> 00:26:35,520
When you wait for something, you are living in the consciousness of not having it.

408
00:26:35,520 --> 00:26:41,020
When you think positive thoughts about future prosperity, you are still living from present lack.

409
00:26:41,160 --> 00:26:43,300
You have heard teachers speak of visualization.

410
00:26:43,980 --> 00:26:47,000
You have heard them speak of affirmations and positive thinking.

411
00:26:47,420 --> 00:26:48,280
Let me be plain.

412
00:26:48,720 --> 00:26:51,760
Most who teach these things have not understood what they are teaching.

413
00:26:52,260 --> 00:26:55,420
They confuse the act of visualizing with the state of consciousness.

414
00:26:56,060 --> 00:26:59,280
They confuse the repetition of words with the assumption of being.

415
00:26:59,400 --> 00:27:05,200
I tell you, you can visualize until your eyes grow tired, but if you are visualizing from the state of lack,

416
00:27:05,200 --> 00:27:07,100
you will demonstrate only more lack.

417
00:27:07,280 --> 00:27:11,520
Let me tell you about a woman who came to my lectures in Los Angeles many years ago.

418
00:27:11,900 --> 00:27:16,160
She had been studying what she called prosperity teachings for over three years.

419
00:27:16,700 --> 00:27:17,960
Three years, my friend.

420
00:27:18,080 --> 00:27:22,480
She had read every book, attended every lecture, practiced every technique she could find.

421
00:27:22,920 --> 00:27:26,160
Yet her financial situation had not improved by one dollar.

422
00:27:26,540 --> 00:27:29,940
When she approached me after one of my lectures, she was nearly in tears.

423
00:27:30,400 --> 00:27:32,880
Mr. Goddard, she said, I have tried everything.

424
00:27:33,000 --> 00:27:34,680
I visualize money every day.

425
00:27:34,680 --> 00:27:36,800
I affirm my abundance every morning.

426
00:27:37,280 --> 00:27:39,220
I make vision boards and treasure maps.

427
00:27:39,360 --> 00:27:42,900
I think only positive thoughts about money, but nothing works.

428
00:27:43,320 --> 00:27:44,540
What am I doing wrong?

429
00:27:45,260 --> 00:27:47,000
I asked her a simple question.

430
00:27:47,480 --> 00:27:50,040
When you are visualizing this money, how do you feel?

431
00:27:50,800 --> 00:27:52,560
Well, she said, I feel hopeful.

432
00:27:53,060 --> 00:27:55,300
I feel excited about when it will come to me.

433
00:27:55,560 --> 00:27:57,160
And when you are not visualizing?

434
00:27:57,320 --> 00:27:57,860
I asked.

435
00:27:58,360 --> 00:27:59,040
She paused.

436
00:27:59,220 --> 00:28:01,240
When I'm not visualizing, I feel worried.

437
00:28:01,240 --> 00:28:03,400
I feel anxious about my bills.

438
00:28:03,880 --> 00:28:06,380
I feel frustrated that the money hasn't come yet.

439
00:28:07,060 --> 00:28:08,760
There was her answer, my friend.

440
00:28:08,900 --> 00:28:13,340
She was spending ten minutes a day feeling hopeful about future money, and the remaining

441
00:28:13,340 --> 00:28:17,040
twenty-three hours and fifty minutes feeling anxious about present lack.

442
00:28:17,040 --> 00:28:20,960
Which state do you think was being impressed upon her subconscious mind?

443
00:28:21,500 --> 00:28:24,040
Here is the emotion I promised to reveal to you.

444
00:28:24,460 --> 00:28:26,080
It is the feeling of expectation.

445
00:28:26,720 --> 00:28:30,660
When you are truly wealthy in consciousness, you do not expect money to come.

446
00:28:31,080 --> 00:28:33,900
You rest in the satisfaction of already having it.

447
00:28:33,900 --> 00:28:36,780
Expectation always implies absence.

448
00:28:37,760 --> 00:28:39,360
Satisfaction implies presence.

449
00:28:39,680 --> 00:28:41,700
At first, she resisted my explanation.

450
00:28:42,480 --> 00:28:47,620
She had invested so much time and energy in her techniques, her visualizations, her affirmations,

451
00:28:47,860 --> 00:28:50,980
but these methods have worked for other people, she protested.

452
00:28:51,280 --> 00:28:53,200
I told her what I am telling you now.

453
00:28:53,680 --> 00:28:55,260
The method is not what matters.

454
00:28:55,580 --> 00:28:56,920
The state is what matters.

455
00:28:56,920 --> 00:29:02,420
You can visualize until your eyes grow tired, but if you are visualizing from lack, you will

456
00:29:02,420 --> 00:29:03,980
only demonstrate more lack.

457
00:29:04,280 --> 00:29:09,540
You can affirm abundance with your lips while your consciousness rests in poverty, and poverty

458
00:29:09,540 --> 00:29:10,900
is what you will experience.

459
00:29:12,120 --> 00:29:15,360
I instructed her to stop all her techniques for one week.

460
00:29:16,000 --> 00:29:20,840
Instead, I told her to live from the assumption that she was already financially free, not that

461
00:29:20,840 --> 00:29:25,980
she was going to be financially free, but that she was financially free now, in consciousness.

462
00:29:26,920 --> 00:29:28,180
How do I do that?

463
00:29:28,240 --> 00:29:28,800
She asked.

464
00:29:29,320 --> 00:29:30,660
Very simply, I told her.

465
00:29:31,120 --> 00:29:36,340
When you see something you want to buy, instead of thinking I cannot afford that, assume you

466
00:29:36,340 --> 00:29:37,100
can afford it.

467
00:29:37,420 --> 00:29:40,560
You may choose not to buy it, but assume you could if you wish to.

468
00:29:41,400 --> 00:29:46,640
When you pay your bills, instead of feeling the pinch of parting with money, feel the satisfaction

469
00:29:46,640 --> 00:29:48,560
of easily meeting your obligations.

470
00:29:49,160 --> 00:29:54,320
When you think about your future, instead of worrying about financial security, rest in

471
00:29:54,320 --> 00:29:56,480
the assumption that you are financially secure.

472
00:29:56,480 --> 00:30:00,340
She came to see me three weeks later, and her face was transformed.

473
00:30:00,800 --> 00:30:06,620
In those three weeks, she had received an unexpected bonus from her employer, a refund check she

474
00:30:06,620 --> 00:30:10,980
had forgotten about, and an offer for additional work that would double her income.

475
00:30:11,280 --> 00:30:15,760
But more importantly, she had discovered the secret that Abdullah had tried to teach me so

476
00:30:15,760 --> 00:30:16,720
many years before.

477
00:30:17,060 --> 00:30:18,280
The secret is this.

478
00:30:18,680 --> 00:30:20,400
Consciousness is the only reality.

479
00:30:21,020 --> 00:30:23,080
What you are conscious of being you are.

480
00:30:23,080 --> 00:30:27,840
If you are conscious of being poor, you are poor, regardless of the money in your bank

481
00:30:27,840 --> 00:30:28,240
account.

482
00:30:28,660 --> 00:30:33,040
If you are conscious of being wealthy, you are wealthy, regardless of your present circumstances.

483
00:30:33,620 --> 00:30:36,100
Now I must tell you something most teachers will not.

484
00:30:36,900 --> 00:30:41,680
There is a precise moment in your day when your true financial consciousness reveals itself

485
00:30:41,680 --> 00:30:42,300
completely.

486
00:30:43,320 --> 00:30:47,720
Miss this moment and you will never know whether you are truly assuming wealth or merely playing

487
00:30:47,720 --> 00:30:48,860
with the idea of it.

488
00:30:48,860 --> 00:30:50,900
I will show you that moment now.

489
00:30:51,960 --> 00:30:54,080
Most people have this backwards, my friend.

490
00:30:54,700 --> 00:30:57,440
They believe they will be conscious of wealth when they have money.

491
00:30:58,180 --> 00:31:01,120
I tell you, you will have money when you are conscious of wealth.

492
00:31:01,380 --> 00:31:05,560
Remember what I told you a few moments ago about the difference between feeling wealthy

493
00:31:05,560 --> 00:31:06,680
and hoping for wealth.

494
00:31:07,200 --> 00:31:10,520
Now this is where you see why this distinction matters so profoundly.

495
00:31:10,520 --> 00:31:12,840
The moment I speak of is this.

496
00:31:13,460 --> 00:31:17,900
The moment you wake in the morning before you have had time to think, what is your natural

497
00:31:17,900 --> 00:31:18,980
feeling about money?

498
00:31:19,380 --> 00:31:24,760
In that unguarded moment, what rises spontaneously in your consciousness, relief that you have

499
00:31:24,760 --> 00:31:26,880
enough or anxiety that you do not?

500
00:31:27,220 --> 00:31:32,740
That moment, my friend, that first feeling upon waking, reveals your true assumption about

501
00:31:32,740 --> 00:31:33,100
money.

502
00:31:33,100 --> 00:31:39,500
Everything else, all your techniques and visualizations, are merely what you are trying to convince yourself

503
00:31:39,500 --> 00:31:42,860
to believe, but that first feeling is what you actually believe.

504
00:31:43,160 --> 00:31:47,260
This is what the scripture means when it speaks of the rich man and the eye of the needle.

505
00:31:47,840 --> 00:31:51,000
The world will tell you this passage condemns wealth itself.

506
00:31:51,520 --> 00:31:52,880
I tell you they are wrong.

507
00:31:53,480 --> 00:31:58,400
The rich man who cannot enter the kingdom of heaven is not the one who has money in his bank account.

508
00:31:58,400 --> 00:32:03,740
The rich man is the one who is rich in his own conception, the one who believes his security

509
00:32:03,740 --> 00:32:07,120
comes from external things rather than from consciousness itself.

510
00:32:07,420 --> 00:32:12,340
When you place your faith in money, you make money your god, and any god outside of consciousness

511
00:32:12,340 --> 00:32:13,200
will fail you.

512
00:32:13,580 --> 00:32:16,060
Money can be lost, stolen, devalued.

513
00:32:16,620 --> 00:32:17,400
But consciousness?

514
00:32:17,940 --> 00:32:21,440
Consciousness is eternal, indestructible, always available to you.

515
00:32:21,680 --> 00:32:24,660
Now you may ask, does this mean we should not work for money?

516
00:32:24,660 --> 00:32:27,880
Does this mean we should not be practical about our finances?

517
00:32:28,120 --> 00:32:29,180
Not at all, my friend.

518
00:32:29,660 --> 00:32:30,940
Work by all means.

519
00:32:31,360 --> 00:32:32,980
Be practical, be wise.

520
00:32:33,880 --> 00:32:37,580
But work from the consciousness of wealth, not from the consciousness of need.

521
00:32:38,560 --> 00:32:42,300
Be practical from the assumption of abundance, not from the fear of lack.

522
00:32:42,480 --> 00:32:44,260
The world is yourself pushed out.

523
00:32:45,140 --> 00:32:49,340
If you see lack in your world, you are seeing your consciousness of lack made visible.

524
00:32:49,340 --> 00:32:54,840
If you see limitation in your world, you are seeing your consciousness of limitation externalized.

525
00:32:55,540 --> 00:32:58,620
But change your consciousness, and your world must change.

526
00:32:58,900 --> 00:33:01,340
I have told you before, but I will tell you again.

527
00:33:02,220 --> 00:33:06,260
Assumption though false, if persisted in, will harden into fact.

528
00:33:06,600 --> 00:33:12,040
If you assume you are wealthy in consciousness, that assumption persisted in will externalize

529
00:33:12,040 --> 00:33:13,760
itself as wealth in your world.

530
00:33:13,760 --> 00:33:15,880
Now I must insist on this, my friend.

531
00:33:16,680 --> 00:33:20,480
Consciousness is cause, and what you see in your world is effect.

532
00:33:21,140 --> 00:33:23,700
This is not sentiment, this is not positive thinking.

533
00:33:24,180 --> 00:33:27,700
This is the fundamental principle by which all things come into being.

534
00:33:28,240 --> 00:33:31,460
Do not let anyone, including yourself, talk you out of it.

535
00:33:32,280 --> 00:33:37,160
Before I tell you how to apply this tonight, there is one final detail about the technique itself.

536
00:33:37,620 --> 00:33:42,400
Most who practice it make one crucial mistake in the moment between assuming the state and

537
00:33:42,400 --> 00:33:43,220
falling asleep.

538
00:33:43,900 --> 00:33:47,700
This mistake causes the assumption to dissolve instead of taking root.

539
00:33:48,120 --> 00:33:53,340
I must show you this now, for it separates those who see results in days from those who

540
00:33:53,340 --> 00:33:55,260
practice for years without success.

541
00:33:56,200 --> 00:33:59,340
Now let me tell you how to apply this principle tonight.

542
00:33:59,700 --> 00:34:04,460
When you retire this evening, you will enter into that drowsy state between waking and sleeping,

543
00:34:04,820 --> 00:34:07,960
that state akin to sleep which I have spoken of so often.

544
00:34:07,960 --> 00:34:13,020
First, you will assume the feeling of being financially free, not the feeling of getting

545
00:34:13,020 --> 00:34:15,720
money but the feeling of having financial freedom.

546
00:34:16,680 --> 00:34:20,120
Feel as you would feel if you had no financial concerns whatsoever.

547
00:34:20,620 --> 00:34:23,180
Second, you will let your mind rest in that assumption.

548
00:34:23,680 --> 00:34:25,360
Do not strain to hold the thought.

549
00:34:25,520 --> 00:34:27,020
Do not repeat affirmations.

550
00:34:27,520 --> 00:34:30,800
Simply rest in the naturalness of being financially secure.

551
00:34:31,180 --> 00:34:34,560
Third, you will not concern yourself with how this will come to pass.

552
00:34:34,560 --> 00:34:36,900
First, do not plan the ways or means.

553
00:34:37,320 --> 00:34:38,780
Your business is to assume.

554
00:34:39,480 --> 00:34:41,200
The how is not your concern.

555
00:34:42,200 --> 00:34:44,620
And fourth, you will fall asleep in that assumption.

556
00:34:45,300 --> 00:34:48,780
Let sleep come while you are resting in the feeling of financial freedom.

557
00:34:49,040 --> 00:34:51,080
Here is the crucial detail I promised you.

558
00:34:51,400 --> 00:34:56,080
The moment you feel sleep approaching, do not try to hold on to the assumption with your

559
00:34:56,080 --> 00:34:56,800
conscious mind.

560
00:34:57,260 --> 00:34:57,860
Let it go.

561
00:34:58,280 --> 00:35:00,060
Release it completely into sleep.

562
00:35:00,060 --> 00:35:04,560
Most people panic at this moment and try to grip the assumption tighter.

563
00:35:05,020 --> 00:35:05,960
This destroys it.

564
00:35:06,340 --> 00:35:11,960
The assumption must be released into the subconscious through sleep, not held by the conscious mind.

565
00:35:12,220 --> 00:35:16,340
If you do this faithfully, night after night, you will find that your consciousness begins

566
00:35:16,340 --> 00:35:16,960
to shift.

567
00:35:17,520 --> 00:35:20,840
And as your consciousness shifts, your world must shift to match it.

568
00:35:21,200 --> 00:35:23,580
You will find yourself taking different actions.

569
00:35:24,080 --> 00:35:26,620
Opportunities will appear that were not visible before.

570
00:35:26,620 --> 00:35:29,280
People will respond to you differently.

571
00:35:29,480 --> 00:35:32,000
Money will come to you through ways you never expected.

572
00:35:32,360 --> 00:35:34,880
But remember my friend, feeling is the secret.

573
00:35:35,780 --> 00:35:37,040
Not the feeling of wanting.

574
00:35:37,580 --> 00:35:38,720
Not the feeling of hoping.

575
00:35:39,260 --> 00:35:41,480
The feeling of the wish fulfilled itself.

576
00:35:42,640 --> 00:35:46,320
This is what Abdullah meant when he said I must feel wealthy to have money.

577
00:35:46,860 --> 00:35:51,360
He meant I must live in the consciousness of wealth, not in the consciousness of poverty,

578
00:35:51,520 --> 00:35:52,420
hoping for wealth.

579
00:35:52,420 --> 00:35:57,740
For six months I lived in the consciousness of poverty, hoping and trying and visualizing

580
00:35:57,740 --> 00:35:58,720
my way to wealth.

581
00:35:59,120 --> 00:36:03,740
The moment I shifted to living in the consciousness of wealth itself, everything changed.

582
00:36:04,020 --> 00:36:06,380
Do not make the mistake I made, my friend.

583
00:36:06,780 --> 00:36:10,620
Do not spend months or years practicing from the wrong state of consciousness.

584
00:36:11,320 --> 00:36:15,720
The moment you truly understand what I am telling you tonight, you can begin living in

585
00:36:15,720 --> 00:36:16,140
the end.

586
00:36:16,540 --> 00:36:19,280
You can begin assuming you are what you wish to be.

587
00:36:19,280 --> 00:36:24,040
And now I tell you my friend what Abdullah was really teaching me in those few simple

588
00:36:24,040 --> 00:36:24,500
words.

589
00:36:25,000 --> 00:36:29,700
He was not giving me a technique for getting money, he was revealing the fundamental law

590
00:36:29,700 --> 00:36:30,960
of consciousness itself.

591
00:36:31,580 --> 00:36:33,740
You do not feel wealthy to attract wealth.

592
00:36:34,120 --> 00:36:37,280
You feel wealthy because you are wealthy in consciousness.

593
00:36:38,040 --> 00:36:43,700
The moment you truly assume that state, not hope for it, not work toward it, but assume

594
00:36:43,700 --> 00:36:45,140
it as your present reality.

595
00:36:45,140 --> 00:36:50,420
In that moment you have wealth, everything else is simply the world catching up to what you

596
00:36:50,420 --> 00:36:52,060
have already become in consciousness.

597
00:36:53,080 --> 00:36:55,340
Tonight when you retire, do this just once.

598
00:36:55,940 --> 00:36:58,640
Enter that drowsy state between waking and sleeping.

599
00:36:58,880 --> 00:37:02,720
Assume you are financially free, not that you will be, but that you are.

600
00:37:03,200 --> 00:37:04,600
Feel the naturalness of it.

601
00:37:05,020 --> 00:37:07,480
Rest in that assumption and let sleep come.

602
00:37:07,480 --> 00:37:12,320
Tomorrow you may awaken to find that consciousness has done its perfect work.

603
00:37:12,880 --> 00:37:17,000
Or you may find that the assumption must be persisted in for several nights.

604
00:37:17,820 --> 00:37:19,920
Both are well, my friend, both are well.

605
00:37:20,140 --> 00:37:21,300
The law is exact.

606
00:37:21,780 --> 00:37:24,820
What you assume to be true becomes true in your experience.

607
00:37:25,060 --> 00:37:28,940
The world is yourself pushed out, and imagining creates reality.

608
00:37:29,380 --> 00:37:32,340
May you sleep tonight in the Sabbath rest of your assumption.

609
00:37:32,340 --> 00:37:37,980
May you awaken knowing that what you have assumed in consciousness must externalize itself in

610
00:37:37,980 --> 00:37:38,680
your world.

611
00:37:39,040 --> 00:37:42,320
May you walk tomorrow in the certainty of the wish fulfilled.

612
00:37:43,140 --> 00:37:44,840
Until we meet again, my friend.

613
00:37:47,190 --> 00:37:51,690
Every morning for twenty minutes I would sit in my chair in that small apartment on West

614
00:37:51,690 --> 00:37:52,850
72nd Street.

615
00:37:53,430 --> 00:37:58,470
Every morning, not nineteen minutes, not twenty-five minutes, but exactly twenty minutes, and I

616
00:37:58,470 --> 00:38:01,370
tell you within three weeks everything in my world had changed.

617
00:38:01,530 --> 00:38:01,930
Everything.

618
00:38:01,930 --> 00:38:05,090
Now, you may think you know what I did in those twenty minutes.

619
00:38:05,210 --> 00:38:08,630
You may think it was prayer, or meditation, or some form of concentration.

620
00:38:09,150 --> 00:38:10,030
You would be wrong.

621
00:38:10,370 --> 00:38:15,310
What I did was so simple that most who hear me dismiss it, so practical that they search

622
00:38:15,310 --> 00:38:20,150
for something more mystical, so precise that they add their own complications and destroy

623
00:38:20,150 --> 00:38:20,730
its power.

624
00:38:21,130 --> 00:38:23,530
The technique I will give you tonight is not new.

625
00:38:23,890 --> 00:38:29,190
I have spoken of revision before, but the morning application, this exact method, practiced

626
00:38:29,190 --> 00:38:34,370
for exactly twenty minutes at exactly the same time each morning, this transforms revision

627
00:38:34,370 --> 00:38:38,810
from a pleasant exercise into a force that will reconstruct your entire world.

628
00:38:39,070 --> 00:38:43,930
But before I give you the method, you must understand why twenty minutes in the morning accomplishes

629
00:38:43,930 --> 00:38:45,990
what hours of evening revision cannot.

630
00:38:45,990 --> 00:38:50,150
The difference, my friend, lies in the nature of assumption itself.

631
00:38:50,270 --> 00:38:55,630
When you retire at night and practice revision, you are working with a tired mind, a mind that

632
00:38:55,630 --> 00:38:59,550
has been active all day, a mind filled with the impressions of the day's events.

633
00:38:59,930 --> 00:39:04,750
But in the morning, my friend, in those first moments of consciousness, the mind is fresh,

634
00:39:04,750 --> 00:39:09,390
it is receptive, it is in that creative state most akin to the power itself.

635
00:39:09,710 --> 00:39:12,530
I discovered this quite by accident in 1954.

636
00:39:13,270 --> 00:39:17,970
I had been teaching revision for years, teaching my audiences in New York to revise their day

637
00:39:17,970 --> 00:39:22,190
before sleep, to rewrite the unwanted events into what they should have been.

638
00:39:22,570 --> 00:39:23,810
And yes, it worked.

639
00:39:24,290 --> 00:39:28,970
But slowly, sometimes taking months for the revision to manifest in their world.

640
00:39:29,210 --> 00:39:33,370
Then came a period in my life when circumstances demanded immediate change.

641
00:39:33,370 --> 00:39:38,670
I will not burden you with the details, but I tell you I could not wait months for my assumption

642
00:39:38,670 --> 00:39:39,970
to harden into fact.

643
00:39:40,390 --> 00:39:43,430
I needed results, and so I began to experiment.

644
00:39:43,790 --> 00:39:48,490
Instead of revising only at night, I began each morning with twenty minutes of deliberate

645
00:39:48,490 --> 00:39:54,030
revision, twenty minutes of taking the previous day and reshaping it in imagination, twenty

646
00:39:54,030 --> 00:39:58,670
minutes of living mentally in the corrected version until it felt more real than what had

647
00:39:58,670 --> 00:39:59,490
actually occurred.

648
00:39:59,490 --> 00:40:03,350
The results, my friend, were immediate, where months of evening revision,

649
00:40:03,370 --> 00:40:08,670
had produced gradual change, three weeks of morning revision revolutionized my entire

650
00:40:08,670 --> 00:40:09,090
world.

651
00:40:09,450 --> 00:40:10,550
And I understood why.

652
00:40:10,990 --> 00:40:15,770
In the morning, consciousness emerges from sleep still malleable, still creative.

653
00:40:16,390 --> 00:40:21,050
The logical mind has not yet erected its barriers of what is possible and what is not.

654
00:40:21,510 --> 00:40:24,910
In this creative state, assumption encounters no resistance.

655
00:40:25,450 --> 00:40:28,830
It sinks into the subconscious like seed into fertile soil.

656
00:40:28,830 --> 00:40:31,630
But most who hear me make three critical errors.

657
00:40:32,070 --> 00:40:33,430
They practice sporadically.

658
00:40:33,910 --> 00:40:36,050
They practice with effort instead of ease.

659
00:40:36,390 --> 00:40:39,470
And they abandon the work before it has time to bear fruit.

660
00:40:39,890 --> 00:40:44,830
But before I tell you the technique itself, my friend, there is a specific signal you must

661
00:40:44,830 --> 00:40:45,850
learn to recognize.

662
00:40:46,230 --> 00:40:51,450
A signal that tells you whether your assumption has taken root in consciousness or remains merely

663
00:40:51,450 --> 00:40:52,350
wishful thinking.

664
00:40:52,350 --> 00:40:57,030
Without recognizing this signal, you will not know if you are working with the law or against

665
00:40:57,030 --> 00:40:57,290
it.

666
00:40:57,650 --> 00:41:01,650
I will give you that signal in just a moment for it determines whether your morning work

667
00:41:01,650 --> 00:41:03,790
transforms your world or leaves it unchanged.

668
00:41:04,310 --> 00:41:05,110
Listen carefully.

669
00:41:05,110 --> 00:41:09,350
I will tell you of a woman who came to me through correspondence in 1957.

670
00:41:10,070 --> 00:41:14,130
She had been divorced for three years and desired remarriage to a specific man.

671
00:41:14,570 --> 00:41:17,670
A man who she wrote showed no interest in her whatsoever.

672
00:41:18,250 --> 00:41:21,370
She had been practicing what she called revision for eight months.

673
00:41:21,810 --> 00:41:24,850
Eight months, my friend, with no change in her circumstances.

674
00:41:25,370 --> 00:41:29,730
When I examined her method, I discovered she revised twice a week when she remembered.

675
00:41:30,310 --> 00:41:34,850
Sometimes for five minutes, sometimes for an hour, sometimes in the evening, sometimes

676
00:41:34,850 --> 00:41:37,170
upon waking, sometimes in the afternoon.

677
00:41:37,530 --> 00:41:40,050
No system, no discipline, no precision.

678
00:41:40,410 --> 00:41:45,050
At first she resisted when I told her she must revise for exactly 20 minutes each morning

679
00:41:45,050 --> 00:41:46,530
at exactly the same time.

680
00:41:46,970 --> 00:41:48,990
She said her schedule would not permit it.

681
00:41:49,070 --> 00:41:51,350
She said 20 minutes was too long to concentrate.

682
00:41:51,850 --> 00:41:53,890
She said she preferred her flexible approach.

683
00:41:54,330 --> 00:41:57,850
I told her plainly, the law responds to precision, not preference.

684
00:41:58,270 --> 00:42:03,510
I told her to choose 20 minutes between 6 and 8 each morning and guard those minutes as

685
00:42:03,510 --> 00:42:03,850
sacred.

686
00:42:03,850 --> 00:42:09,230
I told her to sit in the same chair, enter that drowsy state and revise not just one event but

687
00:42:09,230 --> 00:42:11,830
the entire previous day into what it should have been.

688
00:42:12,870 --> 00:42:14,810
She wrote back that this seemed excessive.

689
00:42:15,030 --> 00:42:16,750
One event she felt was sufficient.

690
00:42:17,230 --> 00:42:21,410
Why revise an entire day when only one interaction with this man mattered?

691
00:42:21,950 --> 00:42:25,270
You have heard me speak of revision and many have misunderstood me.

692
00:42:25,370 --> 00:42:26,110
Let me be plain.

693
00:42:26,510 --> 00:42:28,650
We do not revise individual events.

694
00:42:28,790 --> 00:42:31,610
We revise the consciousness that created those events.

695
00:42:31,610 --> 00:42:36,990
When you revise systematically, when you reshape day after day in imagination, you are not

696
00:42:36,990 --> 00:42:42,370
changing circumstances, you are changing yourself and when you change your world must change to reflect

697
00:42:42,370 --> 00:42:43,370
your new state of being.

698
00:42:43,370 --> 00:42:47,750
I convinced her to attempt the full practice for exactly three weeks.

699
00:42:47,750 --> 00:42:53,130
Every morning at 7 she would sit in her bedroom chair and spend 20 minutes revising the previous

700
00:42:53,130 --> 00:43:00,010
day, not just her encounters with this man but every conversation, every interaction, every moment into its ideal form.

701
00:43:00,730 --> 00:43:04,050
The first week she reported felt mechanical, even foolish.

702
00:43:04,430 --> 00:43:05,890
The second week brought doubt.

703
00:43:06,590 --> 00:43:10,750
No change in her outer circumstances, no sign that her work was bearing fruit.

704
00:43:10,750 --> 00:43:13,110
I told her what I tell you now.

705
00:43:13,350 --> 00:43:17,010
The seed that is planted in the ground shows no sign of growth for days.

706
00:43:17,670 --> 00:43:20,630
Yet beneath the surface invisible processes are at work.

707
00:43:20,910 --> 00:43:22,670
In the third week everything shifted.

708
00:43:22,850 --> 00:43:25,410
The man began calling, began suggesting meetings.

709
00:43:25,590 --> 00:43:30,290
By the end of that week he had proposed, not gradually, not after months of courtship, but

710
00:43:30,290 --> 00:43:35,250
suddenly, as though a switch had been turned in his consciousness, as though her revised

711
00:43:35,250 --> 00:43:39,610
version of their relationship had become more real to him than their actual history.

712
00:43:39,610 --> 00:43:41,790
And here was the signal I promised you.

713
00:43:41,890 --> 00:43:46,430
In that third week she wrote to me something remarkable had happened to her morning practice.

714
00:43:46,970 --> 00:43:49,710
The revised events no longer felt like imagination.

715
00:43:50,390 --> 00:43:53,670
They felt like memory, more real than what had actually occurred.

716
00:43:54,050 --> 00:43:55,490
This is the signal, my friend.

717
00:43:55,890 --> 00:44:00,550
When your revision feels more natural than the original event, when the corrected version becomes

718
00:44:00,550 --> 00:44:04,370
your true memory, then you know the assumption has taken root in consciousness.

719
00:44:04,910 --> 00:44:07,690
This is the power of systematic morning revision.

720
00:44:07,690 --> 00:44:10,670
You are not merely correcting yesterday's events.

721
00:44:11,050 --> 00:44:15,910
You are impressing upon the creative power of consciousness a new pattern, a new assumption

722
00:44:15,910 --> 00:44:18,910
about who you are and how your world responds to you.

723
00:44:19,250 --> 00:44:21,030
Now hold this thought, my friend.

724
00:44:21,370 --> 00:44:26,050
I will give you the application in a moment, but first you must understand why twenty minutes,

725
00:44:26,250 --> 00:44:27,450
no more, no less.

726
00:44:28,050 --> 00:44:33,330
The conscious mind can maintain creative attention for approximately twenty minutes before it begins

727
00:44:33,330 --> 00:44:37,170
to waver, less than twenty minutes, and the impression is too shallow to take root.

728
00:44:37,810 --> 00:44:41,610
More than twenty minutes, and you begin to work with effort instead of ease.

729
00:44:41,730 --> 00:44:46,850
The moment effort enters, you have moved from assumption into wishing, and wishes, as I have

730
00:44:46,850 --> 00:44:48,850
told you before, are confessions of lack.

731
00:44:49,110 --> 00:44:53,790
Twenty minutes allows you to enter that drowsy state, maintain it, and work within it without

732
00:44:53,790 --> 00:44:54,230
strain.

733
00:44:54,690 --> 00:44:58,910
Twenty minutes allows you to revise thoroughly without exhausting the creative faculty.

734
00:44:58,910 --> 00:45:04,810
Twenty minutes practice consistently will revolutionize your world faster than hours of sporadic effort.

735
00:45:05,150 --> 00:45:07,170
Now I must insist on this, my friend.

736
00:45:07,610 --> 00:45:08,650
This is not concentration.

737
00:45:09,050 --> 00:45:11,410
This is not visualization in the ordinary sense.

738
00:45:11,790 --> 00:45:12,550
This is assumption.

739
00:45:12,750 --> 00:45:16,050
This is living mentally in the corrected version until it feels natural.

740
00:45:16,610 --> 00:45:20,130
Do not let anyone, including yourself, talk you out of this distinction.

741
00:45:20,810 --> 00:45:23,570
Now I must tell you something most teachers will not.

742
00:45:23,570 --> 00:45:28,530
There is a specific moment within those twenty minutes when the assumption either hardens into

743
00:45:28,530 --> 00:45:31,210
fact or evaporates into wishful thinking.

744
00:45:31,750 --> 00:45:35,490
Miss this moment and your revision remains merely pleasant daydreaming.

745
00:45:35,930 --> 00:45:40,090
Catch this moment and you command the creative power of consciousness itself.

746
00:45:40,570 --> 00:45:45,910
I will tell you that moment next, and it changes everything about how you approach the morning work.

747
00:45:46,130 --> 00:45:50,830
Remember what I told you a few moments ago about changing consciousness, not circumstances.

748
00:45:51,330 --> 00:45:52,730
Now this is where you see why.

749
00:45:52,730 --> 00:45:59,670
I recall a gentleman who attended my lectures in Los Angeles in 1962, a businessman who had

750
00:45:59,670 --> 00:46:03,030
been struggling with a particular client relationship for over a year.

751
00:46:03,290 --> 00:46:07,790
This client, he told me, was hostile, demanding, impossible to satisfy.

752
00:46:08,270 --> 00:46:13,070
Every interaction left him frustrated and his business relationship deteriorated further.

753
00:46:13,410 --> 00:46:18,170
He began the morning revision practice, spending twenty minutes each day revising his encounters

754
00:46:18,170 --> 00:46:19,010
with this client.

755
00:46:19,010 --> 00:46:21,950
Instead of hostility, he imagined courtesy.

756
00:46:21,950 --> 00:46:24,950
Instead of demands, he imagined appreciation.

757
00:46:24,950 --> 00:46:29,910
Instead of conflict, he imagined mutual respect and profitable collaboration.

758
00:46:30,570 --> 00:46:32,490
At first he found this difficult.

759
00:46:33,050 --> 00:46:37,950
The actual relationship was so contentious that imagining its opposite felt false.

760
00:46:37,950 --> 00:46:42,990
He would sit in his chair and attempt the revision, but his mind would immediately return to the

761
00:46:42,990 --> 00:46:45,790
reality of how difficult this client truly was.

762
00:46:46,290 --> 00:46:49,430
This is the critical point where most abandon the work.

763
00:46:49,830 --> 00:46:54,330
They attempt revision but cannot maintain the feeling of the revised version because the

764
00:46:54,330 --> 00:46:56,110
outer facts seem too contrary.

765
00:46:56,630 --> 00:46:59,130
They forget that we are not trying to change facts.

766
00:46:59,130 --> 00:47:02,890
We are changing the consciousness that perceives and creates those facts.

767
00:47:03,150 --> 00:47:04,310
I told him to persist.

768
00:47:04,850 --> 00:47:08,070
I told him that the feeling of naturalness would come with practice.

769
00:47:08,830 --> 00:47:13,630
Just as a new suit feels strange until you have worn it several times, the revised version

770
00:47:13,630 --> 00:47:19,110
of any relationship will feel unnatural until you have lived in it repeatedly in imagination.

771
00:47:19,110 --> 00:47:23,690
By the second week of practice, he reported that the revision was becoming easier.

772
00:47:23,890 --> 00:47:28,310
He could maintain the feeling of pleasant collaboration with this client for the full 20 minutes.

773
00:47:28,890 --> 00:47:31,870
By the third week, he said something remarkable had occurred.

774
00:47:32,550 --> 00:47:36,810
He had begun to forget which interactions had actually happened and which he had revised.

775
00:47:36,990 --> 00:47:40,330
The revised version felt more real to him than the original events.

776
00:47:40,710 --> 00:47:44,310
And then in the fourth week, the client's behavior began to mirror the revision.

777
00:47:44,310 --> 00:47:45,990
Phone calls became cordial.

778
00:47:46,470 --> 00:47:47,990
Demands became requests.

779
00:47:48,370 --> 00:47:51,930
Hostility gave way to genuine appreciation for his services.

780
00:47:52,490 --> 00:47:56,850
Within a month, this client had become one of his most valued business relationships.

781
00:47:57,230 --> 00:47:58,770
The client had not changed.

782
00:47:59,150 --> 00:48:02,130
The businessman had changed his assumption about the client.

783
00:48:02,470 --> 00:48:05,090
And the outer world conformed to his inner conviction.

784
00:48:05,530 --> 00:48:07,350
And here is the moment I promised you.

785
00:48:07,670 --> 00:48:12,790
It came for him as it comes for all who practice correctly at the end of each 20-minute session.

786
00:48:12,790 --> 00:48:16,890
Just before rising from his chair, he would feel a sense of satisfaction.

787
00:48:17,370 --> 00:48:21,590
Not hope for the future, but satisfaction with what had already been accomplished.

788
00:48:22,090 --> 00:48:27,170
This is the moment, my friend, when revision moves from imagination to satisfaction.

789
00:48:27,170 --> 00:48:32,210
When you feel the naturalness of the wish fulfilled rather than the effort of trying to manifest it,

790
00:48:32,510 --> 00:48:35,750
then you know the assumption has impressed itself upon consciousness.

791
00:48:36,550 --> 00:48:40,170
This is what I mean when I tell you that the world is yourself pushed out.

792
00:48:40,170 --> 00:48:45,670
Change your conception of any person, any situation, any circumstance through systematic revision.

793
00:48:46,210 --> 00:48:50,490
And that person, situation or circumstance must change to match your new assumption.

794
00:48:51,050 --> 00:48:55,230
But before I tell you how to apply this tonight, I must address one thing more.

795
00:48:55,730 --> 00:48:57,070
The question of persistence.

796
00:48:57,070 --> 00:49:03,030
Most who begin this practice abandon it within days because they do not see immediate results.

797
00:49:03,710 --> 00:49:08,970
They practice for three days, see no change in their circumstances, and conclude the method does not work.

798
00:49:09,530 --> 00:49:10,930
Make no mistake about this.

799
00:49:11,010 --> 00:49:12,470
The law always works.

800
00:49:12,690 --> 00:49:13,010
Always.

801
00:49:13,510 --> 00:49:17,410
But it works according to its own timing, not according to your impatience.

802
00:49:17,650 --> 00:49:21,630
The world will tell you that three weeks is too long to wait for results.

803
00:49:21,630 --> 00:49:25,330
They will tell you that real manifestation should happen instantly.

804
00:49:25,870 --> 00:49:26,970
I tell you they are wrong.

805
00:49:27,410 --> 00:49:32,150
I have observed that sustained assumptions take exactly three weeks to harden into fact.

806
00:49:32,550 --> 00:49:36,430
Three weeks of consistent daily impression upon the subconscious mind.

807
00:49:36,890 --> 00:49:40,050
Three weeks of feeling the naturalness of the revised condition.

808
00:49:40,470 --> 00:49:42,970
Three weeks of living mentally in the end result.

809
00:49:43,270 --> 00:49:44,550
This is why most fail.

810
00:49:44,970 --> 00:49:48,530
They give the law three days and expect three weeks worth of results.

811
00:49:48,530 --> 00:49:52,090
They practice casually and expect consistent results.

812
00:49:52,870 --> 00:49:56,570
They revise occasionally and wonder why their world remains unchanged.

813
00:49:56,890 --> 00:50:01,370
The creative power of consciousness responds to persistence, not sporadic effort.

814
00:50:01,930 --> 00:50:03,750
It responds to feeling, not thinking.

815
00:50:04,270 --> 00:50:06,090
It responds to assumption, not hope.

816
00:50:06,390 --> 00:50:10,930
Those who practice morning revision for exactly three weeks, without missing a single day,

817
00:50:11,030 --> 00:50:13,870
without shortening the time, without altering the method,

818
00:50:13,870 --> 00:50:18,830
those people witness what can only be called miraculous changes in their circumstances.

819
00:50:19,030 --> 00:50:28,350
Before I tell you how to apply this tonight, there is one final piece that separates those who see their world respond in three weeks from those who practice for months with no result.

820
00:50:28,870 --> 00:50:34,430
It concerns what your consciousness is doing the very moment you wake, before you even open your eyes.

821
00:50:34,990 --> 00:50:38,850
Miss this piece and your morning revision fights against your natural state.

822
00:50:38,850 --> 00:50:44,650
Master it and your revision works with the creative power from the first moment of practice.

823
00:50:45,150 --> 00:50:46,530
I must address this now.

824
00:50:46,810 --> 00:50:49,030
Remember that precision I spoke of earlier.

825
00:50:49,610 --> 00:50:51,210
Here is where it matters most.

826
00:50:51,610 --> 00:50:56,670
The moment you wake, before your feet touch the floor, before you engage with any demand of the day,

827
00:50:56,770 --> 00:50:59,210
your consciousness is in its most creative state.

828
00:50:59,570 --> 00:51:04,190
This is when you must begin your work, not after coffee, not after reading the morning news,

829
00:51:04,270 --> 00:51:07,290
but in those first moments when consciousness is fresh from sleep.

830
00:51:07,290 --> 00:51:11,510
Now, tonight when you retire, do nothing different, sleep naturally.

831
00:51:11,930 --> 00:51:17,410
But tomorrow morning, before you engage with the world, before you read the news or attend to correspondence,

832
00:51:17,630 --> 00:51:18,870
you will begin this practice.

833
00:51:19,590 --> 00:51:21,050
First, you will choose your time.

834
00:51:21,530 --> 00:51:26,650
Between 6 and 8 in the morning is ideal, but choose the 20 minutes that you can guard consistently.

835
00:51:27,130 --> 00:51:30,150
Second, you will sit comfortably in the same chair each morning.

836
00:51:30,670 --> 00:51:33,250
This creates a physical anchor for the mental work.

837
00:51:33,250 --> 00:51:40,110
Third, you will allow yourself to enter that drowsy state, that state akin to sleep where the conscious mind relaxes its guard.

838
00:51:40,510 --> 00:51:43,410
Fourth, in that creative state you will begin to revise.

839
00:51:43,970 --> 00:51:45,010
Start with yesterday.

840
00:51:45,170 --> 00:51:49,710
Take the first interaction or event that did not satisfy you and revise it in imagination.

841
00:51:50,430 --> 00:51:52,910
See it unfolding as you would have liked it to unfold.

842
00:51:53,310 --> 00:51:55,090
Hear the words that should have been spoken.

843
00:51:55,590 --> 00:51:57,790
Feel the satisfaction of the corrected version.

844
00:51:57,790 --> 00:52:01,650
Then move to the next event requiring revision, then the next.

845
00:52:01,890 --> 00:52:03,810
Do not strain to visualize clearly.

846
00:52:03,970 --> 00:52:05,130
Do not work with effort.

847
00:52:05,570 --> 00:52:09,730
Simply assume the feeling of the wish fulfilled regarding each revised event.

848
00:52:10,190 --> 00:52:13,710
Live in the corrected version until it feels natural, then move on.

849
00:52:14,010 --> 00:52:16,550
Continue this process for exactly 20 minutes.

850
00:52:17,070 --> 00:52:20,210
When the time concludes, rise from your chair and begin your day.

851
00:52:20,730 --> 00:52:22,570
Do not analyze what you have done.

852
00:52:22,670 --> 00:52:24,110
Do not wonder if it worked.

853
00:52:24,230 --> 00:52:25,990
Do not look for immediate signs.

854
00:52:25,990 --> 00:52:29,150
Simply trust the law and continue the practice.

855
00:52:29,610 --> 00:52:32,670
You will find that within days the revision becomes easier.

856
00:52:33,110 --> 00:52:37,550
Within weeks the revised versions begin to feel more real than the original events.

857
00:52:37,970 --> 00:52:44,450
Within 3 weeks your world will begin to reflect the pattern you have been impressing upon consciousness through your daily practice.

858
00:52:44,830 --> 00:52:50,530
Some of you will be tempted to revise for longer periods, thinking more time will produce faster results.

859
00:52:50,690 --> 00:52:51,430
This is an error.

860
00:52:51,430 --> 00:52:55,350
20 minutes allows you to work in that creative state without effort.

861
00:52:55,350 --> 00:53:00,590
Longer periods lead to mental fatigue and forced concentration which defeats the purpose.

862
00:53:00,970 --> 00:53:05,950
Others will be tempted to skip days when circumstances seem pleasant when nothing requires revision.

863
00:53:06,490 --> 00:53:07,490
This too is an error.

864
00:53:07,910 --> 00:53:13,230
The purpose is not merely to correct unpleasant events but to establish a new pattern of consciousness.

865
00:53:13,230 --> 00:53:16,850
Consistency in practice creates consistency in results.

866
00:53:16,850 --> 00:53:22,230
Still others will begin this work and then abandon it when they do not see changes within the first week.

867
00:53:22,630 --> 00:53:25,410
They forget that every seed requires time to sprout.

868
00:53:25,590 --> 00:53:28,590
Every assumption requires time to harden into fact.

869
00:53:28,590 --> 00:53:34,930
Three weeks give the law three weeks of consistent application and you will never doubt its power again.

870
00:53:35,670 --> 00:53:41,830
I have seen this method transform marriages, businesses, health, relationships and circumstances that seemed hopeless.

871
00:53:41,830 --> 00:53:48,210
I have seen it work for those who could barely visualize and for those who considered themselves expert at mental work.

872
00:53:48,510 --> 00:53:51,650
I have seen it succeed where years of other methods had failed.

873
00:53:51,990 --> 00:53:55,270
But I have never seen it work for those who practice sporadically.

874
00:53:55,430 --> 00:53:59,190
I have never seen it work for those who change the method to suit their preferences.

875
00:53:59,190 --> 00:54:03,990
I have never seen it work for those who abandon it before the three weeks conclude.

876
00:54:04,710 --> 00:54:06,250
The choice, my friend, is yours.

877
00:54:06,910 --> 00:54:13,350
You can continue revising casually occasionally when you remember and continue receiving casual occasional results.

878
00:54:13,750 --> 00:54:18,670
Or you can give this law the precision it deserves and witness the transformation of your entire world.

879
00:54:19,190 --> 00:54:24,950
Twenty minutes each morning, the same time, the same chair, the same method, for three weeks without exception.

880
00:54:25,390 --> 00:54:27,090
This is the price of a changed world.

881
00:54:27,090 --> 00:54:31,450
This is the discipline that purchases freedom from unwanted circumstances.

882
00:54:32,070 --> 00:54:35,290
And I tell you now what I have told audiences for decades.

883
00:54:35,710 --> 00:54:41,530
The moment you make this commitment, the moment you decide to give the law three weeks of consistent application,

884
00:54:42,010 --> 00:54:46,930
you will know within yourself that your circumstances must change, not because you hope they will,

885
00:54:47,270 --> 00:54:49,450
because you have assumed they already have.

886
00:54:49,890 --> 00:54:54,670
And now I tell you, my friend, I tell you the secret you have just heard is not a secret at all.

887
00:54:54,670 --> 00:54:58,070
It has been hiding in plain sight in every sentence I have spoken.

888
00:54:58,510 --> 00:54:59,990
You are not practicing a technique.

889
00:55:00,130 --> 00:55:03,050
You are entering a state, the state of the wish fulfilled.

890
00:55:03,530 --> 00:55:08,330
And from that creative state, consciousness creates without effort, without strain, without doubt.

891
00:55:08,810 --> 00:55:13,670
The morning mind, fresh from sleep, slips into this state as naturally as water flows downhill.

892
00:55:13,670 --> 00:55:18,710
This is why twenty minutes in the morning accomplishes what hours of evening work cannot.

893
00:55:19,410 --> 00:55:22,930
You are working with the creative power at its most receptive moment.

894
00:55:23,170 --> 00:55:29,690
Tomorrow morning try this once, just once, sit quietly for twenty minutes and revise yesterday into what it should have been.

895
00:55:30,090 --> 00:55:33,330
Feel the satisfaction of the corrected version, that is all.

896
00:55:33,330 --> 00:55:41,690
You may find that consciousness begins its perfect work immediately, or you may find that the assumption must be persisted in for days or weeks.

897
00:55:42,050 --> 00:55:44,770
Both are well, my friend, both are the law in operation.

898
00:55:45,250 --> 00:55:49,630
Remember always what I have told you tonight, the world is yourself pushed out.

899
00:55:50,250 --> 00:55:52,030
Consciousness is the only reality.

900
00:55:52,590 --> 00:55:54,150
Imagining creates reality.

901
00:55:54,490 --> 00:55:59,430
What you assume in the silence of your morning chair, the world must reflect back to you as fact.

902
00:55:59,430 --> 00:56:02,850
Twenty minutes, every morning, for three weeks.

903
00:56:03,350 --> 00:56:06,890
Give the law this precision and it will give you a transformed world.

904
00:56:07,150 --> 00:56:10,830
May you wake tomorrow ready to assume the feeling of your wish fulfilled.

905
00:56:11,370 --> 00:56:15,890
May your morning revision become the foundation of a life beyond your current imagination.

906
00:56:16,470 --> 00:56:19,550
May consciousness reveal to you its infinite power to create.

907
00:56:19,990 --> 00:56:22,370
And until we meet again, my friend, live in the end.

908
00:56:22,850 --> 00:56:36,960
There came to me last week a man who had been applying what he called my technique for over a year.

909
00:56:37,780 --> 00:56:39,400
He had visualized wealth.

910
00:56:39,900 --> 00:56:41,260
He had written affirmations.

911
00:56:41,440 --> 00:56:45,900
He had created, as he said, a vision of abundance in his mind every single day.

912
00:56:46,120 --> 00:56:48,500
And yet his bank account remained unchanged.

913
00:56:48,720 --> 00:56:49,600
He was exhausted.

914
00:56:50,080 --> 00:56:51,260
He felt he had failed.

915
00:56:51,900 --> 00:56:54,140
But I tell you tonight, he had not failed.

916
00:56:54,480 --> 00:56:56,960
He had never actually applied the law at all.

917
00:56:57,540 --> 00:57:00,300
What he had done feels to most people like work.

918
00:57:00,300 --> 00:57:03,020
What I will show you tonight feels like cheating.

919
00:57:03,760 --> 00:57:05,980
And that is precisely why it works.

920
00:57:06,540 --> 00:57:07,900
Listen carefully, my friend.

921
00:57:08,320 --> 00:57:11,520
The technique I am about to describe will offend your reason.

922
00:57:11,860 --> 00:57:13,060
It will seem too simple.

923
00:57:13,560 --> 00:57:16,660
It will seem dishonest as though you are lying to yourself.

924
00:57:17,240 --> 00:57:21,740
But an assumption though false, if persisted in, will harden into fact.

925
00:57:22,120 --> 00:57:25,240
Most of you hearing me now have been working to get wealth.

926
00:57:25,540 --> 00:57:28,000
Tonight I will show you how to work from wealth.

927
00:57:28,000 --> 00:57:29,120
There is a difference.

928
00:57:29,700 --> 00:57:31,160
And that difference is everything.

929
00:57:32,160 --> 00:57:35,500
Now why do I say this man never applied the law at all?

930
00:57:35,680 --> 00:57:39,280
Because everything he did began from the premise that he lacked money.

931
00:57:39,940 --> 00:57:42,940
Every visualization, every affirmation, every effort.

932
00:57:43,260 --> 00:57:45,460
He was trying to get what he did not have.

933
00:57:45,640 --> 00:57:48,160
And so in consciousness he affirmed lack.

934
00:57:48,820 --> 00:57:50,820
The world is yourself pushed out.

935
00:57:51,180 --> 00:57:55,120
If you are conscious of lacking, the world must reflect that lack back to you.

936
00:57:55,120 --> 00:57:56,840
It can do nothing else.

937
00:57:57,320 --> 00:58:01,080
The technique I will show you tonight begins from an entirely different premise.

938
00:58:01,820 --> 00:58:03,240
You do not try to get wealth.

939
00:58:03,500 --> 00:58:05,260
You assume you already have it.

940
00:58:05,640 --> 00:58:07,520
And this my friend feels like cheating.

941
00:58:07,780 --> 00:58:08,880
It feels dishonest.

942
00:58:09,260 --> 00:58:11,280
It feels as though you are lying to yourself.

943
00:58:11,980 --> 00:58:13,400
But let me ask you this.

944
00:58:13,860 --> 00:58:16,960
When you sit in a chair, do you doubt the chair will hold you?

945
00:58:17,520 --> 00:58:17,860
No.

946
00:58:18,200 --> 00:58:19,140
You simply sit.

947
00:58:19,340 --> 00:58:20,220
That is assumption.

948
00:58:20,220 --> 00:58:23,180
You assume the chair supports you and it does.

949
00:58:23,300 --> 00:58:24,080
You do not effort.

950
00:58:24,240 --> 00:58:25,040
You do not strain.

951
00:58:25,480 --> 00:58:26,440
You simply assume.

952
00:58:26,740 --> 00:58:28,880
Now apply this same principle to money.

953
00:58:29,500 --> 00:58:30,560
Assume you have it.

954
00:58:30,820 --> 00:58:31,440
Not tomorrow.

955
00:58:31,860 --> 00:58:33,440
Not when conditions change.

956
00:58:33,820 --> 00:58:34,160
Now.

957
00:58:34,860 --> 00:58:38,840
Assume it with the same naturalness with which you assume the chair beneath you.

958
00:58:39,160 --> 00:58:42,920
And persist in that assumption until the outer world conforms.

959
00:58:43,380 --> 00:58:44,340
This is the law.

960
00:58:44,760 --> 00:58:46,440
Consciousness is the only reality.

961
00:58:47,060 --> 00:58:50,520
Money is not a thing outside of you that you must chase or attract.

962
00:58:51,020 --> 00:58:52,760
Money is a state of consciousness.

963
00:58:52,980 --> 00:58:53,860
Make no mistake.

964
00:58:54,440 --> 00:58:57,140
Most people will reject this the moment they hear it.

965
00:58:57,560 --> 00:58:59,680
They will say, but Neville, I have bills to pay.

966
00:58:59,780 --> 00:59:00,420
I have debts.

967
00:59:00,560 --> 00:59:04,240
I cannot simply pretend I am wealthy when my bank account is empty.

968
00:59:04,740 --> 00:59:07,620
And to them I say, you have misunderstood me entirely.

969
00:59:07,940 --> 00:59:09,680
I am not asking you to pretend.

970
00:59:09,680 --> 00:59:11,440
I am asking you to assume.

971
00:59:12,360 --> 00:59:13,700
There is a vast difference.

972
00:59:13,700 --> 00:59:14,920
Pretense is surface.

973
00:59:15,200 --> 00:59:17,980
Pretense is the mind saying words it does not believe.

974
00:59:18,160 --> 00:59:19,300
Assumption is depth.

975
00:59:19,560 --> 00:59:26,060
Assumption is consciousness inhabiting a state and remaining there until that state externalizes as fact.

976
00:59:26,560 --> 00:59:31,400
When I say assume you are wealthy, I mean enter the state of wealth in your consciousness.

977
00:59:31,960 --> 00:59:33,800
Feel as a wealthy person feels.

978
00:59:34,220 --> 00:59:35,220
Not hope to feel.

979
00:59:35,560 --> 00:59:36,520
Not wish to feel.

980
00:59:36,860 --> 00:59:37,160
Feel.

981
00:59:37,400 --> 00:59:37,780
Now.

982
00:59:38,120 --> 00:59:39,640
But hold this thought, my friend.

983
00:59:39,640 --> 00:59:48,840
There is a specific signal, a feeling you must learn to recognize that tells you whether the assumption has actually taken root or whether you are merely pretending.

984
00:59:49,380 --> 00:59:53,400
Without that signal, you will practice this technique and wonder why nothing changes.

985
00:59:53,400 --> 00:59:58,140
I will give you that signal in just a moment after I show you where most go wrong.

986
00:59:58,140 --> 01:00:03,720
Let me tell you of a woman who came to me many years ago when I was lecturing in New York.

987
01:00:04,040 --> 01:00:06,360
She had been widowed and left with very little.

988
01:00:06,780 --> 01:00:07,960
She had two young children.

989
01:00:08,440 --> 01:00:10,880
She told me she had been praying for money for months.

990
01:00:11,300 --> 01:00:13,680
She had visualized checks arriving in the mail.

991
01:00:14,060 --> 01:00:17,720
She had written out affirmations on cards and read them aloud each morning.

992
01:00:18,060 --> 01:00:19,580
And yet nothing had changed.

993
01:00:19,920 --> 01:00:21,600
She was exhausted from the effort.

994
01:00:21,600 --> 01:00:25,300
She felt she had failed God, failed herself, failed her children.

995
01:00:25,740 --> 01:00:27,080
I asked her one question.

996
01:00:27,480 --> 01:00:30,200
I said, when you visualize the check, how do you feel?

997
01:00:30,560 --> 01:00:31,220
She paused.

998
01:00:31,400 --> 01:00:33,100
Then she said, I feel desperate.

999
01:00:33,260 --> 01:00:34,800
I feel I need it so badly.

1000
01:00:35,260 --> 01:00:36,560
There you see was the error.

1001
01:00:36,960 --> 01:00:39,120
She was visualizing from the state of need.

1002
01:00:39,420 --> 01:00:40,520
And need is lack.

1003
01:00:41,100 --> 01:00:42,520
Lack perpetuates lack.

1004
01:00:42,980 --> 01:00:45,460
I told her to stop visualizing entirely.

1005
01:00:45,620 --> 01:00:47,140
I told her to stop affirming.

1006
01:00:47,580 --> 01:00:49,700
She looked at me as though I had lost my reason.

1007
01:00:49,700 --> 01:00:52,940
She said, but Neville, if I stop doing these things, what will I do?

1008
01:00:53,340 --> 01:00:54,640
I said, you will assume.

1009
01:00:55,000 --> 01:00:56,220
She did not understand.

1010
01:00:56,620 --> 01:00:57,960
At first, she resisted.

1011
01:00:58,040 --> 01:00:59,600
She said, it could not be that simple.

1012
01:00:59,940 --> 01:01:01,080
But I persisted.

1013
01:01:01,140 --> 01:01:04,040
I instructed her to go home that night and lie in her bed.

1014
01:01:04,580 --> 01:01:09,860
I told her to enter the drowsy state, that state akin to sleep just before you lose consciousness.

1015
01:01:10,440 --> 01:01:15,640
And from that state, I told her to assume she already had the money she needed, not to beg

1016
01:01:15,640 --> 01:01:21,080
for it, not to visualize it coming, but to feel the relief of already having it, to feel

1017
01:01:21,080 --> 01:01:26,480
the calm certainty that her children were provided for, to feel financially secure, and then

1018
01:01:26,480 --> 01:01:28,140
in that feeling to fall asleep.

1019
01:01:28,940 --> 01:01:30,740
She came back to me two weeks later.

1020
01:01:31,120 --> 01:01:32,940
She had done exactly as I instructed.

1021
01:01:33,500 --> 01:01:38,180
And within those two weeks, a distant cousin she had not heard from in years contacted her.

1022
01:01:38,180 --> 01:01:42,900
However, this cousin had recently sold a piece of property and felt, as he said, impressed

1023
01:01:42,900 --> 01:01:44,960
to send her a portion of the proceeds.

1024
01:01:45,340 --> 01:01:47,280
It was more than enough to meet her need.

1025
01:01:47,620 --> 01:01:49,060
She had not manipulated him.

1026
01:01:49,160 --> 01:01:50,480
She had not contacted him.

1027
01:01:50,820 --> 01:01:55,020
She had simply assumed the state of wealth, and the bridge of incidents was constructed

1028
01:01:55,020 --> 01:01:56,480
without her conscious effort.

1029
01:01:56,740 --> 01:01:59,160
You see, my friend, she did not create the means.

1030
01:01:59,640 --> 01:02:02,280
She assumed the end, and the means appeared.

1031
01:02:02,860 --> 01:02:05,300
This is what I mean when I say it feels like cheating.

1032
01:02:05,620 --> 01:02:07,300
She did nothing in the outer world.

1033
01:02:07,300 --> 01:02:08,560
She did not labor.

1034
01:02:08,800 --> 01:02:09,740
She did not scheme.

1035
01:02:10,380 --> 01:02:14,120
She simply rested in a state of consciousness, and the Lord did the work.

1036
01:02:14,420 --> 01:02:17,700
Now you may ask, what is this state of consciousness I speak of?

1037
01:02:17,960 --> 01:02:18,820
Let me be clear.

1038
01:02:19,420 --> 01:02:20,900
Consciousness is not your thinking.

1039
01:02:21,280 --> 01:02:22,380
It is not your wishing.

1040
01:02:22,740 --> 01:02:23,880
It is not your hoping.

1041
01:02:24,540 --> 01:02:26,660
Consciousness is what you are aware of being.

1042
01:02:27,400 --> 01:02:29,440
Right now, what are you conscious of being?

1043
01:02:29,840 --> 01:02:32,220
Are you conscious of being someone who lacks money?

1044
01:02:32,460 --> 01:02:35,000
Or are you conscious of being someone who has money?

1045
01:02:35,320 --> 01:02:36,660
Not what you hope to be.

1046
01:02:36,660 --> 01:02:42,240
What you are conscious of being now, the world reflects your state of consciousness, not your

1047
01:02:42,240 --> 01:02:42,620
wishes.

1048
01:02:43,360 --> 01:02:48,080
I have told you before but I will tell you again, the world is yourself pushed out.

1049
01:02:48,620 --> 01:02:50,500
What you are conscious of being you are.

1050
01:02:50,960 --> 01:02:53,360
Change your consciousness and you change your world.

1051
01:02:53,360 --> 01:02:56,420
It is as simple and as difficult as that.

1052
01:02:56,420 --> 01:03:02,700
Now I must insist on this my friend because I have seen too many who claim to apply the law and yet

1053
01:03:02,700 --> 01:03:03,700
they do not.

1054
01:03:03,700 --> 01:03:06,560
Most people hear this and immediately they begin to effort.

1055
01:03:07,140 --> 01:03:09,420
They try to force themselves to feel wealthy.

1056
01:03:09,660 --> 01:03:10,200
They strain.

1057
01:03:10,620 --> 01:03:12,880
They repeat affirmations they do not believe.

1058
01:03:13,300 --> 01:03:16,500
They create vision boards and stare at them with clenched fists.

1059
01:03:16,880 --> 01:03:19,500
And this my friend is the very opposite of assumption.

1060
01:03:20,040 --> 01:03:24,940
Do not let anyone, including yourself, talk you into believing that effort is required.

1061
01:03:25,660 --> 01:03:27,000
Effort implies lack.

1062
01:03:27,000 --> 01:03:31,600
If you must strain to feel wealthy, you are affirming you are not wealthy.

1063
01:03:32,280 --> 01:03:33,460
Do you see the contradiction?

1064
01:03:33,880 --> 01:03:35,720
Now here is where the lecture turns.

1065
01:03:36,120 --> 01:03:40,620
Most who hear me stop right here in their understanding and miss the deeper truth.

1066
01:03:41,160 --> 01:03:43,560
They understand that assumption is not effort.

1067
01:03:44,040 --> 01:03:47,140
But they do not understand what assumption actually is.

1068
01:03:47,140 --> 01:03:52,480
There is a precise quality to the feeling of assumption and it is this quality that separates

1069
01:03:52,480 --> 01:03:55,180
those who manifest in days from those who never do.

1070
01:03:55,940 --> 01:03:57,740
I will give you that quality now.

1071
01:03:58,320 --> 01:03:59,680
Assumption is effortless.

1072
01:04:00,040 --> 01:04:02,160
When you assume a thing, you rest in it.

1073
01:04:02,460 --> 01:04:04,320
You do not labor to maintain it.

1074
01:04:04,660 --> 01:04:06,440
You simply remain in that state.

1075
01:04:07,040 --> 01:04:09,380
Let me give you an example from my own life.

1076
01:04:09,880 --> 01:04:13,220
When I was a young man in Barbados, I wanted to come to America.

1077
01:04:13,220 --> 01:04:19,200
I had no means, I had no money for passage, I had no connections, but I assumed I was in

1078
01:04:19,200 --> 01:04:19,640
America.

1079
01:04:20,140 --> 01:04:22,580
I did not try to figure out how I would get there.

1080
01:04:22,920 --> 01:04:24,360
I did not scheme or plot.

1081
01:04:24,700 --> 01:04:28,060
I simply assumed in my imagination that I was already here.

1082
01:04:28,580 --> 01:04:31,280
I felt the ground of New York beneath my feet.

1083
01:04:31,760 --> 01:04:33,420
I heard the sounds of the city.

1084
01:04:33,580 --> 01:04:34,920
I inhabited that state.

1085
01:04:35,120 --> 01:04:39,600
And within a short time, my family who had previously refused to help me, suddenly

1086
01:04:39,600 --> 01:04:42,600
and without explanation provided the money for my passage.

1087
01:04:43,260 --> 01:04:44,660
I did not convince them.

1088
01:04:44,720 --> 01:04:45,520
I did not beg.

1089
01:04:45,660 --> 01:04:47,620
I assumed the end and the means appeared.

1090
01:04:47,920 --> 01:04:48,780
This is the law.

1091
01:04:49,040 --> 01:04:51,120
It has never failed me, not once.

1092
01:04:51,400 --> 01:04:56,180
Now I tell you tonight, you can apply this same law to money, but you must understand what

1093
01:04:56,180 --> 01:04:56,680
you are doing.

1094
01:04:56,820 --> 01:04:59,100
You are not trying to manipulate the outer world.

1095
01:04:59,440 --> 01:05:01,720
You are not trying to force conditions to change.

1096
01:05:01,720 --> 01:05:03,880
You are changing your state of consciousness.

1097
01:05:04,360 --> 01:05:07,680
And when you change your state, the outer world must reflect that change.

1098
01:05:07,680 --> 01:05:08,340
It is law.

1099
01:05:09,100 --> 01:05:10,620
Here is what most do wrong.

1100
01:05:10,980 --> 01:05:11,920
They assume once.

1101
01:05:12,040 --> 01:05:13,960
They enter the feeling of wealth for a moment.

1102
01:05:14,380 --> 01:05:17,220
And then they immediately return to the old state of lack.

1103
01:05:17,560 --> 01:05:18,860
They check their bank account.

1104
01:05:18,980 --> 01:05:20,120
They worry about bills.

1105
01:05:20,460 --> 01:05:25,120
They affirm lack a hundred times a day and wonder why one moment of assumption did not

1106
01:05:25,120 --> 01:05:26,000
change their world.

1107
01:05:26,380 --> 01:05:28,740
My friend, assumption must be persisted in.

1108
01:05:28,860 --> 01:05:32,680
An assumption though false, if persisted in, will harden into fact.

1109
01:05:33,060 --> 01:05:34,160
But you must persist.

1110
01:05:34,520 --> 01:05:35,940
The second error is this.

1111
01:05:35,940 --> 01:05:38,900
They assume the wealth and then they test the assumption.

1112
01:05:39,400 --> 01:05:41,320
They look for evidence in the outer world.

1113
01:05:41,480 --> 01:05:45,600
And when they do not see it immediately, they abandon the assumption and return to doubt.

1114
01:05:46,060 --> 01:05:46,940
Do not do this.

1115
01:05:47,060 --> 01:05:47,860
Live from the end.

1116
01:05:48,220 --> 01:05:49,160
Do not look back.

1117
01:05:49,460 --> 01:05:52,680
If you have assumed you are wealthy, then you are wealthy in consciousness.

1118
01:05:52,960 --> 01:05:54,580
The outer world will catch up.

1119
01:05:54,840 --> 01:05:57,020
But you must remain faithful to the state.

1120
01:05:57,640 --> 01:06:01,300
Remember what I told you a few moments ago about that woman who came to me.

1121
01:06:01,300 --> 01:06:02,960
She did not test the law.

1122
01:06:03,340 --> 01:06:06,160
She did not check her mailbox each day looking for the money.

1123
01:06:06,320 --> 01:06:08,460
She simply assumed and the cousin appeared.

1124
01:06:09,020 --> 01:06:12,600
Now this is where you see why faithfulness to the inner state is everything.

1125
01:06:12,880 --> 01:06:16,300
The third error and this is where I see the greatest failure is this.

1126
01:06:16,720 --> 01:06:18,800
They try to dictate how the money will come.

1127
01:06:19,260 --> 01:06:23,720
They assume they will receive a raise or they assume a specific person will give them money.

1128
01:06:24,220 --> 01:06:27,760
And when it does not come through that channel, they believe the law has failed.

1129
01:06:27,760 --> 01:06:32,420
The world will tell you that you must plan, that you must control the means, that you must know

1130
01:06:32,420 --> 01:06:34,220
the how before you can have the end.

1131
01:06:34,620 --> 01:06:36,000
I tell you they are wrong.

1132
01:06:36,120 --> 01:06:38,340
The law does not require you to know the how.

1133
01:06:38,740 --> 01:06:41,240
The law requires only that you assume the end.

1134
01:06:41,340 --> 01:06:42,640
You do not create the means.

1135
01:06:43,000 --> 01:06:45,120
You assume the end and the means will appear.

1136
01:06:45,300 --> 01:06:47,300
I have seen this happen countless times.

1137
01:06:47,720 --> 01:06:51,140
A man assumes wealth and an unexpected inheritance arrives.

1138
01:06:51,500 --> 01:06:56,000
A woman assumes financial security and a business opportunity she never conceived of

1139
01:06:56,000 --> 01:06:56,840
presents itself.

1140
01:06:56,840 --> 01:07:00,980
The law will construct the bridge, but you must not dictate the root.

1141
01:07:01,280 --> 01:07:03,340
Assume the end, only the end.

1142
01:07:04,040 --> 01:07:07,780
Before I tell you how to apply this tonight, there is one final piece.

1143
01:07:08,380 --> 01:07:12,860
It is the piece that separates those who see their world respond in two weeks from those

1144
01:07:12,860 --> 01:07:15,220
who practice for years and see nothing.

1145
01:07:15,660 --> 01:07:20,720
There is a specific time of day, a specific state of mind, when the assumption either takes

1146
01:07:20,720 --> 01:07:23,400
root in the subconscious or evaporates entirely.

1147
01:07:23,400 --> 01:07:27,960
I must show you that moment now, for without it the technique remains theory.

1148
01:07:28,440 --> 01:07:30,520
Now let me tell you how to apply this tonight.

1149
01:07:30,520 --> 01:07:31,920
You need only do this.

1150
01:07:32,300 --> 01:07:37,080
When you retire to your bed this evening, you will enter that drowsy, sleepy state, that

1151
01:07:37,080 --> 01:07:40,040
drowsiness, just before you lose consciousness entirely.

1152
01:07:40,520 --> 01:07:41,540
You know this state.

1153
01:07:41,820 --> 01:07:44,440
In that state, the conscious mind relaxes its grip.

1154
01:07:44,860 --> 01:07:46,520
The subconscious is impressionable.

1155
01:07:46,880 --> 01:07:50,140
And it is in this state that assumption becomes most powerful.

1156
01:07:50,140 --> 01:07:53,040
From that drowsy state, you will do this.

1157
01:07:53,200 --> 01:07:57,180
First, you will bring to mind a scene that implies your wealth is already fulfilled.

1158
01:07:57,700 --> 01:07:59,440
Not a scene of receiving money.

1159
01:07:59,940 --> 01:08:01,940
A scene that implies you already have it.

1160
01:08:02,300 --> 01:08:05,420
You see yourself looking at a bank statement that satisfies you.

1161
01:08:05,920 --> 01:08:08,280
You feel the relief of knowing your bills are paid.

1162
01:08:08,700 --> 01:08:11,960
You simply rest in the calm certainty of financial security.

1163
01:08:12,420 --> 01:08:14,080
Choose one scene, one feeling.

1164
01:08:14,240 --> 01:08:15,400
Do not complicate it.

1165
01:08:15,400 --> 01:08:21,880
Second, you will enter that scene in your imagination, not as an observer, as the one living it.

1166
01:08:22,200 --> 01:08:24,280
Feel it, feel the naturalness of it.

1167
01:08:24,720 --> 01:08:26,420
Do not strain, do not effort.

1168
01:08:26,860 --> 01:08:32,020
Simply rest in the feeling as though it is already true, because in consciousness it is true.

1169
01:08:32,500 --> 01:08:34,940
Third, you will not try to hold the thought.

1170
01:08:35,300 --> 01:08:36,680
You will not grip it tightly.

1171
01:08:37,120 --> 01:08:40,580
You will simply remain in that gentle feeling, that quiet assumption.

1172
01:08:41,080 --> 01:08:44,200
And as you remain in it, you will let yourself drift into sleep.

1173
01:08:44,200 --> 01:08:47,640
You will fall asleep within the assumption of the wish fulfilled.

1174
01:08:48,220 --> 01:08:50,360
And fourth, you will repeat this every night.

1175
01:08:50,860 --> 01:08:52,260
Not once, not twice.

1176
01:08:52,720 --> 01:08:55,480
Every night until the assumption hardens into fact.

1177
01:08:56,280 --> 01:08:57,360
Persistence, my friend.

1178
01:08:57,980 --> 01:08:59,100
Persistence is the key.

1179
01:08:59,640 --> 01:09:01,140
The outer world will conform.

1180
01:09:01,600 --> 01:09:04,100
But you must remain faithful to the inner state.

1181
01:09:04,480 --> 01:09:07,780
Do not check your bank account the next morning to see if it worked.

1182
01:09:08,300 --> 01:09:09,660
Do not test the law.

1183
01:09:10,120 --> 01:09:11,080
Live from the end.

1184
01:09:11,080 --> 01:09:13,920
If you have assumed you are wealthy, then you are wealthy.

1185
01:09:14,420 --> 01:09:15,660
Act from that conviction.

1186
01:09:16,200 --> 01:09:17,440
Feel from that conviction.

1187
01:09:18,000 --> 01:09:20,820
And let the outer world rearrange itself to match.

1188
01:09:21,660 --> 01:09:22,740
This is the technique.

1189
01:09:23,360 --> 01:09:24,340
Simple, is it not?

1190
01:09:24,520 --> 01:09:27,380
And yet I tell you, most who hear me will not do it.

1191
01:09:27,960 --> 01:09:29,420
They will say it is too simple.

1192
01:09:29,840 --> 01:09:31,420
They will say it cannot work.

1193
01:09:31,780 --> 01:09:35,460
Or they will do it once, see no immediate change, and abandon it.

1194
01:09:35,460 --> 01:09:40,860
But those who persist, those who dare to assume in the face of contradiction, those who remain

1195
01:09:40,860 --> 01:09:45,820
faithful to the inner state regardless of outer appearances, they will prove the law.

1196
01:09:46,200 --> 01:09:48,620
I have seen it proven time and time again.

1197
01:09:49,080 --> 01:09:53,320
You have heard me speak of assumption, and many have misunderstood me.

1198
01:09:53,980 --> 01:09:54,820
Let me be plain.

1199
01:09:54,820 --> 01:10:00,180
The reason this feels like cheating, my friend, is because you have been taught that wealth

1200
01:10:00,180 --> 01:10:02,520
must be earned through sweat and toil.

1201
01:10:03,000 --> 01:10:08,000
You have been taught that money comes only through hard work, through struggle, through

1202
01:10:08,000 --> 01:10:08,600
sacrifice.

1203
01:10:09,280 --> 01:10:11,280
I do not deny that you may work.

1204
01:10:11,480 --> 01:10:16,140
But I tell you, if you work from the assumption of wealth, your work will be blessed.

1205
01:10:16,800 --> 01:10:21,120
If you work from the assumption of lack, your work will perpetuate lack.

1206
01:10:21,120 --> 01:10:24,720
There is no such thing as attracting money from outside yourself.

1207
01:10:25,480 --> 01:10:26,460
Put it from your mind.

1208
01:10:27,160 --> 01:10:29,480
Money does not exist outside of consciousness.

1209
01:10:29,920 --> 01:10:35,640
The outer world, the world of banks and checks and bills, is only a shadow cast by consciousness.

1210
01:10:36,580 --> 01:10:39,160
Change the consciousness, and the shadow must change.

1211
01:10:39,560 --> 01:10:41,580
You are not at the mercy of conditions.

1212
01:10:42,160 --> 01:10:44,340
Conditions are at the mercy of your assumptions.

1213
01:10:45,060 --> 01:10:49,460
I say to you tonight with absolute certainty, and this is not opinion, it is law.

1214
01:10:49,460 --> 01:10:51,860
What you are conscious of being, you are.

1215
01:10:52,480 --> 01:10:53,440
This law works.

1216
01:10:53,700 --> 01:10:55,520
I have proven it in my own life.

1217
01:10:55,840 --> 01:11:00,440
I have seen it proven in the lives of countless men and women who have heard me and applied

1218
01:11:00,440 --> 01:11:01,500
what I have told them.

1219
01:11:01,840 --> 01:11:02,940
It is not theory.

1220
01:11:03,300 --> 01:11:03,960
It is law.

1221
01:11:04,340 --> 01:11:05,640
And law does not fail.

1222
01:11:06,040 --> 01:11:10,720
And now I tell you, my friend, the secret of why this technique feels like cheating.

1223
01:11:11,120 --> 01:11:15,140
It is because the world has taught you that you must earn everything, that you must

1224
01:11:15,140 --> 01:11:18,320
work for it, that you must deserve it before you can have it.

1225
01:11:18,320 --> 01:11:21,460
But the law I have shown you tonight requires none of that.

1226
01:11:22,100 --> 01:11:23,800
The law requires only assumption.

1227
01:11:24,180 --> 01:11:28,080
You assume the wish fulfilled, and the law does the rest.

1228
01:11:28,500 --> 01:11:29,940
You do not create the bridge.

1229
01:11:30,240 --> 01:11:31,780
You do not orchestrate the means.

1230
01:11:32,180 --> 01:11:35,280
You simply enter the state of the wish fulfilled and remain there.

1231
01:11:35,680 --> 01:11:38,640
And from that state, the world has no choice but to conform.

1232
01:11:39,200 --> 01:11:40,900
This is why it feels dishonest.

1233
01:11:40,900 --> 01:11:44,160
Because consciousness, not effort, is the creative power.

1234
01:11:44,420 --> 01:11:47,620
Tonight when you retire to your bed, do this just once.

1235
01:11:48,300 --> 01:11:49,720
Enter that drowsy state.

1236
01:11:50,180 --> 01:11:52,600
Assume you already have the wealth you desire.

1237
01:11:53,140 --> 01:11:58,780
Feel the relief of it, the calm certainty, the naturalness, and then fall asleep in that

1238
01:11:58,780 --> 01:11:59,200
assumption.

1239
01:11:59,680 --> 01:12:00,320
That is all.

1240
01:12:00,620 --> 01:12:04,140
In the morning you may find that nothing has changed in the outer world.

1241
01:12:04,620 --> 01:12:05,640
Do not be discouraged.

1242
01:12:05,640 --> 01:12:08,500
The assumption must be persisted in.

1243
01:12:08,900 --> 01:12:12,080
Return to it night after night until it hardens into fact.

1244
01:12:12,500 --> 01:12:17,580
Or you may find, as so many have found, that the bridge of incidents begins to appear within

1245
01:12:17,580 --> 01:12:18,060
days.

1246
01:12:18,420 --> 01:12:19,780
Both are well, my friend.

1247
01:12:20,320 --> 01:12:21,260
Both are well.

1248
01:12:21,880 --> 01:12:24,680
Remember always, imagining creates reality.

1249
01:12:25,420 --> 01:12:27,300
The world is yourself pushed out.

1250
01:12:27,300 --> 01:12:31,520
What you assume in consciousness must externalize as fact.

1251
01:12:31,760 --> 01:12:32,700
This is not hope.

1252
01:12:33,100 --> 01:12:33,800
This is law.

1253
01:12:34,780 --> 01:12:37,580
May you sleep tonight in the Sabbath rest of your assumption.

1254
01:12:38,000 --> 01:12:41,220
May the wish fulfilled become as natural to you as breathing.

1255
01:12:41,860 --> 01:12:46,040
And may you wake to find that the outer world has conformed to your inner conviction.

1256
01:12:46,700 --> 01:12:49,720
Until we meet again, my friend, live from the end.

1257
01:12:49,720 --> 01:12:54,940
I tell you something tonight that will seem incredible to you, yet it is a fact you can

1258
01:12:54,940 --> 01:12:57,400
prove before the sun rises tomorrow morning.

1259
01:12:57,900 --> 01:13:03,340
Your brain, the physical instrument through which you experience this world, cannot tell

1260
01:13:03,340 --> 01:13:08,800
the difference between what you vividly imagine and what you physically experience.

1261
01:13:09,280 --> 01:13:10,660
It cannot tell the difference.

1262
01:13:11,100 --> 01:13:12,460
The same regions activate.

1263
01:13:12,720 --> 01:13:14,260
The same chemicals are released.

1264
01:13:14,520 --> 01:13:16,500
The same neural pathways are formed.

1265
01:13:16,500 --> 01:13:23,280
And yet, knowing this, most of you will continue to imagine idly, carelessly, as though imagination

1266
01:13:23,280 --> 01:13:26,400
were some powerless fantasy separate from the reality.

1267
01:13:26,900 --> 01:13:27,600
Touch and see.

1268
01:13:27,840 --> 01:13:28,540
Listen carefully.

1269
01:13:29,040 --> 01:13:33,820
If your brain accepts a vividly imagined event as a real event, and I tell you it does,

1270
01:13:34,280 --> 01:13:37,100
then you have been creating your world all along.

1271
01:13:37,660 --> 01:13:42,460
Not through what happens to you, but through what you imagine about what happens to you.

1272
01:13:42,460 --> 01:13:47,340
The woman who came to me last week in Los Angeles had been imagining for six months.

1273
01:13:47,620 --> 01:13:48,280
Six months.

1274
01:13:48,920 --> 01:13:51,180
And nothing had changed in her circumstances.

1275
01:13:51,720 --> 01:13:55,780
When I asked her to describe her imaginal act, do you know what she told me?

1276
01:13:56,140 --> 01:13:58,840
She said, I imagine myself hoping it will come.

1277
01:13:59,260 --> 01:14:01,200
I imagine myself waiting for it.

1278
01:14:01,580 --> 01:14:06,440
My friend, her brain accepted that she was hoping and waiting, and so she continues to

1279
01:14:06,440 --> 01:14:07,100
hope and wait.

1280
01:14:07,540 --> 01:14:09,760
Tonight I will show you where she went wrong.

1281
01:14:09,760 --> 01:14:15,700
And if you have been imagining without result, you will discover you have made the same mistake.

1282
01:14:16,060 --> 01:14:16,580
Pause.

1283
01:14:16,780 --> 01:14:19,520
Now let me tell you why this matters personally.

1284
01:14:19,940 --> 01:14:24,840
You have been told all your life that imagination is one thing and reality is another.

1285
01:14:25,300 --> 01:14:29,340
You imagine what you want, and then you wait for reality to deliver it.

1286
01:14:29,700 --> 01:14:34,100
You think of imagination as the blueprint and the outer world as the building.

1287
01:14:34,100 --> 01:14:39,820
But I tell you tonight, if your brain cannot distinguish between a vivid imaginal act and

1288
01:14:39,820 --> 01:14:42,900
a physical act, then imagination is not the blueprint.

1289
01:14:43,680 --> 01:14:45,480
Imagination is the building itself.

1290
01:14:45,900 --> 01:14:51,580
The outer world is only the shadow, the echo of what your brain has already accepted as accomplished

1291
01:14:51,580 --> 01:14:52,020
fact.

1292
01:14:52,440 --> 01:14:55,980
Most of you listening to me now have desires you have not realized.

1293
01:14:55,980 --> 01:14:57,720
You want a specific thing.

1294
01:14:58,040 --> 01:15:03,300
You want a relationship, a position, a sum of money, a state of health, and you think these

1295
01:15:03,300 --> 01:15:06,120
things exist outside of you, waiting to be obtained.

1296
01:15:06,420 --> 01:15:08,340
But they do not exist outside of you.

1297
01:15:08,660 --> 01:15:12,380
They exist now, in this moment, as states of consciousness.

1298
01:15:13,000 --> 01:15:17,640
And the only reason you do not experience them physically, is that your brain has not

1299
01:15:17,640 --> 01:15:19,720
yet accepted them as real.

1300
01:15:20,080 --> 01:15:22,580
Your brain is still occupied in the old state.

1301
01:15:22,580 --> 01:15:28,320
It is still producing neural patterns, releasing chemicals, forming memories consistent with

1302
01:15:28,320 --> 01:15:31,620
lack, with limitation, with the thing not yet obtained.

1303
01:15:32,140 --> 01:15:37,620
And so the outer world, which is yourself pushed out, continues to reflect that old state back

1304
01:15:37,620 --> 01:15:38,120
to you.

1305
01:15:38,460 --> 01:15:43,760
But the moment your brain accepts the new state as real, the moment it cannot tell the

1306
01:15:43,760 --> 01:15:49,160
difference between your imaginal experience of fulfillment and a physical experience of

1307
01:15:49,160 --> 01:15:49,640
fulfillment.

1308
01:15:50,260 --> 01:15:51,780
That outer world must change.

1309
01:15:51,880 --> 01:15:52,820
It has no choice.

1310
01:15:53,180 --> 01:15:54,920
Consciousness is the only reality.

1311
01:15:55,740 --> 01:15:56,260
Pause now.

1312
01:15:56,340 --> 01:15:58,820
I must tell you where most who hear this will fail.

1313
01:15:59,260 --> 01:16:01,840
They will fail not because the principle is false.

1314
01:16:02,420 --> 01:16:06,620
They will fail because they do not understand what it means to imagine vividly.

1315
01:16:06,940 --> 01:16:08,000
Let me be specific.

1316
01:16:08,460 --> 01:16:13,660
A man hears me say, your brain cannot tell the difference between imagination and reality.

1317
01:16:13,940 --> 01:16:16,600
And he goes home and he thinks about his desire.

1318
01:16:16,600 --> 01:16:18,720
He thinks, I want that position.

1319
01:16:18,880 --> 01:16:19,740
I hope I get it.

1320
01:16:19,820 --> 01:16:21,000
What if I do get it?

1321
01:16:21,060 --> 01:16:22,160
That would be wonderful.

1322
01:16:22,540 --> 01:16:24,000
And he calls this imagining.

1323
01:16:24,560 --> 01:16:25,740
But it is not imagining.

1324
01:16:26,220 --> 01:16:27,840
It is thinking about the desire.

1325
01:16:28,560 --> 01:16:32,720
His brain knows perfectly well he is thinking about something he does not have.

1326
01:16:33,100 --> 01:16:34,260
There is no vividness.

1327
01:16:34,600 --> 01:16:36,000
There is no sensory detail.

1328
01:16:36,460 --> 01:16:39,040
There is no acceptance of the wish as already fulfilled.

1329
01:16:39,460 --> 01:16:41,540
He is occupying the state of wanting.

1330
01:16:42,040 --> 01:16:44,040
And his brain is recording that state.

1331
01:16:44,380 --> 01:16:45,860
And so he continues to want.

1332
01:16:46,600 --> 01:16:50,120
Consider the woman I mentioned, the one who came to me in Los Angeles.

1333
01:16:50,120 --> 01:16:55,100
She had been faithfully performing her imaginal act every night for six months.

1334
01:16:55,660 --> 01:17:00,380
She would lie in bed and imagine herself hoping that her desire would come to pass.

1335
01:17:00,760 --> 01:17:03,980
She imagined herself waiting for it with great anticipation.

1336
01:17:04,680 --> 01:17:05,560
Do you see the error?

1337
01:17:05,980 --> 01:17:08,140
Her imaginal act was not the wish fulfilled.

1338
01:17:08,640 --> 01:17:11,160
Her imaginal act was the state of hoping and waiting.

1339
01:17:11,160 --> 01:17:20,780
And her brain, which cannot tell the difference between a vivid imaginal act and reality, accepted that she was in the state of hoping and waiting.

1340
01:17:20,780 --> 01:17:23,560
And so she continued to hope and wait.

1341
01:17:24,040 --> 01:17:28,280
The outer world gave her more evidence that she should continue hoping and waiting.

1342
01:17:28,820 --> 01:17:31,780
Because that was the state her brain had accepted as real.

1343
01:17:32,240 --> 01:17:34,020
I see this again and again.

1344
01:17:34,020 --> 01:17:36,640
People imagine the process instead of the end.

1345
01:17:37,120 --> 01:17:40,240
They imagine the interview instead of living from the job.

1346
01:17:40,700 --> 01:17:42,980
They imagine the pursuit instead of the union.

1347
01:17:43,620 --> 01:17:46,120
They imagine the striving instead of the sabbath.

1348
01:17:46,520 --> 01:17:51,080
And their brain accepts the process, the pursuit, the striving as the reality.

1349
01:17:51,720 --> 01:17:52,880
And so these continue.

1350
01:17:52,880 --> 01:17:54,380
Now hold this thought.

1351
01:17:54,800 --> 01:17:56,880
I will give you the correct method in a moment.

1352
01:17:57,340 --> 01:17:59,740
But first you must understand one thing more.

1353
01:18:00,120 --> 01:18:01,860
Or you will make the same mistakes.

1354
01:18:02,500 --> 01:18:06,060
There is a specific activity happening in your brain all day long.

1355
01:18:06,520 --> 01:18:09,420
An activity most who practice the law never monitor.

1356
01:18:09,940 --> 01:18:14,360
And that activity is cancelling out every imaginal scene you construct at night.

1357
01:18:14,760 --> 01:18:17,120
I must show you what that activity is.

1358
01:18:17,240 --> 01:18:20,960
Because without controlling it, the method I give you will not work.

1359
01:18:21,320 --> 01:18:21,700
Pause.

1360
01:18:21,700 --> 01:18:25,960
You must understand that your brain is forming neural patterns all day long.

1361
01:18:26,580 --> 01:18:29,320
Not only during your deliberate imaginal acts at night.

1362
01:18:29,760 --> 01:18:31,360
All day long you are imagining.

1363
01:18:31,780 --> 01:18:33,580
You are rehearsing future conversations.

1364
01:18:34,080 --> 01:18:35,780
You are replaying past events.

1365
01:18:36,440 --> 01:18:39,760
You are having inner arguments with people who are not even present.

1366
01:18:40,280 --> 01:18:46,440
And every one of these imaginal acts is being recorded by your brain as though it were a real event.

1367
01:18:46,840 --> 01:18:50,640
If you spend your day imagining difficulties, imagining rejection,

1368
01:18:50,640 --> 01:18:56,840
imagining continued limitation, then you spend your day impressing your brain with these states.

1369
01:18:56,840 --> 01:19:04,940
And no matter how faithfully you perform your imaginal act at night, your inner conversations during the day are undoing it.

1370
01:19:04,940 --> 01:19:10,360
Now I must insist on this, my friend, because this is where most who practice this law fail.

1371
01:19:10,700 --> 01:19:12,420
And they do not know they are failing.

1372
01:19:12,420 --> 01:19:15,260
There is no such thing as casual imagination.

1373
01:19:15,260 --> 01:19:22,340
Every imaginal act, every inner conversation, every mental rehearsal is impressing your subconscious mind.

1374
01:19:22,900 --> 01:19:31,680
You cannot imagine carelessly during the day and expect your disciplined imaginal act at night to overpower 16 hours of contrary imagination.

1375
01:19:31,680 --> 01:19:34,720
It will not, your brain is recording all of it.

1376
01:19:34,900 --> 01:19:38,940
Do not let anyone, including yourself, talk you out of this discipline.

1377
01:19:39,420 --> 01:19:44,760
Your inner conversations during the day are as important as your imaginal scene at night.

1378
01:19:45,220 --> 01:19:47,420
More important, because there are more of them.

1379
01:19:47,800 --> 01:19:49,520
I knew a man some years ago.

1380
01:19:49,680 --> 01:19:53,320
He came to my lectures in New York in the early 1950s.

1381
01:19:53,680 --> 01:19:55,420
He wanted to start his own business.

1382
01:19:55,700 --> 01:19:56,620
He had no capital.

1383
01:19:57,060 --> 01:19:57,980
He had no connections.

1384
01:19:57,980 --> 01:20:03,380
He had been employed by another man for 15 years and saw no way to break free.

1385
01:20:03,720 --> 01:20:05,720
But he began to practice what I taught him.

1386
01:20:06,200 --> 01:20:11,400
Every night, in the drowsy state, he would imagine sitting at the desk in his own office.

1387
01:20:11,940 --> 01:20:13,480
He would feel the weight of ownership.

1388
01:20:14,120 --> 01:20:15,820
He would see his name on the door.

1389
01:20:16,260 --> 01:20:21,000
He would hear his secretary, whom he did not yet have, announce the arrival of a client.

1390
01:20:21,300 --> 01:20:23,220
He did this faithfully for three weeks.

1391
01:20:23,220 --> 01:20:27,600
But during the day, he continued his old inner conversations.

1392
01:20:27,980 --> 01:20:30,480
He would imagine his employer refusing him.

1393
01:20:30,960 --> 01:20:33,880
He would rehearse arguments about why he could not leave.

1394
01:20:34,280 --> 01:20:36,280
He would see himself failing if he tried.

1395
01:20:36,440 --> 01:20:39,980
And after three weeks, nothing had changed in his outer circumstances.

1396
01:20:40,480 --> 01:20:42,260
He came to me discouraged.

1397
01:20:42,580 --> 01:20:44,880
He said, I have done what you told me.

1398
01:20:45,140 --> 01:20:46,460
I imagine every night.

1399
01:20:46,720 --> 01:20:47,660
But nothing happens.

1400
01:20:48,240 --> 01:20:50,920
And I said to him, What do you imagine during the day?

1401
01:20:51,060 --> 01:20:51,860
He looked at me.

1402
01:20:52,280 --> 01:20:54,880
Puzzled, he said, I do not imagine during the day.

1403
01:20:55,000 --> 01:20:56,180
I go about my work.

1404
01:20:56,180 --> 01:20:57,460
No, I told him.

1405
01:20:57,720 --> 01:20:59,580
You imagine constantly during the day.

1406
01:21:00,040 --> 01:21:01,060
You imagine failure.

1407
01:21:01,400 --> 01:21:03,040
You imagine your employer's resistance.

1408
01:21:03,600 --> 01:21:04,960
You imagine lack of capital.

1409
01:21:05,460 --> 01:21:11,360
Your brain is recording these imaginal acts as real, and they are cancelling out your nightly practice.

1410
01:21:11,980 --> 01:21:13,640
At first he would not accept this.

1411
01:21:14,080 --> 01:21:18,260
He insisted he was only being realistic, only acknowledging the facts.

1412
01:21:18,260 --> 01:21:23,160
But I pressed him, I said, For one full day, observe every inner conversation.

1413
01:21:23,400 --> 01:21:24,780
Do not try to change them yet.

1414
01:21:25,140 --> 01:21:28,880
Simply observe them, and then come back and tell me what you discovered.

1415
01:21:29,260 --> 01:21:33,000
He returned to me three days later, and he said, I had no idea.

1416
01:21:33,420 --> 01:21:36,180
I spend every waking hour imagining the worst.

1417
01:21:36,620 --> 01:21:39,100
I imagine difficulties that have not even occurred.

1418
01:21:39,100 --> 01:21:42,640
I argue with people in my mind who have said nothing to me.

1419
01:21:43,080 --> 01:21:46,180
My inner conversations are entirely in the old state.

1420
01:21:46,540 --> 01:21:47,820
That was the turning point.

1421
01:21:48,240 --> 01:21:51,120
From that day he began to discipline his inner talking.

1422
01:21:51,700 --> 01:21:56,940
When he caught himself imagining an argument with his employer, he stopped and revised it.

1423
01:21:57,240 --> 01:22:00,800
He imagined the conversation ending in agreement, in support.

1424
01:22:00,800 --> 01:22:08,560
When he caught himself imagining lack of capital, he stopped and imagined receiving a check, feeling the relief of provision.

1425
01:22:09,200 --> 01:22:13,480
He combined this disciplined inner talking with his nightly imaginal act.

1426
01:22:13,920 --> 01:22:20,320
And within six weeks, not six months, but six weeks, a series of events occurred that he could not have predicted.

1427
01:22:20,760 --> 01:22:23,140
A relative he barely knew offered him a loan.

1428
01:22:23,720 --> 01:22:26,500
A competitor retired and referred clients to him.

1429
01:22:26,500 --> 01:22:31,260
Within three months, he had his own office, his own business, his own secretary.

1430
01:22:31,860 --> 01:22:35,920
His brain had accepted the new state, and the outer world confirmed it.

1431
01:22:36,160 --> 01:22:37,160
Now listen carefully.

1432
01:22:37,740 --> 01:22:45,260
I will give you the correct method, the method I learned from my teacher Abdullah, the method I have taught for over twenty years.

1433
01:22:45,740 --> 01:22:49,580
You must begin with the end, not the means, not the process, but the end.

1434
01:22:50,080 --> 01:22:55,680
Define for yourself a single scene, a short scene, that implies your wish is already fulfilled.

1435
01:22:55,680 --> 01:22:59,120
Not that it will be fulfilled, that it is fulfilled now.

1436
01:22:59,320 --> 01:23:02,620
If you desire a marriage, do not imagine the proposal.

1437
01:23:03,080 --> 01:23:04,240
Do not imagine the wedding.

1438
01:23:04,820 --> 01:23:07,560
Imagine a scene that implies you are already married.

1439
01:23:08,060 --> 01:23:12,660
You are lying in bed wearing a wedding ring, and you turn to your partner beside you.

1440
01:23:13,000 --> 01:23:13,660
Four seconds.

1441
01:23:14,140 --> 01:23:15,080
That is all you need.

1442
01:23:15,420 --> 01:23:18,660
If you desire a new position, do not imagine the interview.

1443
01:23:18,660 --> 01:23:25,940
Imagine yourself in the position, hearing a colleague address you by your new title, feeling the naturalness of it.

1444
01:23:26,240 --> 01:23:27,320
Keep the scene simple.

1445
01:23:27,980 --> 01:23:32,040
The more elaborate you make it, the more your conscious mind will interfere.

1446
01:23:32,500 --> 01:23:39,200
A single sensory-rich scene four to five seconds in length looped again and again until it takes on the tones of reality.

1447
01:23:39,200 --> 01:23:43,600
Now, when you have selected your scene, you must wait until night.

1448
01:23:44,040 --> 01:23:49,960
You must wait until you retire to bed, because it is in the drowsy state that this method is most effective.

1449
01:23:50,480 --> 01:23:54,160
In that drowsy state, the filters of your conscious mind relax.

1450
01:23:54,800 --> 01:23:57,540
Your brain becomes more receptive to impressions.

1451
01:23:58,140 --> 01:24:03,620
An imaginal act performed in that state passes directly into your subconscious without resistance.

1452
01:24:03,620 --> 01:24:06,780
But here is what I must tell you now, my friend.

1453
01:24:07,360 --> 01:24:11,960
There is a precise moment, a transition point between your imaginal scene sleep,

1454
01:24:12,300 --> 01:24:16,900
where the assumption either takes root in your subconscious or evaporates like mist.

1455
01:24:17,540 --> 01:24:21,180
Most who practice this law never learn to recognize that moment.

1456
01:24:21,760 --> 01:24:28,520
They perform their imaginal act, but they do not carry it into sleep correctly, and so the impression does not take.

1457
01:24:28,520 --> 01:24:37,740
I will show you exactly how to cross that threshold, for it determines whether you wake with the assumption hardened or whether you must begin again.

1458
01:24:38,260 --> 01:24:41,000
So tonight, when you lie down to sleep, you will do this.

1459
01:24:41,300 --> 01:24:43,620
First, you will immobilize your physical body.

1460
01:24:43,980 --> 01:24:44,560
Lie flat.

1461
01:24:44,820 --> 01:24:45,860
Relax every muscle.

1462
01:24:46,220 --> 01:24:46,860
Do not move.

1463
01:24:47,260 --> 01:24:51,060
The body must be still so that the brain can enter the imaginal scene fully.

1464
01:24:51,420 --> 01:24:53,420
Second and induce the drowsy state.

1465
01:24:53,640 --> 01:24:54,600
You know this state.

1466
01:24:54,940 --> 01:24:57,740
It is not sleep, but it is very close to sleep.

1467
01:24:57,740 --> 01:24:59,140
Your eyelids are heavy.

1468
01:24:59,460 --> 01:25:00,820
Your thoughts begin to drift.

1469
01:25:01,040 --> 01:25:02,500
Catch yourself in that state.

1470
01:25:02,860 --> 01:25:03,980
Third in that state.

1471
01:25:04,460 --> 01:25:05,340
Play your scene.

1472
01:25:05,600 --> 01:25:05,980
See it.

1473
01:25:06,160 --> 01:25:06,560
Hear it.

1474
01:25:06,700 --> 01:25:07,140
Feel it.

1475
01:25:07,340 --> 01:25:10,380
If your scene involves touching something, feel the texture.

1476
01:25:10,760 --> 01:25:13,260
If it involves hearing a voice, hear the tone.

1477
01:25:13,660 --> 01:25:14,460
Make it sensory.

1478
01:25:15,020 --> 01:25:15,620
Make it vivid.

1479
01:25:15,920 --> 01:25:16,960
Fourth, loop the scene.

1480
01:25:17,300 --> 01:25:18,540
Play it again and again.

1481
01:25:18,820 --> 01:25:20,940
Do not let your mind wander to other thoughts.

1482
01:25:21,440 --> 01:25:26,020
Simply return to the scene each time, and as you loop it, feel the reality of it.

1483
01:25:26,020 --> 01:25:28,860
Fourth, feel that it is happening now, not in the future.

1484
01:25:29,040 --> 01:25:34,580
Fifth, continue looping the scene until you feel satisfaction, until you feel the naturalness

1485
01:25:34,580 --> 01:25:36,840
of it, and then let sleep take you.

1486
01:25:37,220 --> 01:25:39,540
Fall asleep in the feeling of the wish fulfilled.

1487
01:25:39,960 --> 01:25:40,820
This is the method.

1488
01:25:41,100 --> 01:25:46,920
It is simple, but you must not complicate it, and you must not, you must not, my friend, make

1489
01:25:46,920 --> 01:25:50,360
the common mistakes I see even among those who know this law.

1490
01:25:50,780 --> 01:25:51,060
Pause.

1491
01:25:51,060 --> 01:25:54,460
Because the first mistake is imagining the process instead of the end.

1492
01:25:55,100 --> 01:26:00,200
I have already addressed this, but I will say it again because it is the most common error.

1493
01:26:00,660 --> 01:26:03,880
Your brain will accept whatever state you vividly imagine.

1494
01:26:04,400 --> 01:26:07,780
If you imagine the journey, you will continue journeying.

1495
01:26:08,220 --> 01:26:11,080
If you imagine the end, you will experience the end.

1496
01:26:11,440 --> 01:26:15,280
The second mistake is doubting during the day what you assumed at night.

1497
01:26:15,700 --> 01:26:19,160
You perform your imaginal act faithfully before sleep.

1498
01:26:19,160 --> 01:26:21,920
Your brain begins to accept it as real.

1499
01:26:22,340 --> 01:26:27,000
But then you wake in the morning, and the old circumstances are still there, and you say

1500
01:26:27,000 --> 01:26:28,880
to yourself, it has not happened.

1501
01:26:29,400 --> 01:26:30,640
Maybe it will not happen.

1502
01:26:31,060 --> 01:26:32,500
I wonder how it could happen.

1503
01:26:32,840 --> 01:26:35,620
And in that moment, you have re-entered the old state.

1504
01:26:36,100 --> 01:26:40,640
Your brain is now recording doubt, and doubt becomes the reality it externalizes.

1505
01:26:41,140 --> 01:26:46,380
You must guard your inner conversations during the day, as carefully as you construct your

1506
01:26:46,380 --> 01:26:47,820
imaginal act at night.

1507
01:26:48,300 --> 01:26:50,100
The world will tell you this is denial.

1508
01:26:50,540 --> 01:26:55,520
The world will tell you that you must face facts, accept reality as it is, be reasonable.

1509
01:26:56,020 --> 01:26:57,200
I tell you they are wrong.

1510
01:26:57,600 --> 01:26:59,160
The outer facts are not final.

1511
01:26:59,320 --> 01:27:00,920
They are effects, not causes.

1512
01:27:01,320 --> 01:27:06,600
The cause is your assumption, your imaginal activity, the state your brain occupies.

1513
01:27:06,600 --> 01:27:12,100
When you refuse to accept present evidence as final, and you persist in your assumption of

1514
01:27:12,100 --> 01:27:15,100
the wish fulfilled, you are not denying reality.

1515
01:27:15,560 --> 01:27:19,420
You are selecting which reality your brain will accept and externalize.

1516
01:27:19,800 --> 01:27:20,620
Make no mistake.

1517
01:27:20,980 --> 01:27:25,280
What the world calls reality is simply the out-picturing of past assumptions.

1518
01:27:25,920 --> 01:27:28,900
You are under no obligation to continue those assumptions.

1519
01:27:29,580 --> 01:27:32,520
The third mistake is asking how it will come to pass.

1520
01:27:32,520 --> 01:27:36,420
The moment you ask how, you have assumed it has not yet come to pass.

1521
01:27:36,960 --> 01:27:38,840
You have re-entered the state of lack.

1522
01:27:39,340 --> 01:27:41,060
Your brain does not need to know how.

1523
01:27:41,460 --> 01:27:43,660
Your brain only needs to accept the what.

1524
01:27:44,080 --> 01:27:47,080
Once it accepts the end as real, it will find the means.

1525
01:27:47,500 --> 01:27:52,760
The how will appear as a series of events that seem natural, even inevitable, but which

1526
01:27:52,760 --> 01:27:55,580
you could never have predicted from your present state.

1527
01:27:55,880 --> 01:28:01,280
And the fourth mistake, my friend, is giving up before the assumption hardens into fact.

1528
01:28:01,280 --> 01:28:07,020
Most who hear me tonight will try this method once, twice, and when they do not see immediate

1529
01:28:07,020 --> 01:28:09,980
evidence in the outer world, they will abandon it.

1530
01:28:10,080 --> 01:28:11,680
They will say it does not work.

1531
01:28:12,180 --> 01:28:14,140
But I tell you, it is working.

1532
01:28:14,380 --> 01:28:16,220
Your brain is reorganizing itself.

1533
01:28:16,660 --> 01:28:18,220
New neural patterns are forming.

1534
01:28:18,540 --> 01:28:20,160
The old state still has momentum.

1535
01:28:20,740 --> 01:28:23,740
It will continue for a time to produce evidence of itself.

1536
01:28:23,740 --> 01:28:29,260
But every time you return to your imaginal act, you strengthen the new pattern and weaken

1537
01:28:29,260 --> 01:28:29,920
the old.

1538
01:28:30,180 --> 01:28:30,600
Persist.

1539
01:28:30,900 --> 01:28:31,760
Persist, my friend.

1540
01:28:32,220 --> 01:28:37,500
The interval between your imaginal act and its physical manifestation is the test of your

1541
01:28:37,500 --> 01:28:38,580
faith in this law.

1542
01:28:39,040 --> 01:28:39,440
Pause.

1543
01:28:39,580 --> 01:28:44,160
Before I show you how to apply this tonight, I must address one thing more, the question

1544
01:28:44,160 --> 01:28:45,160
everyone asks.

1545
01:28:45,560 --> 01:28:47,480
They ask, how long must I persist?

1546
01:28:47,920 --> 01:28:49,500
How long before I see results?

1547
01:28:49,500 --> 01:28:55,280
Now here is the truth that separates those who see their world, respond in days from those

1548
01:28:55,280 --> 01:28:58,100
who persist for months, and still see nothing.

1549
01:28:58,540 --> 01:29:03,620
There is a quality to the assumption itself, a naturalness, that determines the speed of

1550
01:29:03,620 --> 01:29:04,340
manifestation.

1551
01:29:04,860 --> 01:29:09,040
And that naturalness depends entirely on one factor most never consider.

1552
01:29:09,420 --> 01:29:11,240
I will tell you that factor now.

1553
01:29:11,240 --> 01:29:16,640
And when you understand it, you will know exactly how long your assumption will take to harden

1554
01:29:16,640 --> 01:29:17,420
into fact.

1555
01:29:17,760 --> 01:29:20,580
And I tell them what Abdullah told me many years ago.

1556
01:29:20,840 --> 01:29:24,380
He said, it is done, not it will be done, it is done.

1557
01:29:24,940 --> 01:29:28,480
The moment you assume state in imagination it is done in consciousness.

1558
01:29:29,080 --> 01:29:31,280
And consciousness is the only reality.

1559
01:29:31,780 --> 01:29:36,700
The outer world is simply catching up to what has already been accomplished in imagination.

1560
01:29:37,200 --> 01:29:41,100
I tell you with certainty, and this is not opinion, it is law.

1561
01:29:41,240 --> 01:29:46,200
The moment you assume the feeling of the wish fulfilled in imagination, that assumption

1562
01:29:46,200 --> 01:29:48,940
has already impressed your subconscious mind.

1563
01:29:49,500 --> 01:29:53,640
Your brain has already begun to reorganize itself around that assumption.

1564
01:29:54,180 --> 01:29:56,400
The neural pathways are already forming.

1565
01:29:56,580 --> 01:29:57,620
You do not see them.

1566
01:29:57,980 --> 01:29:59,480
You do not feel them consciously.

1567
01:29:59,920 --> 01:30:00,900
But they are forming.

1568
01:30:01,340 --> 01:30:06,220
And they will continue to form and strengthen every time you return to that assumption.

1569
01:30:06,800 --> 01:30:11,000
The outer world has no choice but to reflect what your brain has accepted as real.

1570
01:30:11,000 --> 01:30:12,920
This is not metaphysics alone.

1571
01:30:13,220 --> 01:30:14,080
This is biology.

1572
01:30:14,560 --> 01:30:15,640
This is neurology.

1573
01:30:15,980 --> 01:30:16,700
This is law.

1574
01:30:17,280 --> 01:30:18,440
But in time how long?

1575
01:30:18,760 --> 01:30:23,240
I cannot give you a fixed answer, because it depends on the naturalness of your assumption.

1576
01:30:23,740 --> 01:30:29,080
If you assume a state that feels completely natural to you, it will manifest quickly, sometimes

1577
01:30:29,080 --> 01:30:30,020
within days.

1578
01:30:30,020 --> 01:30:35,600
If you assume a state that feels unnatural, that requires you to stretch your belief in

1579
01:30:35,600 --> 01:30:40,760
what is possible for you, it may take weeks or months of nightly repetition before your

1580
01:30:40,760 --> 01:30:42,140
brain fully accepts it.

1581
01:30:42,380 --> 01:30:44,100
But it will accept it if you persist.

1582
01:30:44,780 --> 01:30:48,880
An assumption, though false, if persisted in will harden into fact.

1583
01:30:48,880 --> 01:30:50,880
I did not invent this principle.

1584
01:30:51,120 --> 01:30:52,000
I discovered it.

1585
01:30:52,300 --> 01:30:57,620
And I have seen it proven thousands of times in the lives of those who have heard me and

1586
01:30:57,620 --> 01:30:58,740
applied it faithfully.

1587
01:30:59,200 --> 01:30:59,520
Pause.

1588
01:30:59,760 --> 01:31:04,540
Let me tell you of my own experience, because it is the foundation of everything I teach

1589
01:31:04,540 --> 01:31:04,800
you.

1590
01:31:04,800 --> 01:31:08,300
In 1933, I was living in New York.

1591
01:31:08,660 --> 01:31:13,560
I had been in this country for many years, but I had not seen my family in Barbados since

1592
01:31:13,560 --> 01:31:14,220
I was a boy.

1593
01:31:14,600 --> 01:31:16,480
I wanted desperately to go home.

1594
01:31:16,680 --> 01:31:19,940
I wanted to see my mother, my father, my brothers and sisters.

1595
01:31:20,200 --> 01:31:21,260
But I had no money.

1596
01:31:21,440 --> 01:31:22,120
I was struggling.

1597
01:31:22,600 --> 01:31:26,260
I could barely afford my rent, much less a voyage to Barbados.

1598
01:31:26,380 --> 01:31:27,340
It seemed impossible.

1599
01:31:27,780 --> 01:31:29,680
At that time I was studying with Abdullah.

1600
01:31:29,780 --> 01:31:34,780
He was a black man, a teacher of the law, and he knew this principle far better than

1601
01:31:34,940 --> 01:31:35,540
I did then.

1602
01:31:35,980 --> 01:31:38,080
I went to him and I told him of my desire.

1603
01:31:38,320 --> 01:31:41,600
I said, I want to go to Barbados, but I have no money.

1604
01:31:42,020 --> 01:31:42,740
What should I do?

1605
01:31:42,800 --> 01:31:45,120
And he looked at me and said, You are in Barbados.

1606
01:31:45,540 --> 01:31:46,280
I said, No.

1607
01:31:46,740 --> 01:31:47,900
I am here in New York.

1608
01:31:48,080 --> 01:31:49,380
I want to be in Barbados.

1609
01:31:49,620 --> 01:31:51,500
He said again, You are in Barbados.

1610
01:31:51,680 --> 01:31:52,760
I did not understand.

1611
01:31:52,880 --> 01:31:53,840
I argued with him.

1612
01:31:53,940 --> 01:31:57,940
I said, Abdullah, I am standing here in front of you in New Sork City.

1613
01:31:57,940 --> 01:31:59,560
I am not in Barbados.

1614
01:31:59,800 --> 01:32:00,820
He would not argue.

1615
01:32:00,920 --> 01:32:02,960
He simply repeated, You are in Barbados.

1616
01:32:02,960 --> 01:32:05,040
And he closed the door in my face.

1617
01:32:05,680 --> 01:32:07,480
I went home confused, frustrated.

1618
01:32:07,980 --> 01:32:10,240
But then I began to understand what he meant.

1619
01:32:10,540 --> 01:32:12,920
He did not mean I was physically in Barbados.

1620
01:32:13,440 --> 01:32:16,700
He meant I must assume in consciousness that I am in Barbados.

1621
01:32:17,200 --> 01:32:21,940
I must occupy that state so completely that my brain accepts it as present reality.

1622
01:32:22,380 --> 01:32:24,260
So that night I did as he instructed.

1623
01:32:24,260 --> 01:32:29,840
I lay in my bed in New York, but in imagination I lay in my bed in my father's house in Barbados.

1624
01:32:30,060 --> 01:32:31,760
I felt the warm tropical air.

1625
01:32:32,240 --> 01:32:34,220
I heard the sounds of the island at night.

1626
01:32:34,620 --> 01:32:37,480
I saw the familiar room I had slept in as a boy.

1627
01:32:37,860 --> 01:32:39,680
I did not imagine that I would be there.

1628
01:32:40,080 --> 01:32:41,940
I imagined that I was there now.

1629
01:32:42,280 --> 01:32:44,060
And I fell asleep in that assumption.

1630
01:32:44,300 --> 01:32:45,500
I did this every night.

1631
01:32:45,500 --> 01:32:48,480
And during the day, whenever I was tempted to think,

1632
01:32:48,900 --> 01:32:52,540
I am in New York and I want to be in Barbados, I corrected myself.

1633
01:32:52,660 --> 01:32:54,900
I said, No, I am in Barbados, not I will be.

1634
01:32:55,220 --> 01:33:00,160
I am within one week my brother, who I had not heard from in months, sent me a letter.

1635
01:33:00,600 --> 01:33:03,200
In it was money enough for passage to Barbados.

1636
01:33:03,700 --> 01:33:05,940
He wrote that he felt compelled to send it,

1637
01:33:06,280 --> 01:33:10,180
that he woke one morning with the strong impression that I needed to come home.

1638
01:33:10,720 --> 01:33:12,320
I did not ask him for it.

1639
01:33:12,320 --> 01:33:17,240
I did not tell him of my desire, but my assumption had impressed itself upon him,

1640
01:33:17,420 --> 01:33:19,080
and he acted in harmony with it.

1641
01:33:19,380 --> 01:33:22,520
Within two weeks, I was physically in Barbados,

1642
01:33:23,000 --> 01:33:25,760
sleeping in the same bed I had imagined sleeping in.

1643
01:33:26,020 --> 01:33:27,840
That experience taught me everything.

1644
01:33:28,460 --> 01:33:33,720
It taught me that the brain does not distinguish between a vivid imaginal act and a physical act.

1645
01:33:34,020 --> 01:33:38,440
It taught me that assumption, persisted in, must harden into fact.

1646
01:33:38,440 --> 01:33:42,260
It taught me that I do not need to know how my desire will be fulfilled.

1647
01:33:42,780 --> 01:33:47,600
I only need to assume it is already fulfilled, and the how will take care of itself.

1648
01:33:48,320 --> 01:33:52,700
Now my friend, let me tell you exactly how to do this this tonight when you go to bed.

1649
01:33:53,120 --> 01:33:54,300
You have heard the principle.

1650
01:33:54,880 --> 01:33:55,820
You have heard the method.

1651
01:33:56,340 --> 01:33:58,760
Now I will give you the specific application.

1652
01:33:59,340 --> 01:34:01,400
Construct your scene before you retire.

1653
01:34:01,940 --> 01:34:05,300
Do not wait until you are in bed to decide what you will imagine.

1654
01:34:05,300 --> 01:34:07,400
Know your scene in advance.

1655
01:34:07,900 --> 01:34:10,420
A single short scene implying your wish fulfilled.

1656
01:34:10,840 --> 01:34:16,180
When you lie down tonight, immobilize your body, enter the drowsy state, and in that state,

1657
01:34:16,400 --> 01:34:19,020
live in your scene, not think about it, live in it.

1658
01:34:19,320 --> 01:34:20,340
Feel yourself there.

1659
01:34:20,580 --> 01:34:22,300
Experience it with all your senses.

1660
01:34:22,700 --> 01:34:25,300
Loop it until it feels natural, and then sleep.

1661
01:34:25,680 --> 01:34:29,800
Let sleep take you while you are still in that scene, still in that feeling.

1662
01:34:29,800 --> 01:34:32,500
Tomorrow, observe your inner conversations.

1663
01:34:33,160 --> 01:34:36,560
Remember what I told you earlier about the man from New York.

1664
01:34:37,080 --> 01:34:41,400
His inner conversations during the day were cancelling out his nightly practice.

1665
01:34:42,020 --> 01:34:43,560
Do not make the same mistake.

1666
01:34:43,960 --> 01:34:48,020
The moment you catch yourself imagining from the old state, stop and revise.

1667
01:34:48,360 --> 01:34:49,760
Imagine from the new state.

1668
01:34:50,080 --> 01:34:50,800
Do this daily.

1669
01:34:51,220 --> 01:34:52,120
Do this nightly.

1670
01:34:52,520 --> 01:34:55,000
Persist until the assumption hardens into fact.

1671
01:34:55,000 --> 01:35:00,620
I promise you, if you do this faithfully, your outer world will conform to your inner assumption.

1672
01:35:01,060 --> 01:35:01,560
It must.

1673
01:35:01,820 --> 01:35:03,800
Your brain cannot occupy two states.

1674
01:35:04,260 --> 01:35:06,960
It will occupy the state you persist in imagining.

1675
01:35:07,460 --> 01:35:12,320
And the outer world which is yourself pushed out, will reflect that state back to you.

1676
01:35:12,780 --> 01:35:16,700
Pause and now I tell you, my friend, the secret you have just heard.

1677
01:35:17,000 --> 01:35:23,260
Your brain cannot tell the difference between what you vividly imagine and what you physically experience.

1678
01:35:23,260 --> 01:35:25,340
Not because your brain is foolish.

1679
01:35:25,780 --> 01:35:27,720
Not because imagination is trickery.

1680
01:35:28,140 --> 01:35:30,180
But because imagination is experience.

1681
01:35:30,740 --> 01:35:33,220
When you imagine vividly, you are experiencing.

1682
01:35:33,680 --> 01:35:34,940
Your brain records it.

1683
01:35:35,260 --> 01:35:36,840
Your nervous system accepts it.

1684
01:35:36,920 --> 01:35:39,060
Your subconscious externalizes it.

1685
01:35:39,440 --> 01:35:45,480
This is why I have told you for 20 years, imagining creality, not imagining leads to reality.

1686
01:35:45,860 --> 01:35:47,540
Not imagining attracts reality.

1687
01:35:48,020 --> 01:35:49,600
Imagining creates reality.

1688
01:35:49,600 --> 01:35:54,360
The moment your brain accepts your imaginal act as real, it is real in consciousness.

1689
01:35:55,040 --> 01:35:57,240
And consciousness is the only reality.

1690
01:35:57,840 --> 01:36:02,140
The outer world is simply the confirmation of what has already been accepted within.

1691
01:36:02,660 --> 01:36:05,280
You are not waiting for your desire to come to you.

1692
01:36:05,540 --> 01:36:08,880
Your desire is waiting for you to accept it as already yours.

1693
01:36:09,540 --> 01:36:12,760
Tonight, when you retire, do this just once.

1694
01:36:13,040 --> 01:36:14,380
Construct your simple scene.

1695
01:36:14,540 --> 01:36:15,740
Enter the drowsy state.

1696
01:36:16,020 --> 01:36:18,320
Live in that scene as with sensory vividness.

1697
01:36:18,320 --> 01:36:19,840
Feel the reality of it.

1698
01:36:20,040 --> 01:36:20,560
And so sleep.

1699
01:36:20,960 --> 01:36:23,600
Let sleep take you in the feeling of the wish fulfilled.

1700
01:36:24,060 --> 01:36:24,700
That is all.

1701
01:36:25,020 --> 01:36:26,400
Tomorrow night, do it again.

1702
01:36:26,760 --> 01:36:31,000
And the next night, and the next, until your assumption hardens into fact.

1703
01:36:31,400 --> 01:36:32,080
It will harden.

1704
01:36:32,280 --> 01:36:33,000
It must harden.

1705
01:36:33,120 --> 01:36:33,740
This is law.

1706
01:36:34,220 --> 01:36:38,840
Do not be discouraged if the outer world continues for a time to reflect the old state.

1707
01:36:39,380 --> 01:36:40,820
Your brain is reorganizing.

1708
01:36:41,300 --> 01:36:43,140
The new neural patterns are forming.

1709
01:36:43,140 --> 01:36:47,120
Every night you return to your assumption, you strengthen those patterns.

1710
01:36:47,600 --> 01:36:48,740
Persist, my friend.

1711
01:36:49,020 --> 01:36:49,460
Persist.

1712
01:36:49,960 --> 01:36:51,840
You are not a victim of circumstances.

1713
01:36:52,460 --> 01:36:55,060
You are not at the mercy of a world outside of you.

1714
01:36:55,360 --> 01:36:56,660
You are the operant power.

1715
01:36:57,160 --> 01:37:00,260
Your consciousness is creating your world moment by moment.

1716
01:37:00,260 --> 01:37:07,040
And now that you know your brain cannot distinguish between vivid imagination and physical reality,

1717
01:37:07,260 --> 01:37:08,380
you are without excuse.

1718
01:37:08,780 --> 01:37:09,600
You know the law.

1719
01:37:09,920 --> 01:37:10,700
You know the method.

1720
01:37:11,060 --> 01:37:11,700
Apply it.

1721
01:37:11,960 --> 01:37:13,780
Assume the feeling of your wish fulfilled.

1722
01:37:14,300 --> 01:37:15,680
Persist in that assumption.

1723
01:37:16,260 --> 01:37:21,480
And watch your world rearrange itself to confirm what you have already accepted in consciousness.

1724
01:37:22,160 --> 01:37:24,020
The world is yourself pushed out.

1725
01:37:24,240 --> 01:37:25,740
Imagining creates reality.

1726
01:37:25,740 --> 01:37:29,300
May you rest tonight in the state of your fulfilled desire.

1727
01:37:29,820 --> 01:37:32,180
May your assumption take root while you sleep.

1728
01:37:32,720 --> 01:37:35,300
And may you wake to find the outer world already.

1729
01:37:35,400 --> 01:37:39,300
I want to tell you something tonight that will sound strange to you at first.

1730
01:37:39,900 --> 01:37:43,940
I am going to ask you to ignore your reality for the next seven days.

1731
01:37:44,420 --> 01:37:45,260
Not to fight it.

1732
01:37:45,440 --> 01:37:47,140
Not to think positively about it.

1733
01:37:47,400 --> 01:37:48,720
Not to affirm against it.

1734
01:37:48,780 --> 01:37:49,640
But to ignore it.

1735
01:37:49,640 --> 01:37:56,620
To turn from it completely and live in an entirely different state as though the facts before you simply do not exist.

1736
01:37:57,000 --> 01:38:03,660
Now, before you dismiss this as denial or foolishness, let me tell you why most who hear this teaching fail.

1737
01:38:04,000 --> 01:38:09,960
They ignore their reality for one day, perhaps two, and when nothing changes in the outer world,

1738
01:38:10,220 --> 01:38:12,900
they return to accepting what their senses report.

1739
01:38:13,460 --> 01:38:15,960
They look at their bank account, still empty.

1740
01:38:16,300 --> 01:38:18,040
They look at their body, still sick.

1741
01:38:18,040 --> 01:38:21,220
They look at the person who rejected them, still absent.

1742
01:38:21,460 --> 01:38:28,820
And in that moment, that single moment of reaction, they have uprooted the seed and made the old assumption king once more.

1743
01:38:28,960 --> 01:38:32,480
I tell you, the outer world you see tonight is not reality.

1744
01:38:32,960 --> 01:38:33,680
It is shadow.

1745
01:38:33,920 --> 01:38:38,020
It is the outpicturing of assumptions you held days, weeks, even months ago.

1746
01:38:38,440 --> 01:38:45,200
It has no power except the power you give it by reacting to it, by accepting it, by bowing to it as though it were cause.

1747
01:38:45,200 --> 01:38:53,460
Tonight I will show you the technique of turning from this shadow and dwelling in the state of the wish fulfilled for seven complete days.

1748
01:38:54,080 --> 01:38:54,520
A Sabbath.

1749
01:38:54,960 --> 01:38:55,880
A finished cycle.

1750
01:38:56,400 --> 01:38:58,000
And what must happen when you do.

1751
01:38:58,540 --> 01:39:03,080
Pause now before I tell you how to do this, and I will give you the precise method tonight.

1752
01:39:03,080 --> 01:39:08,360
I must first explain to you why this works, why it must work, why it cannot fail.

1753
01:39:08,640 --> 01:39:10,260
Consciousness is the only reality.

1754
01:39:10,660 --> 01:39:16,420
I have told you this before, but I will tell you again because everything depends upon grasping this truth.

1755
01:39:16,680 --> 01:39:18,560
The world you see is not causative.

1756
01:39:18,920 --> 01:39:19,600
It is effect.

1757
01:39:20,100 --> 01:39:20,400
Shadow.

1758
01:39:20,400 --> 01:39:27,720
Every circumstance, every condition, every fact before you, is nothing more than your consciousness outpictured.

1759
01:39:28,280 --> 01:39:34,160
When you look at your bank account, you are seeing the balance of an assumption you held weeks or months ago.

1760
01:39:34,560 --> 01:39:39,700
When you look at your body, you see the harvest of thoughts and feelings you have entertained.

1761
01:39:40,140 --> 01:39:45,460
When you look at your relationships, you see the reflection of your inner conversations.

1762
01:39:45,460 --> 01:39:51,280
The outer world is telling you what was, never what is being created now in consciousness.

1763
01:39:51,880 --> 01:39:56,620
Your senses report only the past made visible, and here is where most go wrong.

1764
01:39:57,140 --> 01:40:02,780
They accept the report of the senses as though it were truth, as though it were cause, as though it had power.

1765
01:40:03,180 --> 01:40:04,540
My friend, it has no power.

1766
01:40:04,720 --> 01:40:08,160
The only power is consciousness, your awareness of being.

1767
01:40:08,520 --> 01:40:14,460
When you persist in a new assumption, when you dwell in the feeling of the wish fulfilled for a complete cycle,

1768
01:40:14,460 --> 01:40:16,460
you impress the subconscious.

1769
01:40:17,160 --> 01:40:22,360
And I tell you, the subconscious has no choice but to externalize what has been impressed upon it.

1770
01:40:22,720 --> 01:40:23,360
This is law.

1771
01:40:23,600 --> 01:40:24,340
Not sometimes.

1772
01:40:24,740 --> 01:40:25,460
Not occasionally.

1773
01:40:26,080 --> 01:40:26,440
Always.

1774
01:40:26,720 --> 01:40:30,320
An assumption, though false, if persisted in, will harden into fact.

1775
01:40:30,620 --> 01:40:31,900
Now why seven days?

1776
01:40:32,120 --> 01:40:32,900
Listen carefully.

1777
01:40:33,300 --> 01:40:35,040
Seven in scripture is not a number.

1778
01:40:35,420 --> 01:40:38,440
It is a symbol of completion, of rest, of the Sabbath.

1779
01:40:38,820 --> 01:40:43,600
When God created the world in six days and rested on the seventh, this was not history.

1780
01:40:43,600 --> 01:40:52,440
This was instruction, you work by assuming, you labor by imagining, you toil by feeling the wish fulfilled, and then you rest, you enter the Sabbath.

1781
01:40:52,920 --> 01:40:56,180
You cease from all outer effort, knowing that it is finished.

1782
01:40:56,560 --> 01:40:58,900
Seven days represents this complete cycle.

1783
01:40:59,360 --> 01:41:01,200
Assumption held without wavering.

1784
01:41:01,640 --> 01:41:04,100
Followed by rest in the certainty of fulfillment.

1785
01:41:04,760 --> 01:41:05,060
Pause.

1786
01:41:05,160 --> 01:41:09,140
You have heard me say this, but now let me tell you where most people fail.

1787
01:41:09,460 --> 01:41:10,340
They begin well.

1788
01:41:10,340 --> 01:41:12,100
But they do not persist.

1789
01:41:12,720 --> 01:41:18,240
I want to share with you a story of a woman who came to me many years ago when I was lecturing in Los Angeles.

1790
01:41:18,860 --> 01:41:24,240
She had been trying to manifest a reconciliation with her husband who had left her for another woman.

1791
01:41:24,860 --> 01:41:26,380
The outer facts were brutal.

1792
01:41:26,880 --> 01:41:28,060
Divorce papers filed.

1793
01:41:28,560 --> 01:41:30,620
Another woman living in what had been their home.

1794
01:41:31,180 --> 01:41:32,260
Months of no contact.

1795
01:41:32,260 --> 01:41:36,920
Her friends told her to accept reality, to move on, to find someone new.

1796
01:41:37,280 --> 01:41:40,460
But she came to me and asked if the law could reverse even this.

1797
01:41:40,900 --> 01:41:42,820
I told her what I am telling you tonight.

1798
01:41:42,980 --> 01:41:47,400
I said, you must ignore these facts, not fight them, not resist them.

1799
01:41:47,640 --> 01:41:48,880
But ignore them completely.

1800
01:41:48,880 --> 01:41:53,660
For the next seven days, you will assume you are happily married to this man.

1801
01:41:54,120 --> 01:41:56,320
You will feel the wedding ring on your finger.

1802
01:41:56,860 --> 01:41:59,480
You will sleep at night feeling him beside you.

1803
01:41:59,960 --> 01:42:04,120
You will have inner conversations with him as though nothing had ever gone wrong.

1804
01:42:04,580 --> 01:42:06,020
At first she resisted.

1805
01:42:06,340 --> 01:42:08,820
She said, but Neville, the facts are so loud.

1806
01:42:09,200 --> 01:42:10,680
The divorce papers are real.

1807
01:42:10,920 --> 01:42:12,140
The other woman is real.

1808
01:42:12,500 --> 01:42:14,500
How can I ignore what I see every day?

1809
01:42:14,500 --> 01:42:16,580
And I told her, the papers are shadow.

1810
01:42:17,040 --> 01:42:18,340
The other woman is shadow.

1811
01:42:18,940 --> 01:42:22,580
They have no power except the power you give them by reacting to them.

1812
01:42:23,040 --> 01:42:27,080
Your only power is to turn from them and dwell in the state of the wish fulfilled.

1813
01:42:27,300 --> 01:42:28,400
She agreed to try.

1814
01:42:28,980 --> 01:42:30,760
For three days, she persisted.

1815
01:42:31,160 --> 01:42:33,520
Morning and night, she assumed she was his wife.

1816
01:42:33,900 --> 01:42:34,560
She felt it.

1817
01:42:34,620 --> 01:42:35,360
She lived in it.

1818
01:42:35,640 --> 01:42:41,920
But on the fourth day, she received a letter from his attorney demanding her signature on the final documents.

1819
01:42:41,920 --> 01:42:44,680
The old state was presenting its evidence.

1820
01:42:45,100 --> 01:42:45,880
She called me.

1821
01:42:46,580 --> 01:42:47,700
Discouraged, she said.

1822
01:42:47,940 --> 01:42:51,820
I have been assuming for three days and now this is getting worse.

1823
01:42:51,960 --> 01:42:53,500
I said to her, this is the test.

1824
01:42:54,000 --> 01:42:56,120
The old assumption is fighting for its life.

1825
01:42:56,660 --> 01:42:59,460
It will present its final evidence before it dissolves.

1826
01:42:59,740 --> 01:43:00,420
Do not waver.

1827
01:43:00,780 --> 01:43:02,640
Continue for the full seven days.

1828
01:43:03,080 --> 01:43:03,580
She did.

1829
01:43:03,980 --> 01:43:07,980
And I tell you, on the sixth day, the sixth day her husband appeared at her door.

1830
01:43:08,320 --> 01:43:09,720
He could not explain why.

1831
01:43:09,720 --> 01:43:15,700
He said only that he had to see her, that something in him would not let him continue with the divorce.

1832
01:43:16,160 --> 01:43:19,920
Within two weeks, he had left the other woman and returned home.

1833
01:43:20,200 --> 01:43:21,460
The divorce was withdrawn.

1834
01:43:21,880 --> 01:43:25,120
She wrote to me months later to say they had never been happier.

1835
01:43:25,580 --> 01:43:26,940
Now, what happened?

1836
01:43:27,060 --> 01:43:27,920
Did she change him?

1837
01:43:28,040 --> 01:43:28,320
No.

1838
01:43:28,780 --> 01:43:30,760
She changed her assumption about him.

1839
01:43:31,020 --> 01:43:35,080
And the moment her assumption changed and she persisted in that change,

1840
01:43:35,080 --> 01:43:40,960
The outer world, which is nothing but her consciousness pushed out, had no choice but to conform.

1841
01:43:41,520 --> 01:43:42,040
Pause.

1842
01:43:42,420 --> 01:43:45,480
But let me show you the mistakes she almost made.

1843
01:43:45,680 --> 01:43:49,740
Because these are the mystics most of you will make if you do not listen carefully.

1844
01:43:50,160 --> 01:43:51,320
Now hold this thought.

1845
01:43:51,700 --> 01:43:53,160
There is a specific mistake.

1846
01:43:53,480 --> 01:43:57,860
One that destroys more attempts at manifestation than all the others combined.

1847
01:43:57,860 --> 01:44:04,920
It concerns the difference between imagining and feeling, and most who study the law confuse the two completely.

1848
01:44:05,440 --> 01:44:13,160
I will show you that difference in just a moment, for without grasping it, you will imagine a thousand scenes and see nothing manifest.

1849
01:44:13,160 --> 01:44:17,100
The first mistake is imagining the means instead of the end.

1850
01:44:17,580 --> 01:44:25,540
When she first came to me, she wanted to imagine the phone ringing, imagine him calling, imagine the conversation that would bring him back.

1851
01:44:25,940 --> 01:44:26,700
I stopped her.

1852
01:44:26,780 --> 01:44:29,820
I said, do not imagine the journey, imagine the end.

1853
01:44:30,140 --> 01:44:31,600
You do not want a phone call.

1854
01:44:32,100 --> 01:44:34,160
You want to be his wife, happily married.

1855
01:44:34,500 --> 01:44:39,720
Imagine that, feel that, live in that state, and the phone call, if it is needed, will come.

1856
01:44:40,120 --> 01:44:42,240
But you do not create the bridge of incidents.

1857
01:44:42,240 --> 01:44:44,920
You live in the end and the bridge appears.

1858
01:44:45,540 --> 01:44:54,640
Now I must insist on this, my friend, because I have seen countless students waste months imagining steps when they should be imagining the end result.

1859
01:44:55,120 --> 01:44:57,980
There is no such thing as needing to visualize the how.

1860
01:44:58,380 --> 01:44:59,480
Put it from your mind.

1861
01:44:59,860 --> 01:45:01,340
The how is none of your concern.

1862
01:45:01,880 --> 01:45:08,280
The moment you occupy the state of the wish fulfilled and persist in it, the how arranges itself, without exception.

1863
01:45:08,280 --> 01:45:13,420
Do not let anyone, including yourself, talk you out of dwelling in the end.

1864
01:45:13,860 --> 01:45:16,220
The second mistake is technique without feeling.

1865
01:45:16,660 --> 01:45:22,320
You can imagine a scene a thousand times, but if you do not feel it real, nothing will happen.

1866
01:45:22,700 --> 01:45:24,860
The subconscious does not respond to pictures.

1867
01:45:25,320 --> 01:45:26,840
It does not respond to words.

1868
01:45:27,380 --> 01:45:28,760
It responds to feeling.

1869
01:45:29,320 --> 01:45:31,720
When you imagine your desire, you must feel it.

1870
01:45:31,920 --> 01:45:35,460
Feel the relief, the satisfaction, the naturalness of having it.

1871
01:45:35,460 --> 01:45:40,540
Not desperate wanting, not longing, but the quiet inner knowing that it is yours.

1872
01:45:40,760 --> 01:45:43,120
The third mistake is testing for results.

1873
01:45:43,640 --> 01:45:49,620
Many of you will assume your desire fulfilled tonight, and tomorrow morning you will look for evidence.

1874
01:45:50,220 --> 01:45:51,580
You will check your bank account.

1875
01:45:52,060 --> 01:45:53,140
You will look at your phone.

1876
01:45:53,420 --> 01:45:56,420
You will search for signs, and seeing none you will doubt.

1877
01:45:56,760 --> 01:45:58,040
My friend, do not test.

1878
01:45:58,420 --> 01:45:59,420
Do not look for signs.

1879
01:45:59,980 --> 01:46:02,460
You have planted the seed the moment you assumed.

1880
01:46:02,460 --> 01:46:05,240
Now you must leave it alone and let it grow.

1881
01:46:05,760 --> 01:46:09,860
If you dig up the seed every day to see if it is sprouting, you will kill it.

1882
01:46:10,420 --> 01:46:17,000
The fourth mistake, and this is the one that destroys most who hear me, is wavering when appearances intensify.

1883
01:46:17,360 --> 01:46:20,980
I told you the woman received the divorce papers on the fourth day.

1884
01:46:21,160 --> 01:46:22,240
This was not coincidence.

1885
01:46:22,960 --> 01:46:24,700
Every assumption will be tested.

1886
01:46:25,160 --> 01:46:27,500
The greater the assumption, the greater the test.

1887
01:46:27,820 --> 01:46:30,480
The old state will present its final evidence.

1888
01:46:30,480 --> 01:46:36,500
Facts may seem to worsen before they dissolve, and in that moment most return to the old assumption.

1889
01:46:36,960 --> 01:46:39,180
They say, I tried it and it didn't work.

1890
01:46:39,500 --> 01:46:40,320
It got worse.

1891
01:46:40,700 --> 01:46:42,760
They do not understand that this is the test.

1892
01:46:43,080 --> 01:46:44,320
Make no mistake, my friend.

1893
01:46:44,720 --> 01:46:49,140
The moment you assume a new state, the old state will fight for its life.

1894
01:46:49,440 --> 01:46:54,500
It will show you every reason why your assumption is foolish, why the facts cannot change,

1895
01:46:54,880 --> 01:46:57,460
why you should return to accepting what is.

1896
01:46:57,460 --> 01:46:59,680
And here is where you prove yourself.

1897
01:47:00,260 --> 01:47:03,280
Will you believe your assumption, or will you believe your senses?

1898
01:47:03,960 --> 01:47:07,320
The man who believes his assumption will see it harden into fact.

1899
01:47:07,880 --> 01:47:11,540
The man who believes his senses will remain in bondage to them.

1900
01:47:11,940 --> 01:47:14,280
Pause before I tell you how to begin this tonight.

1901
01:47:14,600 --> 01:47:16,360
I must address one thing more.

1902
01:47:16,660 --> 01:47:19,280
The test you will face, and you will face it.

1903
01:47:19,280 --> 01:47:25,220
Let me tell you of a man who came to my attention through correspondence in the early 1950s.

1904
01:47:25,500 --> 01:47:27,100
He was facing bankruptcy.

1905
01:47:27,640 --> 01:47:28,860
His business had failed.

1906
01:47:29,360 --> 01:47:30,720
Creditors were calling daily.

1907
01:47:31,240 --> 01:47:35,220
He owed more than he could pay in five years even if he found work immediately.

1908
01:47:35,780 --> 01:47:37,100
The numbers were catastrophic.

1909
01:47:37,460 --> 01:47:39,560
He had tried everything in the outer world.

1910
01:47:39,920 --> 01:47:40,740
Loans refused.

1911
01:47:41,380 --> 01:47:42,440
Partnerships dissolved.

1912
01:47:42,860 --> 01:47:44,580
Even family unwilling to help.

1913
01:47:44,580 --> 01:47:50,920
Someone gave him one of my books, and he wrote to me asking if the law could reverse even financial ruin.

1914
01:47:51,420 --> 01:47:58,360
I wrote back and told him to ignore the evidence of bankruptcy, and assume financial security for seven complete days.

1915
01:47:58,780 --> 01:48:02,100
I told him to feel himself debt-free, prosperous, secure.

1916
01:48:02,480 --> 01:48:04,980
Morning, noon, and night return to that feeling.

1917
01:48:05,320 --> 01:48:07,120
Let no contrary fact disturb you.

1918
01:48:07,120 --> 01:48:11,160
And on the seventh day, rest in the assumption that it is finished.

1919
01:48:11,520 --> 01:48:16,400
He wrote back saying he would try, though he doubted it could work with facts so severe.

1920
01:48:16,820 --> 01:48:17,780
But he persisted.

1921
01:48:18,060 --> 01:48:20,700
For the first four days, nothing changed outwardly.

1922
01:48:21,240 --> 01:48:24,900
On the fifth day, two more creditors threatened legal action.

1923
01:48:25,420 --> 01:48:28,500
On the sixth day, his landlord gave notice of eviction.

1924
01:48:29,020 --> 01:48:30,620
Everything appeared to be collapsing.

1925
01:48:31,160 --> 01:48:35,820
He wrote to me in desperation, saying the assumption seemed to be making things worse.

1926
01:48:35,820 --> 01:48:37,400
I replied immediately.

1927
01:48:37,780 --> 01:48:39,560
I told him, you are being tested.

1928
01:48:40,020 --> 01:48:42,360
The old state is presenting its final claim.

1929
01:48:42,620 --> 01:48:43,520
Do not accept it.

1930
01:48:43,640 --> 01:48:44,680
You have come this far.

1931
01:48:44,960 --> 01:48:46,760
Persist one more day, he did.

1932
01:48:46,940 --> 01:48:52,060
And on the seventh day, as he rested in the assumption of abundance, a letter arrived.

1933
01:48:52,260 --> 01:48:57,340
An old business associate from years past had heard of his situation and offered him a

1934
01:48:57,340 --> 01:49:04,120
position, a generous salary, immediate start, with an advance sufficient to settle the most pressing debts.

1935
01:49:04,120 --> 01:49:06,300
Within three months, he was solvent.

1936
01:49:06,780 --> 01:49:09,160
Within a year, he had saved more than he lost.

1937
01:49:09,740 --> 01:49:13,140
He later told me that the test on the sixth day nearly broke him.

1938
01:49:13,540 --> 01:49:17,720
But he had learned that persistence in assumption is everything, do you see?

1939
01:49:18,480 --> 01:49:22,240
Between the planting of the seed and the harvest, there is an interval.

1940
01:49:22,840 --> 01:49:24,640
During that interval, you will be tempted.

1941
01:49:24,980 --> 01:49:26,160
Tempted by appearances.

1942
01:49:26,640 --> 01:49:27,780
Tempted by doubt.

1943
01:49:28,140 --> 01:49:31,020
Tempted by the voices of reason that tell you to face facts.

1944
01:49:31,020 --> 01:49:32,480
You must not yield.

1945
01:49:32,820 --> 01:49:33,940
The seed has been planted.

1946
01:49:34,360 --> 01:49:35,140
It must grow.

1947
01:49:35,660 --> 01:49:39,760
Your only task is to persist in the assumption and let the Sabbath be complete.

1948
01:49:40,080 --> 01:49:40,540
Pause.

1949
01:49:40,940 --> 01:49:43,420
Now here is where the teaching turns, my friend.

1950
01:49:43,640 --> 01:49:46,560
Most who hear me stop right here in their understanding.

1951
01:49:46,980 --> 01:49:48,180
They grasp the technique.

1952
01:49:48,760 --> 01:49:50,100
They understand persistence.

1953
01:49:50,600 --> 01:49:54,300
But they miss the deeper truth about what assumption actually is.

1954
01:49:54,740 --> 01:49:58,800
There is a detail that separates those who succeed from those who fail.

1955
01:49:58,800 --> 01:50:04,460
And it concerns not what you do during your practice, but what you are being the rest of the day.

1956
01:50:04,880 --> 01:50:08,260
I must give you that detail now, for it changes everything.

1957
01:50:08,780 --> 01:50:10,840
You are not petitioning an external God.

1958
01:50:11,300 --> 01:50:13,520
You are not sending requests to the universe.

1959
01:50:14,160 --> 01:50:17,220
You are claiming in consciousness what is already yours.

1960
01:50:17,760 --> 01:50:22,180
The moment you assume the feeling of the wish fulfilled, it is done in consciousness.

1961
01:50:23,020 --> 01:50:24,860
Consciousness is the only reality.

1962
01:50:25,320 --> 01:50:27,800
The outer world is simply the echo, the reflection.

1963
01:50:27,800 --> 01:50:29,180
It must follow.

1964
01:50:29,560 --> 01:50:30,980
It has no power to resist.

1965
01:50:31,420 --> 01:50:33,420
You have heard many teachers speak of feeling.

1966
01:50:33,920 --> 01:50:37,260
I tell you most of them have misunderstood what I mean by feeling.

1967
01:50:37,600 --> 01:50:43,620
They teach emotional excitement, forced enthusiasm, pumping yourself up with positive emotion.

1968
01:50:44,160 --> 01:50:45,280
That is not what I teach.

1969
01:50:45,680 --> 01:50:46,540
That is not feeling.

1970
01:50:47,020 --> 01:50:52,260
True feeling is the calm inner knowing, the naturalness, the sense that it is already yours.

1971
01:50:52,560 --> 01:50:53,320
Not desperation.

1972
01:50:53,760 --> 01:50:54,300
Not longing.

1973
01:50:54,520 --> 01:50:54,940
Not hope.

1974
01:50:55,020 --> 01:50:55,980
But quiet possession.

1975
01:50:55,980 --> 01:50:59,900
When you wear your own coat, you do not get excited about it.

1976
01:50:59,980 --> 01:51:00,980
You simply wear it.

1977
01:51:01,460 --> 01:51:02,720
That is the feeling I mean.

1978
01:51:03,000 --> 01:51:05,780
The naturalness of having, not the frenzy of wanting.

1979
01:51:06,320 --> 01:51:07,580
But you must live in the end.

1980
01:51:08,040 --> 01:51:09,220
Not in the hope of the end.

1981
01:51:09,220 --> 01:51:11,280
Not in the journey toward the end.

1982
01:51:11,280 --> 01:51:14,620
In the end itself, as though it is already accomplished.

1983
01:51:14,700 --> 01:51:18,280
If you desire health, do not imagine yourself getting better.

1984
01:51:18,660 --> 01:51:19,840
Imagine yourself well.

1985
01:51:20,440 --> 01:51:21,320
Do what you would do.

1986
01:51:21,500 --> 01:51:22,640
Feel what you would feel.

1987
01:51:23,100 --> 01:51:25,700
Think what you would think if you were already healthy.

1988
01:51:25,700 --> 01:51:29,240
If you desire wealth, do not imagine money coming.

1989
01:51:29,620 --> 01:51:31,040
Imagine yourself having it.

1990
01:51:31,440 --> 01:51:32,500
Feel the freedom of it.

1991
01:51:32,820 --> 01:51:34,480
Live as the man who has abundance.

1992
01:51:34,980 --> 01:51:36,320
The end contains the means.

1993
01:51:36,920 --> 01:51:38,800
You do not need to know how it will happen.

1994
01:51:39,300 --> 01:51:40,580
That is not your concern.

1995
01:51:40,760 --> 01:51:42,720
Your concern is to occupy the state.

1996
01:51:42,720 --> 01:51:43,640
To dwell in it.

1997
01:51:43,760 --> 01:51:44,680
To feel it natural.

1998
01:51:45,180 --> 01:51:47,540
When you do this, the how takes care of itself.

1999
01:51:48,000 --> 01:51:49,380
The bridge of incidents appears.

2000
01:51:49,980 --> 01:51:52,320
Doors open that you did not know existed.

2001
01:51:52,760 --> 01:51:55,080
People act in ways you could not have predicted.

2002
01:51:55,960 --> 01:51:57,620
Circumstances rearrange themselves.

2003
01:51:58,080 --> 01:52:01,360
All of this happens automatically when you persist in the assumption.

2004
01:52:02,380 --> 01:52:05,620
Now my friend, let me tell you how to apply this tonight.

2005
01:52:06,040 --> 01:52:07,660
How to begin your seven days.

2006
01:52:08,020 --> 01:52:09,800
But before I give you the six steps,

2007
01:52:09,800 --> 01:52:14,640
There is one thing about the moment just before sleep that you must understand.

2008
01:52:15,020 --> 01:52:15,780
It is the moment.

2009
01:52:16,280 --> 01:52:17,080
The single moment.

2010
01:52:17,520 --> 01:52:22,460
When the assumption either takes root in the subconscious or evaporates like morning mist.

2011
01:52:23,040 --> 01:52:26,240
Most lose the state in that moment without even knowing it.

2012
01:52:26,620 --> 01:52:31,780
I will show you exactly what happens in that moment and how to hold the state through it.

2013
01:52:32,080 --> 01:52:36,060
For it determines whether the law works for you tonight or remains theory.

2014
01:52:36,060 --> 01:52:40,360
First, you must select your desire and reduce it to a single scene.

2015
01:52:40,880 --> 01:52:41,840
Not ten things.

2016
01:52:42,060 --> 01:52:42,540
One thing.

2017
01:52:42,900 --> 01:52:43,540
One desire.

2018
01:52:43,940 --> 01:52:49,340
And from that desire, construct a scene that would naturally occur if that desire were already fulfilled.

2019
01:52:49,820 --> 01:52:52,340
If you want marriage, see the ring on your finger.

2020
01:52:52,720 --> 01:52:56,300
If you want employment, feel yourself at the desk doing the work.

2021
01:52:56,300 --> 01:53:00,960
If you want reconciliation, feel the embrace, hear the words of love.

2022
01:53:01,320 --> 01:53:02,000
Make it simple.

2023
01:53:02,280 --> 01:53:02,980
Make it specific.

2024
01:53:03,400 --> 01:53:05,520
Make it something that implies the wish fulfilled.

2025
01:53:06,060 --> 01:53:10,120
Second, tonight when you retire to bed, you will enter into that scene.

2026
01:53:10,400 --> 01:53:11,320
Not think about it.

2027
01:53:11,520 --> 01:53:12,280
Enter into it.

2028
01:53:12,600 --> 01:53:13,640
Feel yourself in it.

2029
01:53:13,920 --> 01:53:15,040
See what you would see.

2030
01:53:15,480 --> 01:53:16,520
Hear what you would hear.

2031
01:53:16,860 --> 01:53:17,920
Touch what you would touch.

2032
01:53:18,340 --> 01:53:19,980
Make it vivid, real, sensory.

2033
01:53:20,440 --> 01:53:23,120
And most importantly, feel the naturalness of it.

2034
01:53:23,120 --> 01:53:27,340
The feeling that it is already done, that this is simply how things are.

2035
01:53:27,660 --> 01:53:29,860
Third, do not strain to hold the scene.

2036
01:53:30,160 --> 01:53:30,840
Do not effort.

2037
01:53:31,260 --> 01:53:34,920
Gently return to it when your mind wanders, but let it be easy.

2038
01:53:35,260 --> 01:53:36,260
You are not forcing.

2039
01:53:36,580 --> 01:53:37,880
You are resting in the assumption.

2040
01:53:38,460 --> 01:53:40,620
Fall asleep in that state if you can.

2041
01:53:40,980 --> 01:53:44,780
Let the assumption soak into the subconscious as you drift into sleep.

2042
01:53:45,080 --> 01:53:47,240
This is the critical moment I spoke of.

2043
01:53:47,560 --> 01:53:50,460
As you drift from waking consciousness into sleep,

2044
01:53:50,460 --> 01:53:53,680
Hold the feeling, the naturalnesses, the quiet knowing.

2045
01:53:54,300 --> 01:53:57,460
Do not let your last waking thought be doubt or the old facts.

2046
01:53:57,880 --> 01:54:00,460
Let it be the assumption felt as natural and real.

2047
01:54:00,920 --> 01:54:04,040
That threshold moment, that state akin to sleep,

2048
01:54:04,340 --> 01:54:07,960
is when the seed enters the ground of your subconscious and takes root.

2049
01:54:08,660 --> 01:54:10,780
Fourth, tomorrow morning when you wake,

2050
01:54:11,160 --> 01:54:12,440
recall the scene briefly.

2051
01:54:12,840 --> 01:54:14,360
Feel it again for just a moment.

2052
01:54:14,780 --> 01:54:15,960
Then go about your day.

2053
01:54:16,420 --> 01:54:17,960
And here is the critical instruction.

2054
01:54:17,960 --> 01:54:21,040
During the day, when the facts present themselves,

2055
01:54:21,400 --> 01:54:23,000
when the senses scream otherwise,

2056
01:54:23,360 --> 01:54:24,340
do not fight them.

2057
01:54:24,700 --> 01:54:25,880
Do not argue with them.

2058
01:54:26,320 --> 01:54:29,620
Simply and gently turn from them and return to your assumption.

2059
01:54:29,960 --> 01:54:30,980
A creditor calls.

2060
01:54:31,220 --> 01:54:32,320
Feel yourself abundant.

2061
01:54:32,760 --> 01:54:33,580
The body aches.

2062
01:54:33,800 --> 01:54:34,800
Feel yourself well.

2063
01:54:35,200 --> 01:54:36,240
The person is absent.

2064
01:54:36,580 --> 01:54:37,220
Feel them present.

2065
01:54:37,400 --> 01:54:38,940
Turn, return, turn, return.

2066
01:54:39,200 --> 01:54:40,020
This is not effort.

2067
01:54:40,280 --> 01:54:40,960
This is rest.

2068
01:54:41,180 --> 01:54:43,920
Fifth, repeat this every night for seven nights.

2069
01:54:44,420 --> 01:54:46,460
Morning and evening, dwell in the state.

2070
01:54:46,460 --> 01:54:49,900
During the day, turn from contrary facts without force.

2071
01:54:50,420 --> 01:54:51,340
You are not struggling.

2072
01:54:51,840 --> 01:54:54,140
You are simply refusing to give power to shadow.

2073
01:54:54,580 --> 01:54:57,220
And sixth, on the seventh day, rest completely.

2074
01:54:57,620 --> 01:54:58,600
Cease from all labor.

2075
01:54:59,140 --> 01:55:00,360
Do not check for results.

2076
01:55:00,740 --> 01:55:01,840
Do not imagine anymore.

2077
01:55:02,240 --> 01:55:03,560
Simply know that it is done.

2078
01:55:04,000 --> 01:55:04,740
Enter the Sabbath.

2079
01:55:05,140 --> 01:55:06,580
Let the assumption be complete.

2080
01:55:07,160 --> 01:55:08,420
The law will do the rest.

2081
01:55:08,580 --> 01:55:09,960
This is what I ask you to do.

2082
01:55:10,280 --> 01:55:13,000
Seven days, not seven weeks, not seven months.

2083
01:55:13,000 --> 01:55:18,060
Seven days of persistence in the assumption, followed by rest in the knowledge that it is

2084
01:55:18,060 --> 01:55:18,440
finished.

2085
01:55:18,760 --> 01:55:22,640
I tell you with certainty, and this is not opinion, it is law.

2086
01:55:23,120 --> 01:55:28,180
If you persist in the assumption of the wish fulfilled for seven complete days without

2087
01:55:28,180 --> 01:55:33,980
wavering, without reacting to contrary evidence, without giving power to the senses, the outer

2088
01:55:33,980 --> 01:55:35,040
world must conform.

2089
01:55:35,260 --> 01:55:36,180
It has no choice.

2090
01:55:36,640 --> 01:55:37,880
Consciousness is cause.

2091
01:55:37,880 --> 01:55:39,260
The world is effect.

2092
01:55:39,740 --> 01:55:41,400
And effect must follow cause.

2093
01:55:41,740 --> 01:55:46,680
Without exception, do not be misled by those who tell you the law works sometimes or for

2094
01:55:46,680 --> 01:55:47,360
some people.

2095
01:55:47,860 --> 01:55:49,380
They have not understood the law.

2096
01:55:49,740 --> 01:55:54,240
When properly applied, it works every time for everyone, because it is law.

2097
01:55:54,760 --> 01:55:57,660
And now I tell you, my friend, the secret is this.

2098
01:55:57,780 --> 01:55:59,860
The outer world has no power, none.

2099
01:56:00,160 --> 01:56:00,820
It never did.

2100
01:56:01,060 --> 01:56:01,720
It never will.

2101
01:56:02,060 --> 01:56:06,100
All power is in consciousness, in your assumption, in the state you occupy.

2102
01:56:06,100 --> 01:56:10,480
When you ignore your reality for seven days, you are not denying facts.

2103
01:56:11,040 --> 01:56:14,780
You are withdrawing power from shadow and giving it to substance.

2104
01:56:15,180 --> 01:56:17,440
Shadow cannot stand without your attention.

2105
01:56:17,960 --> 01:56:21,980
The moment you turn from it and dwell in the wish fulfilled, it must dissolve.

2106
01:56:22,480 --> 01:56:24,660
The world you see is not resisting you.

2107
01:56:24,920 --> 01:56:26,060
It is not fighting you.

2108
01:56:26,460 --> 01:56:31,180
It is simply reflecting the assumption you held yesterday, last week, last month.

2109
01:56:31,520 --> 01:56:32,460
Change the assumption.

2110
01:56:32,960 --> 01:56:34,340
Persist in the new assumption.

2111
01:56:34,920 --> 01:56:36,400
And the reflection must change.

2112
01:56:36,500 --> 01:56:37,480
It has no choice.

2113
01:56:37,760 --> 01:56:38,640
This is not metaphor.

2114
01:56:38,980 --> 01:56:39,620
This is law.

2115
01:56:40,200 --> 01:56:41,280
Consciousness is cause.

2116
01:56:41,460 --> 01:56:42,400
The world is effect.

2117
01:56:42,880 --> 01:56:44,400
And effect must follow cause.

2118
01:56:44,680 --> 01:56:46,020
Pause tonight when you retire.

2119
01:56:46,220 --> 01:56:47,240
Do this just once.

2120
01:56:47,560 --> 01:56:48,520
Select your desire.

2121
01:56:49,080 --> 01:56:52,020
Reduce it to a single scene that implies its fulfillment.

2122
01:56:52,360 --> 01:56:53,220
Enter that scene.

2123
01:56:53,600 --> 01:56:54,280
Feel it real.

2124
01:56:54,640 --> 01:56:56,740
Let the naturalness of it wash over you.

2125
01:56:57,040 --> 01:56:58,100
And then sleep in it.

2126
01:56:58,320 --> 01:56:59,340
That is all I ask.

2127
01:56:59,340 --> 01:57:05,020
Just tonight, just once, and if tomorrow the outer world has not yet changed, return to the

2128
01:57:05,020 --> 01:57:10,340
assumption tomorrow night, and the next night, and the next, seven nights, seven complete

2129
01:57:10,340 --> 01:57:14,480
cycles, and on the seventh night, rest in the knowledge that it is finished.

2130
01:57:15,040 --> 01:57:16,280
Do not look for evidence.

2131
01:57:16,500 --> 01:57:17,880
Do not test for results.

2132
01:57:18,280 --> 01:57:21,220
Simply rest in the Sabbath of your fulfilled desire.

2133
01:57:21,720 --> 01:57:23,860
I tell you with all the certainty I possess.

2134
01:57:23,860 --> 01:57:26,020
Consciousness is the only reality.

2135
01:57:26,480 --> 01:57:28,140
Imagining creates reality.

2136
01:57:28,460 --> 01:57:33,960
The world is a technique I have not often spoken of publicly, though I have used it myself

2137
01:57:33,960 --> 01:57:39,100
for years, and taught it to a small number of students who came to me in private.

2138
01:57:39,640 --> 01:57:41,760
I call it the falling backward technique.

2139
01:57:41,760 --> 01:57:47,380
And I tell you now, if you have been struggling to enter the state akin to sleep, if you lie

2140
01:57:47,380 --> 01:57:52,500
down at night with your desire clearly in mind but cannot seem to impress it upon your

2141
01:57:52,500 --> 01:57:55,520
deepest self, this technique will solve that problem.

2142
01:57:55,940 --> 01:57:58,140
But only if you understand why it works.

2143
01:57:58,680 --> 01:58:01,980
Most who attempt to change their state make a fundamental error.

2144
01:58:02,440 --> 01:58:04,840
They try to think their way into the new state.

2145
01:58:05,080 --> 01:58:05,700
They visualize.

2146
01:58:06,100 --> 01:58:06,580
They affirm.

2147
01:58:07,000 --> 01:58:08,740
They use the mind against the mind.

2148
01:58:08,740 --> 01:58:14,380
And all the while, the body, the body with its insistent testimony of present circumstances,

2149
01:58:14,880 --> 01:58:16,980
keeps them locked exactly where they are.

2150
01:58:17,440 --> 01:58:21,680
You cannot assume a new state while your body shouts the evidence of the old.

2151
01:58:22,040 --> 01:58:23,040
Do you see the problem?

2152
01:58:23,600 --> 01:58:28,220
The falling backward technique works because it uses the body itself as the doorway.

2153
01:58:28,820 --> 01:58:33,860
It quiets the tyranny of the senses by giving them a single, absorbing sensation,

2154
01:58:34,320 --> 01:58:35,560
the sensation of falling.

2155
01:58:35,560 --> 01:58:41,120
And in that moment of surrender, when the body releases its grip, assumption enters unopposed.

2156
01:58:41,520 --> 01:58:44,320
Tonight, I will show you exactly how to do this.

2157
01:58:44,840 --> 01:58:49,360
But first, you must understand what you are actually entering when you fall backward.

2158
01:58:49,760 --> 01:58:50,080
Pause.

2159
01:58:50,480 --> 01:58:55,280
Now let me tell you why the body is the problem and why this falling backward technique solves

2160
01:58:55,280 --> 01:58:55,480
it.

2161
01:58:55,480 --> 01:58:56,520
You live in a body.

2162
01:58:56,660 --> 01:59:03,760
And that body, with its five senses, testifies constantly to the reality of your present circumstances.

2163
01:59:04,280 --> 01:59:05,340
You see the bank statement.

2164
01:59:05,800 --> 01:59:07,680
You feel the empty bed beside you.

2165
01:59:08,060 --> 01:59:11,060
You hear the voice of the employer who refuses your raise.

2166
01:59:11,440 --> 01:59:14,920
And all day long, my friend, your body is collecting evidence.

2167
01:59:15,220 --> 01:59:18,720
Evidence that shouts, this is what is real, this is what is true.

2168
01:59:18,720 --> 01:59:20,960
And then at night you lie down.

2169
01:59:21,340 --> 01:59:22,400
You close your eyes.

2170
01:59:22,660 --> 01:59:24,680
And you attempt to assume a new state.

2171
01:59:25,140 --> 01:59:26,620
You try to feel yourself wealthy.

2172
01:59:26,960 --> 01:59:28,620
You try to imagine yourself loved.

2173
01:59:29,120 --> 01:59:32,280
You try to convince your deeper self that the wish is fulfilled.

2174
01:59:32,800 --> 01:59:34,440
But the body will not cooperate.

2175
01:59:35,000 --> 01:59:37,360
The body remembers the evidence of the day.

2176
01:59:37,920 --> 01:59:39,560
It holds tension in its muscles.

2177
01:59:39,560 --> 01:59:45,240
It keeps you locked in waking consciousness with its insistent signals of discomfort, hunger,

2178
01:59:45,600 --> 01:59:46,100
restlessness.

2179
01:59:46,780 --> 01:59:48,680
You cannot think your way past the body.

2180
01:59:49,260 --> 01:59:50,960
This is what most do not understand.

2181
01:59:51,480 --> 01:59:53,760
They believe imagination is purely mental.

2182
01:59:54,260 --> 01:59:58,820
They sit in a chair and strain to visualize while their body fidgets and resists.

2183
01:59:59,340 --> 02:00:04,320
Or they lie in bed and try to picture scenes while their body remains rigid, alert, fully

2184
02:00:04,320 --> 02:00:06,260
identified with present facts.

2185
02:00:06,460 --> 02:00:07,920
Now I must insist on this.

2186
02:00:07,920 --> 02:00:13,480
My friend, because I have seen too many fail for lack of understanding it, the body is not

2187
02:00:13,480 --> 02:00:13,980
your enemy.

2188
02:00:14,520 --> 02:00:17,520
It is not an obstacle to overcome through willpower.

2189
02:00:18,020 --> 02:00:22,100
It is the very instrument through which consciousness operates in this world.

2190
02:00:22,540 --> 02:00:26,940
And if you try to assume a new state while ignoring the body or fighting against it,

2191
02:00:27,000 --> 02:00:27,660
you will fail.

2192
02:00:27,980 --> 02:00:28,740
Not sometimes.

2193
02:00:29,100 --> 02:00:29,460
Always.

2194
02:00:29,900 --> 02:00:32,280
The body must be enlisted, not defeated.

2195
02:00:32,760 --> 02:00:35,940
My old teacher Abdullah taught me this many years ago.

2196
02:00:35,940 --> 02:00:40,160
I was young then, living in New York, and I came to him with a problem.

2197
02:00:40,600 --> 02:00:43,500
I wanted to travel to Barbados to see my family.

2198
02:00:43,660 --> 02:00:44,360
I had no money.

2199
02:00:44,480 --> 02:00:45,180
I had no ticket.

2200
02:00:45,740 --> 02:00:51,040
And though I had been studying the law, I could not seem to assume the state of being in Barbados

2201
02:00:51,040 --> 02:00:54,180
while my body sat in a cramped apartment in Manhattan.

2202
02:00:54,540 --> 02:00:56,140
Abdullah looked at me and said,

2203
02:00:56,140 --> 02:00:58,300
Neville, you are in your head.

2204
02:00:58,740 --> 02:01:01,580
You think if you imagine hard enough the body will follow.

2205
02:01:02,100 --> 02:01:03,640
But it does not work that way.

2206
02:01:04,060 --> 02:01:05,820
The body must be quieted first.

2207
02:01:06,280 --> 02:01:09,020
You cannot enter the state while the body shouts at you.

2208
02:01:09,300 --> 02:01:11,220
I did not understand him at first.

2209
02:01:11,680 --> 02:01:13,580
I thought visualization was enough.

2210
02:01:13,860 --> 02:01:14,620
But he insisted.

2211
02:01:14,800 --> 02:01:15,220
Feel it.

2212
02:01:15,460 --> 02:01:16,120
He told me.

2213
02:01:16,360 --> 02:01:17,220
Not with your mind.

2214
02:01:17,300 --> 02:01:17,920
With your body.

2215
02:01:18,340 --> 02:01:20,480
Your body knows before your mind accepts.

2216
02:01:20,480 --> 02:01:22,820
He taught me to work with sensation.

2217
02:01:23,280 --> 02:01:25,160
Not to fight the body but to use it.

2218
02:01:25,500 --> 02:01:27,120
To give it something so absorbing.

2219
02:01:27,600 --> 02:01:28,420
So natural.

2220
02:01:28,920 --> 02:01:33,460
That it would release its grip on present circumstances and allow consciousness to shift.

2221
02:01:33,980 --> 02:01:35,820
And one of the techniques he showed me,

2222
02:01:36,160 --> 02:01:38,940
though I have not often spoken of it in my public lectures,

2223
02:01:39,280 --> 02:01:41,140
was this falling backward sensation.

2224
02:01:41,840 --> 02:01:46,240
It works, my friend, because it mimics something the body already knows.

2225
02:01:46,720 --> 02:01:48,180
The surrender into sleep.

2226
02:01:48,180 --> 02:01:49,060
Do you see?

2227
02:01:49,220 --> 02:01:52,280
Every night of your life, your body falls into sleep.

2228
02:01:52,540 --> 02:01:53,760
It knows how to let go.

2229
02:01:54,180 --> 02:01:56,480
It knows how to release the grip of the senses.

2230
02:01:56,820 --> 02:01:59,120
But most people cannot control this process.

2231
02:01:59,660 --> 02:02:01,240
They wait for sleep to take them.

2232
02:02:01,720 --> 02:02:03,340
They cannot induce it at will,

2233
02:02:03,740 --> 02:02:06,820
while remaining conscious enough to direct their imagination.

2234
02:02:07,420 --> 02:02:09,840
The falling backward technique gives you control.

2235
02:02:10,540 --> 02:02:13,020
You deliberately induce the sensation of falling.

2236
02:02:13,600 --> 02:02:15,180
Not a mental picture of falling,

2237
02:02:15,180 --> 02:02:19,560
But the physical sensation, the feeling in your body of tipping backward,

2238
02:02:19,980 --> 02:02:22,020
of surrendering, of letting go.

2239
02:02:22,140 --> 02:02:23,460
And the moment you do this,

2240
02:02:23,940 --> 02:02:25,720
the body recognizes the pattern.

2241
02:02:26,040 --> 02:02:27,160
It begins to release.

2242
02:02:27,520 --> 02:02:28,480
The sense is quiet.

2243
02:02:28,880 --> 02:02:32,120
And in that suspension, that moment between waking and sleeping,

2244
02:02:32,580 --> 02:02:34,500
assumption can enter unopposed.

2245
02:02:35,040 --> 02:02:36,360
But hold this thought.

2246
02:02:36,820 --> 02:02:39,740
There is a specific signal, a physical signal in your body,

2247
02:02:39,740 --> 02:02:42,600
that tells you the assumption has taken root.

2248
02:02:43,140 --> 02:02:44,840
Without recognizing that signal,

2249
02:02:45,180 --> 02:02:47,300
you will practice this technique blindly,

2250
02:02:47,880 --> 02:02:52,160
never knowing whether you have succeeded or merely relaxed your body into sleep.

2251
02:02:52,680 --> 02:02:55,020
I will give you that signal in just a moment.

2252
02:02:55,660 --> 02:02:59,180
But first you must understand the mistakes that prevent it from appearing.

2253
02:02:59,920 --> 02:03:01,280
Now hold this thought.

2254
02:03:01,720 --> 02:03:04,060
I will give you the exact method in a moment.

2255
02:03:04,440 --> 02:03:07,320
But first I must tell you what most people do wrong.

2256
02:03:07,320 --> 02:03:11,040
Because if you make these errors, the technique will not work.

2257
02:03:11,320 --> 02:03:12,600
The first error is this.

2258
02:03:13,080 --> 02:03:15,140
They try to think their way into the state.

2259
02:03:15,660 --> 02:03:17,560
Even when they lie down to practice.

2260
02:03:17,880 --> 02:03:19,520
Even when they close their eyes.

2261
02:03:19,960 --> 02:03:22,320
They are still using the mind against the mind.

2262
02:03:22,520 --> 02:03:23,080
They visualize.

2263
02:03:23,560 --> 02:03:24,120
They affirm.

2264
02:03:24,560 --> 02:03:26,080
They mentally rehearse scenes.

2265
02:03:26,540 --> 02:03:30,440
And all the while the body remains tense, alert, unconvinced.

2266
02:03:30,540 --> 02:03:32,980
I tell you, and this is not opinion but law.

2267
02:03:33,440 --> 02:03:36,020
Visualization has its place but it is not the doorway.

2268
02:03:36,260 --> 02:03:36,700
Sensation.

2269
02:03:37,260 --> 02:03:38,540
Sensation is the doorway.

2270
02:03:39,160 --> 02:03:43,660
A physical feeling carries more conviction to the subconscious than any mental picture.

2271
02:03:44,000 --> 02:03:44,280
Why?

2272
02:03:44,780 --> 02:03:47,100
Because the body does not argue with sensation.

2273
02:03:47,580 --> 02:03:48,460
It accepts it.

2274
02:03:48,720 --> 02:03:52,940
When you feel yourself falling, the body responds as though you are falling.

2275
02:03:53,420 --> 02:03:55,700
And where the body goes, consciousness follows.

2276
02:03:56,200 --> 02:04:01,580
Do not be misled by the teachers who tell you to visualize harder, longer, more vividly.

2277
02:04:01,580 --> 02:04:03,900
They have not understood this principle.

2278
02:04:03,900 --> 02:04:08,340
They are asking you to use the weakest tool when the strongest is available.

2279
02:04:08,340 --> 02:04:10,480
The second error is this.

2280
02:04:10,480 --> 02:04:13,240
They attempt to force the state through effort.

2281
02:04:13,240 --> 02:04:15,860
They lie down with clenched determination.

2282
02:04:15,860 --> 02:04:17,700
They grit their teeth.

2283
02:04:17,700 --> 02:04:21,260
And try to make themselves feel wealthy, loved, successful.

2284
02:04:21,260 --> 02:04:24,040
But assumption does not come through force.

2285
02:04:24,040 --> 02:04:32,880
It comes through surrender, through letting go, through falling backward out of the old state and trusting that the new state will catch you.

2286
02:04:32,880 --> 02:04:35,840
Make no mistake, this requires trust.

2287
02:04:35,840 --> 02:04:41,000
When you feel yourself falling backward, there is a moment, just a moment, when the ego resists.

2288
02:04:41,520 --> 02:04:42,720
It fears annihilation.

2289
02:04:43,220 --> 02:04:44,640
It fears the loss of control.

2290
02:04:45,000 --> 02:04:52,020
And if you tense against the sensation, if you fight it, you will snap back into waking consciousness and the technique will fail.

2291
02:04:52,440 --> 02:04:53,800
You must surrender to the fall.

2292
02:04:54,100 --> 02:04:54,940
You must let go.

2293
02:04:55,380 --> 02:04:57,440
Not recklessly, but deliberately.

2294
02:04:58,160 --> 02:04:59,680
You are not falling into darkness.

2295
02:05:00,260 --> 02:05:02,420
You are falling into the state you have chosen.

2296
02:05:03,020 --> 02:05:04,960
You are falling into the wish fulfilled.

2297
02:05:04,960 --> 02:05:06,180
Pause now.

2298
02:05:06,180 --> 02:05:11,300
Let me tell you of a woman who came to me through correspondence in the late 1950s.

2299
02:05:11,580 --> 02:05:12,940
She lived in the Midwest.

2300
02:05:13,620 --> 02:05:19,040
And she wrote to me because she had been trying for nearly a year to assume the state of being married.

2301
02:05:19,600 --> 02:05:21,380
She wanted marriage desperately.

2302
02:05:21,960 --> 02:05:24,600
But every technique she tried seemed to fail.

2303
02:05:25,080 --> 02:05:27,200
She would visualize the ring on her finger.

2304
02:05:27,660 --> 02:05:29,980
She would imagine conversations with a husband.

2305
02:05:30,480 --> 02:05:32,060
She would feel herself loved.

2306
02:05:32,060 --> 02:05:35,900
And yet, month after month, nothing changed in her outer world.

2307
02:05:36,460 --> 02:05:39,020
She came to hear me lecture when I spoke in her city.

2308
02:05:39,480 --> 02:05:43,440
After the lecture, she approached me, discouraged and near tears.

2309
02:05:43,580 --> 02:05:45,740
I have done everything you teach, she said.

2310
02:05:46,040 --> 02:05:47,440
I have imagined the end.

2311
02:05:47,880 --> 02:05:48,960
I have felt it real.

2312
02:05:49,380 --> 02:05:50,340
But nothing happens.

2313
02:05:50,720 --> 02:05:51,700
What am I doing wrong?

2314
02:05:51,900 --> 02:05:53,680
I asked her to describe her practice.

2315
02:05:53,680 --> 02:05:56,600
And as she spoke, I saw the problem immediately.

2316
02:05:57,040 --> 02:05:59,980
She was spending hours each day visualizing hours.

2317
02:06:00,420 --> 02:06:05,940
She would sit in a chair and strain to hold mental pictures of her wedding, her home, her husband.

2318
02:06:06,440 --> 02:06:10,000
But she admitted that her body was always tense during these sessions.

2319
02:06:10,580 --> 02:06:12,080
She could never fully relax.

2320
02:06:12,620 --> 02:06:16,440
She could never enter that drowsy state I had described in my lectures.

2321
02:06:16,440 --> 02:06:19,040
You are trying too hard, I told her.

2322
02:06:19,480 --> 02:06:22,380
The state you seek does not require hours of effort.

2323
02:06:22,680 --> 02:06:25,020
It requires one moment of complete acceptance.

2324
02:06:25,760 --> 02:06:30,160
And you cannot reach that moment while your body is tense and your mind is straining.

2325
02:06:30,620 --> 02:06:32,400
At first, she resisted this.

2326
02:06:32,880 --> 02:06:35,420
She believed that more effort meant more power.

2327
02:06:35,780 --> 02:06:42,320
She thought if she could just visualize longer, more vividly, with more detail, the law would finally respond.

2328
02:06:42,740 --> 02:06:44,960
I told her forget visualization for now.

2329
02:06:44,960 --> 02:06:48,380
Tonight, when you go to bed, I want you to do only this.

2330
02:06:48,820 --> 02:06:51,840
Lie down and induce the sensation of falling backward.

2331
02:06:52,300 --> 02:06:53,520
Not a picture of falling.

2332
02:06:53,880 --> 02:06:54,840
The feeling of falling.

2333
02:06:55,320 --> 02:06:57,920
As though you are tipping backward into a deep cushion.

2334
02:06:58,420 --> 02:07:01,960
And as you fall, assume the simple feeling of being a married woman.

2335
02:07:02,500 --> 02:07:03,160
Not scenes.

2336
02:07:03,780 --> 02:07:04,620
Not conversations.

2337
02:07:05,200 --> 02:07:05,920
Just the feeling.

2338
02:07:06,300 --> 02:07:07,800
The naturalness of being married.

2339
02:07:08,200 --> 02:07:10,780
Let the fall carry you into sleep from that state.

2340
02:07:11,120 --> 02:07:14,080
She looked uncertain, but she agreed to try.

2341
02:07:14,080 --> 02:07:16,940
Three weeks later, I received a letter from her.

2342
02:07:17,380 --> 02:07:19,440
She had practiced the technique every night.

2343
02:07:19,720 --> 02:07:23,720
The first few nights, the sensation startled her back to wakefulness.

2344
02:07:24,260 --> 02:07:27,860
She would feel herself falling and instinctively tense against it.

2345
02:07:28,220 --> 02:07:29,320
But she persisted.

2346
02:07:29,720 --> 02:07:34,140
And by the fourth or fifth night, she learned to surrender to the fall without fear.

2347
02:07:34,540 --> 02:07:35,060
She wrote,

2348
02:07:35,060 --> 02:07:40,380
The moment I stopped fighting the sensation and let myself fall, something shifted.

2349
02:07:40,860 --> 02:07:45,260
I cannot describe it except to say that for the first time, I felt married.

2350
02:07:45,620 --> 02:07:47,000
Not hopeful of being married.

2351
02:07:47,440 --> 02:07:49,060
Not visualizing being married.

2352
02:07:49,400 --> 02:07:52,020
But actually feeling the state as natural and real.

2353
02:07:52,500 --> 02:07:58,980
Within two weeks of that shift, a man she had known casually for years began pursuing her with sudden intensity.

2354
02:07:58,980 --> 02:08:02,820
They were engaged within a month and married shortly after.

2355
02:08:03,240 --> 02:08:05,700
She wrote to me again months later and said,

2356
02:08:06,020 --> 02:08:08,080
It was not the visualization that did it.

2357
02:08:08,340 --> 02:08:10,300
It was the falling, the surrender.

2358
02:08:10,840 --> 02:08:16,560
The moment I stopped trying to make it happen and simply let myself fall into the state, it became real.

2359
02:08:16,560 --> 02:08:18,260
Do you see what happened?

2360
02:08:18,920 --> 02:08:21,000
She stopped using the mind against the mind.

2361
02:08:21,120 --> 02:08:22,120
She stopped straining.

2362
02:08:22,640 --> 02:08:29,700
And she used the body, the falling sensation, to quiet the ego and enter that drowsy state where assumption takes root.

2363
02:08:30,200 --> 02:08:32,740
In that state, assumption hardened into fact.

2364
02:08:33,060 --> 02:08:33,500
Pause.

2365
02:08:33,640 --> 02:08:35,580
Now I will give you the exact method.

2366
02:08:36,080 --> 02:08:39,300
And here is where I will show you that signal I spoke of earlier.

2367
02:08:39,720 --> 02:08:43,120
The physical signal that tells you the assumption has been impressed.

2368
02:08:43,840 --> 02:08:46,300
Listen carefully, because every detail matters.

2369
02:08:47,160 --> 02:08:50,000
Tonight, when you retire to bed, you will do this.

2370
02:08:50,380 --> 02:08:52,720
First, you will lie down in a comfortable position.

2371
02:08:53,200 --> 02:08:57,600
On your back is best, with your arms at your sides or resting on your abdomen.

2372
02:08:58,100 --> 02:09:03,040
You are preparing for sleep, so the room should be dark and you should be alone and undisturbed.

2373
02:09:03,520 --> 02:09:07,340
Second, you will close your eyes and begin to relax your body.

2374
02:09:07,800 --> 02:09:08,780
Do not rush this.

2375
02:09:09,180 --> 02:09:10,100
Let your breath slow.

2376
02:09:10,100 --> 02:09:12,960
Let your muscles release their tension one by one.

2377
02:09:13,480 --> 02:09:14,580
This is not meditation.

2378
02:09:14,580 --> 02:09:16,580
This is preparation for sleep.

2379
02:09:16,820 --> 02:09:24,140
You are moving toward that drowsy state where the conscious mind begins to fade and the subconscious becomes impressionable.

2380
02:09:24,680 --> 02:09:25,760
Third, and this is the key.

2381
02:09:26,200 --> 02:09:28,740
You will induce the sensation of falling backward.

2382
02:09:29,180 --> 02:09:30,300
Not a mental picture.

2383
02:09:30,300 --> 02:09:38,340
Imagine that the bed beneath you is tipping, that you are falling backward into a soft, infinite cushion.

2384
02:09:38,820 --> 02:09:47,060
Or imagine that you are sitting in a chair and suddenly it tips backward and you feel that lurch in your stomach, that surrender of control.

2385
02:09:47,060 --> 02:09:49,420
Let the sensation fill your awareness.

2386
02:09:49,700 --> 02:09:52,180
Let it become so real that your body responds.

2387
02:09:52,580 --> 02:09:54,620
Fourth, do not resist the sensation.

2388
02:09:54,860 --> 02:09:55,560
This is critical.

2389
02:09:56,040 --> 02:09:58,980
The first few times you do this, your body may startle.

2390
02:09:59,240 --> 02:10:02,620
You may feel a jolt and snap back to full waking consciousness.

2391
02:10:03,120 --> 02:10:04,500
This is the ego resisting.

2392
02:10:05,020 --> 02:10:06,100
Do not be discouraged.

2393
02:10:06,400 --> 02:10:07,400
Simply begin again.

2394
02:10:07,940 --> 02:10:12,060
Induce the sensation once more and each time surrender a little more deeply.

2395
02:10:12,300 --> 02:10:13,040
Trust the fall.

2396
02:10:13,040 --> 02:10:17,860
Fifth, as you feel yourself falling backward, assume the feeling of the wish fulfilled.

2397
02:10:18,360 --> 02:10:21,520
Not a scene, not a conversation, just the feeling.

2398
02:10:22,020 --> 02:10:25,900
If you desire wealth, feel the ease and security of wealth as you fall.

2399
02:10:26,120 --> 02:10:30,800
If you desire love, feel the warmth and naturalness of being loved as you fall.

2400
02:10:31,260 --> 02:10:35,500
If you desire health, feel the vitality and strength of health as you fall.

2401
02:10:35,980 --> 02:10:40,380
Let the falling carry both the sensation and the assumption together into sleep.

2402
02:10:40,380 --> 02:10:44,920
And sixth, let yourself drift into actual sleep from that assumption.

2403
02:10:45,440 --> 02:10:47,540
Do not try to hold the feeling with effort.

2404
02:10:47,800 --> 02:10:48,900
Simply rest in it.

2405
02:10:49,300 --> 02:10:52,320
Let the fall carry you all the way into unconsciousness.

2406
02:10:52,800 --> 02:10:56,900
And let the last thing your awareness knows be the feeling of the wish fulfilled.

2407
02:10:57,600 --> 02:10:59,920
Now here is the signal I promised you.

2408
02:11:00,200 --> 02:11:04,720
When the assumption has truly been impressed, when it has taken root in your subconscious,

2409
02:11:04,720 --> 02:11:07,720
you will feel a release, a letting go.

2410
02:11:08,120 --> 02:11:12,500
It is as though something inside you exhales and says, yes, this is done.

2411
02:11:12,500 --> 02:11:14,420
Your body will relax completely.

2412
02:11:14,800 --> 02:11:15,740
Your breath will deepen.

2413
02:11:16,300 --> 02:11:20,860
And you will drift into sleep with a sense of peace, of completion, of naturalness.

2414
02:11:21,360 --> 02:11:23,360
That signal, my friend, is your confirmation.

2415
02:11:24,000 --> 02:11:27,280
When you feel it, you know the law is now in operation.

2416
02:11:28,040 --> 02:11:28,940
This is the technique.

2417
02:11:29,420 --> 02:11:30,160
Simple, is it not?

2418
02:11:30,160 --> 02:11:32,760
But do not mistake simplicity for weakness.

2419
02:11:33,280 --> 02:11:35,640
I have tested this method in my own experience.

2420
02:11:36,140 --> 02:11:37,720
I have seen it work for others.

2421
02:11:38,020 --> 02:11:40,720
And I tell you now, if you persist in this practice,

2422
02:11:41,220 --> 02:11:45,180
if you do it nightly without doubt, your assumption will harden into fact.

2423
02:11:45,900 --> 02:11:47,780
But there are mistakes you must avoid.

2424
02:11:48,200 --> 02:11:53,340
I have seen students fail with this technique because they misunderstood one critical detail.

2425
02:11:53,780 --> 02:11:55,320
The first mistake is this.

2426
02:11:55,860 --> 02:11:57,480
They fall backward into nothing.

2427
02:11:57,480 --> 02:12:02,480
They induce the sensation of falling, but they do not know where they are falling to.

2428
02:12:02,800 --> 02:12:05,460
My friend, you are not falling into emptiness.

2429
02:12:06,040 --> 02:12:08,140
You are falling into a specific state.

2430
02:12:08,520 --> 02:12:13,220
Before you begin the technique, you must decide upon the state you wish to assume.

2431
02:12:13,540 --> 02:12:14,900
Name it, feel it, know it.

2432
02:12:15,200 --> 02:12:17,520
Then as you fall, you fall into that state.

2433
02:12:17,980 --> 02:12:19,400
The falling is not the goal.

2434
02:12:19,920 --> 02:12:22,640
The falling is the vehicle that carries you to the goal.

2435
02:12:22,640 --> 02:12:28,440
The second mistake is trying to physically fall or tensing against the sensation out of fear.

2436
02:12:28,740 --> 02:12:31,740
You must understand, this is an imagined sensation.

2437
02:12:32,280 --> 02:12:33,540
You are not actually moving.

2438
02:12:33,960 --> 02:12:36,000
Your body remains still on the bed.

2439
02:12:36,500 --> 02:12:39,860
But your consciousness is experiencing the sensation of falling.

2440
02:12:40,360 --> 02:12:47,160
When students confuse this and either try to make their body move or resist the sensation because it feels too real,

2441
02:12:47,540 --> 02:12:49,800
they break the trance and the technique fails.

2442
02:12:49,800 --> 02:12:53,440
The third mistake is attempting to visualize while falling.

2443
02:12:53,900 --> 02:12:57,400
I tell you, let go of visualization for this technique.

2444
02:12:58,020 --> 02:13:01,400
The falling backward method works through sensation, not sight.

2445
02:13:01,940 --> 02:13:07,760
You are giving the body an absorbing physical feeling that captures attention and induces surrender.

2446
02:13:08,300 --> 02:13:14,380
If you try to add mental pictures on top of the sensation, you divide your attention and weaken the effect.

2447
02:13:14,680 --> 02:13:16,440
Feel the fall, feel the assumption.

2448
02:13:16,960 --> 02:13:17,680
That is all.

2449
02:13:17,680 --> 02:13:19,280
Pause now, my friend.

2450
02:13:19,420 --> 02:13:22,440
I want you to understand something deeper about why this works.

2451
02:13:23,000 --> 02:13:25,220
It is not merely a trick to relax the body.

2452
02:13:25,640 --> 02:13:27,620
It is a rehearsal of something profound.

2453
02:13:28,400 --> 02:13:32,780
You have heard me speak of dying to the old state, and some have misunderstood me.

2454
02:13:33,260 --> 02:13:34,980
They think I speak metaphorically.

2455
02:13:35,120 --> 02:13:35,900
Let me be plain.

2456
02:13:36,360 --> 02:13:40,380
Every assumption requires an actual death, a death of the old state.

2457
02:13:40,700 --> 02:13:42,520
You cannot be two states at once.

2458
02:13:42,520 --> 02:13:45,500
To assume you are wealthy, you must die to poverty.

2459
02:13:45,780 --> 02:13:48,240
To assume you are loved, you must die to loneliness.

2460
02:13:48,880 --> 02:13:51,860
To assume you are healed, you must die to illness.

2461
02:13:52,400 --> 02:13:55,380
This is what I mean when I tell you that you must be born again.

2462
02:13:55,840 --> 02:13:57,900
The old must die so the new can live.

2463
02:13:58,300 --> 02:13:59,840
There is no gradual transition.

2464
02:14:00,360 --> 02:14:04,020
There is no middle ground where you are partly the old and partly the new.

2465
02:14:04,020 --> 02:14:07,260
There is only the death of one and the birth of the other.

2466
02:14:07,880 --> 02:14:11,320
And this falling backward, this surrender, is as a little death.

2467
02:14:11,760 --> 02:14:13,580
It is the ego releasing its grip.

2468
02:14:13,960 --> 02:14:16,040
It is the body letting go of what was.

2469
02:14:16,320 --> 02:14:20,840
And in that moment of suspension, that moment of falling, you are between states.

2470
02:14:21,020 --> 02:14:23,520
You are no longer the old and not yet fully the new.

2471
02:14:23,660 --> 02:14:26,280
You are malleable, impressionable, open.

2472
02:14:26,280 --> 02:14:32,460
And if in that moment, you assume the feeling of the wish fulfilled, you will land in that state.

2473
02:14:33,060 --> 02:14:36,600
You will be caught by your own imagination and resurrected in the new.

2474
02:14:37,100 --> 02:14:38,860
This is the secret of the technique.

2475
02:14:39,340 --> 02:14:45,100
It works not because it is clever, but because it mirrors the actual mechanism of transformation.

2476
02:14:45,700 --> 02:14:48,180
Consciousness cannot shift while clinging to the old.

2477
02:14:48,360 --> 02:14:49,320
It must let go.

2478
02:14:49,480 --> 02:14:50,300
It must fall.

2479
02:14:50,300 --> 02:14:56,500
And the falling backward technique teaches your body and your consciousness to surrender together.

2480
02:14:56,960 --> 02:15:02,460
Pause, but before I tell you how to apply this tonight, there is one final thing I must address.

2481
02:15:02,940 --> 02:15:09,260
It is the thing that separates those who practice this technique once and see their world respond within days

2482
02:15:09,260 --> 02:15:12,940
from those who practice it for months and see nothing.

2483
02:15:13,460 --> 02:15:14,120
It is this.

2484
02:15:14,380 --> 02:15:16,360
What you do the moment you wake in the morning.

2485
02:15:16,360 --> 02:15:21,340
Most who study the law sabotage themselves in the first 60 seconds of waking.

2486
02:15:21,920 --> 02:15:25,600
I must tell you what happens in that moment and how to guard against it.

2487
02:15:26,080 --> 02:15:29,840
Remember what I told you earlier about the woman from the Midwest.

2488
02:15:30,420 --> 02:15:33,680
She spent a year trying to visualize her way into marriage.

2489
02:15:33,980 --> 02:15:34,440
A year.

2490
02:15:34,780 --> 02:15:38,860
And nothing changed until she learned to fall backward into the assumption.

2491
02:15:39,340 --> 02:15:40,960
Do you see now why that worked?

2492
02:15:41,280 --> 02:15:42,340
She stopped fighting.

2493
02:15:42,540 --> 02:15:43,520
She stopped straining.

2494
02:15:43,680 --> 02:15:44,260
She surrendered.

2495
02:15:44,260 --> 02:15:47,560
And in that surrender, the state became hers.

2496
02:15:48,060 --> 02:15:50,460
Now let me tell you how to apply this tonight.

2497
02:15:50,880 --> 02:15:51,600
Do not wait.

2498
02:15:51,920 --> 02:15:55,660
Do not tell yourself you will try this next week or when conditions are better.

2499
02:15:56,160 --> 02:15:56,500
Tonight.

2500
02:15:57,040 --> 02:15:59,700
When you lie down to sleep tonight, you will test this.

2501
02:15:59,960 --> 02:16:03,380
Before you begin, decide upon one state, one assumption.

2502
02:16:03,920 --> 02:16:06,400
Do not try to assume five things at once.

2503
02:16:06,740 --> 02:16:08,380
Choose one thing you desire to be.

2504
02:16:08,500 --> 02:16:09,560
Reduce it to a feeling.

2505
02:16:09,980 --> 02:16:12,220
Not a complicated scene with many details.

2506
02:16:12,220 --> 02:16:13,860
Just a single feeling.

2507
02:16:14,180 --> 02:16:15,580
The feeling of the wish fulfilled.

2508
02:16:16,040 --> 02:16:16,800
Then lie down.

2509
02:16:16,940 --> 02:16:17,760
Relax your body.

2510
02:16:18,160 --> 02:16:20,400
And induce the falling backward sensation.

2511
02:16:20,800 --> 02:16:21,580
Surrender to it.

2512
02:16:21,940 --> 02:16:26,280
And as you fall, wrap yourself in that feeling as though it were a garment.

2513
02:16:26,760 --> 02:16:29,900
Let the fall carry you and the feeling together into sleep.

2514
02:16:29,900 --> 02:16:32,960
Do this every night, not occasionally, every night.

2515
02:16:33,160 --> 02:16:34,700
Persist in the assumption.

2516
02:16:34,980 --> 02:16:40,080
And I tell you, an assumption though false, if persisted in, will harden into fact.

2517
02:16:40,500 --> 02:16:41,300
This is the law.

2518
02:16:41,700 --> 02:16:43,300
The world is yourself pushed out.

2519
02:16:43,620 --> 02:16:49,380
And when you fall backward into a new state and persist in dwelling there, the world must reflect it.

2520
02:16:49,380 --> 02:16:51,780
You do not need to believe it is true.

2521
02:16:52,140 --> 02:16:55,420
You need only to persistence the assumption as though it were true.

2522
02:16:55,900 --> 02:17:01,060
And this falling backward, this nightly practice, is persistence in physical form.

2523
02:17:01,620 --> 02:17:03,980
Now here is what you must guard against in the morning.

2524
02:17:03,980 --> 02:17:14,960
When you wake, your conscious mind rushes back in and with it comes the memory of your circumstances, the evidence of the senses, the problems you fell asleep trying to solve.

2525
02:17:15,340 --> 02:17:28,840
And if, in that first waking moment, you allow your attention to return to the old state, if you immediately begin thinking about bills, loneliness, illness, lack, you have dissolved the assumption you impressed the night before.

2526
02:17:28,840 --> 02:17:32,500
Instead, the moment you wake, lie still for a moment.

2527
02:17:32,960 --> 02:17:34,100
Do not leap out of bed.

2528
02:17:34,280 --> 02:17:35,660
Do not reach for concerns.

2529
02:17:36,260 --> 02:17:42,900
Simply recall the feeling you fell asleep in, the assumption, and rest in it for just a few seconds before you rise.

2530
02:17:43,220 --> 02:17:44,480
This protects the impression.

2531
02:17:45,080 --> 02:17:47,360
This allows it to harden throughout the day.

2532
02:17:47,800 --> 02:17:52,620
I give you this technique not because you need it forever, but because you need it now.

2533
02:17:53,080 --> 02:17:56,400
You have not yet learned to simply be the state without effort.

2534
02:17:56,400 --> 02:18:01,440
So, practice this falling backward until the day comes when you no longer fall.

2535
02:18:01,920 --> 02:18:02,860
You simply are.

2536
02:18:03,460 --> 02:18:03,720
Pause.

2537
02:18:04,060 --> 02:18:08,200
And now I tell you my friend, the secret you have just heard is simpler than you imagined.

2538
02:18:08,780 --> 02:18:13,640
You have been looking for complicated methods, advanced techniques, special knowledge.

2539
02:18:14,000 --> 02:18:17,540
But the truth is this, the falling backward is not the power.

2540
02:18:18,020 --> 02:18:21,700
The power is in what you are falling into, always the state.

2541
02:18:21,700 --> 02:18:28,240
When you fall backward tonight and assume the feeling of the wish fulfilled, you are not performing a technique.

2542
02:18:28,780 --> 02:18:30,440
You are entering a state of consciousness.

2543
02:18:31,100 --> 02:18:34,520
And from that state, the world has no choice but to conform.

2544
02:18:35,120 --> 02:18:36,920
The world is yourself pushed out.

2545
02:18:37,240 --> 02:18:39,500
Change the state and the world must change.

2546
02:18:39,640 --> 02:18:40,320
This is law.

2547
02:18:40,760 --> 02:18:45,980
The falling backward simply makes the shift possible when you have not yet learned to shift at will.

2548
02:18:45,980 --> 02:18:47,260
It quites the body.

2549
02:18:47,760 --> 02:18:48,980
It suspends the ego.

2550
02:18:49,460 --> 02:18:50,400
It opens the door.

2551
02:18:50,820 --> 02:18:53,940
But you must walk through that door into the state you have chosen.

2552
02:18:54,220 --> 02:18:55,820
That is where creation happens.

2553
02:18:56,000 --> 02:18:56,840
In the state.

2554
02:18:57,700 --> 02:19:00,280
Tonight, when you lie down to sleep, test this.

2555
02:19:00,460 --> 02:19:01,140
Just once.

2556
02:19:01,480 --> 02:19:03,780
Induce the sensation of falling backward.

2557
02:19:03,980 --> 02:19:04,740
Surrender to it.

2558
02:19:04,860 --> 02:19:08,160
And as you fall, assume the feeling of your wish fulfilled.

2559
02:19:08,600 --> 02:19:10,560
Let that feeling carry you into sleep.

2560
02:19:10,800 --> 02:19:11,460
That is all.

2561
02:19:11,680 --> 02:19:12,820
Do not analyze it.

2562
02:19:12,820 --> 02:19:15,340
Do not question whether you did it correctly.

2563
02:19:15,880 --> 02:19:17,160
Do not wonder if it worked.

2564
02:19:17,480 --> 02:19:19,320
Simply do it, and then let it go.

2565
02:19:19,720 --> 02:19:20,640
Sleep in the assumption.

2566
02:19:21,240 --> 02:19:22,240
Rest in the state.

2567
02:19:22,620 --> 02:19:25,840
And let consciousness do its perfect work while you sleep.

2568
02:19:26,420 --> 02:19:31,640
If in the morning you find that nothing has changed in your outer world, do not be discouraged.

2569
02:19:31,860 --> 02:19:32,300
Persist.

2570
02:19:32,860 --> 02:19:37,400
Fall backward again the next night and the next until the assumption becomes natural.

2571
02:19:37,860 --> 02:19:41,320
Until you no longer need to fall because you simply are the state.

2572
02:19:41,320 --> 02:19:54,100
But I tell you, if you do this with full surrender, if you truly let yourself fall into the wish fulfilled and sleep there, you will know in your own experience that what I have told you, Nate, it is true.

2573
02:19:54,840 --> 02:19:56,380
Consciousness is the only reality.

2574
02:19:56,780 --> 02:19:58,020
Imagining creatureality.

2575
02:19:58,300 --> 02:20:02,060
An assumption, though false, if persisted in, will harden into fact.

2576
02:20:02,460 --> 02:20:05,640
May you fall tonight into the arms of your own fulfilled desire.

2577
02:20:06,220 --> 02:20:07,700
May you awaken in the state.

2578
02:20:07,700 --> 02:20:11,380
If you believe that money is the root of all evil, you will never have it.

2579
02:20:12,160 --> 02:20:16,400
Not because money itself is evil, but because your consciousness of money is poisoned.

2580
02:20:16,920 --> 02:20:19,600
I learned this from my teacher Abdullah many years ago.

2581
02:20:20,080 --> 02:20:24,820
But I tell you honestly, for six months after he told me, I did not understand what he meant.

2582
02:20:25,560 --> 02:20:31,600
Six months of struggle, six months of applying what I thought was his teaching, and nothing changed in my financial world.

2583
02:20:31,600 --> 02:20:37,140
Then one morning as I was walking down the street in New York, the meaning struck me like lightning.

2584
02:20:37,900 --> 02:20:41,240
What Abdullah had told me was not what I thought he had told me at all.

2585
02:20:41,860 --> 02:20:45,140
The moment I grasped his real meaning, everything changed.

2586
02:20:45,580 --> 02:20:47,220
Not gradually, immediately.

2587
02:20:47,680 --> 02:20:52,800
Tonight I will give you his exact words, and I will tell you why I misunderstood them for so long.

2588
02:20:52,800 --> 02:21:00,160
Because the misunderstanding I had is the same misunderstanding that keeps most people in financial bondage their entire lives.

2589
02:21:00,440 --> 02:21:02,920
They think they know what it means to feel wealthy.

2590
02:21:03,500 --> 02:21:04,320
They do not.

2591
02:21:04,700 --> 02:21:07,780
They are feeling the very opposite, and calling it wealth.

2592
02:21:08,640 --> 02:21:09,400
Listen carefully.

2593
02:21:09,820 --> 02:21:15,320
I will tell you exactly what Abdullah said to me, and why it took me six months to understand his meaning.

2594
02:21:15,320 --> 02:21:20,760
I had gone to him, as I did so many times in those early years, troubled about money.

2595
02:21:21,120 --> 02:21:27,220
I was a young man then, living in New York, and like most young men, I thought my problem was that I did not have enough money.

2596
02:21:27,340 --> 02:21:30,260
I thought if I could just get more money, I would feel secure.

2597
02:21:30,580 --> 02:21:37,420
If I could just find the right opportunity, the right job, the right investment, then I would have peace of mind about my finances.

2598
02:21:38,500 --> 02:21:41,280
Abdullah listened to me with those penetrating eyes of his.

2599
02:21:41,280 --> 02:21:45,800
When I finished explaining my situation, he said something I will never forget.

2600
02:21:46,180 --> 02:21:48,980
He said, Neville, you are putting the cart before the horse.

2601
02:21:49,700 --> 02:21:51,900
You think you need money to feel wealthy.

2602
02:21:52,340 --> 02:21:55,060
I tell you, you must feel wealthy to have money.

2603
02:21:55,260 --> 02:21:57,680
At the time, I thought I understood what he meant.

2604
02:21:58,540 --> 02:22:02,880
Of course, I said to myself, I must feel confident about money.

2605
02:22:03,200 --> 02:22:05,600
I must think positive thoughts about prosperity.

2606
02:22:06,120 --> 02:22:08,300
I must visualize having wealth.

2607
02:22:08,720 --> 02:22:11,120
And so I began to do exactly that.

2608
02:22:11,840 --> 02:22:12,980
Or so I thought.

2609
02:22:13,220 --> 02:22:17,740
For the next six months, my friend, I practiced what I believed Abdullah had taught me.

2610
02:22:18,440 --> 02:22:21,900
Every morning I would look in the mirror and tell myself I was wealthy.

2611
02:22:22,280 --> 02:22:24,700
I would visualize money in my bank account.

2612
02:22:25,200 --> 02:22:28,760
I would imagine myself spending freely buying whatever I wanted.

2613
02:22:29,260 --> 02:22:32,680
I would repeat affirmations about abundance and prosperity.

2614
02:22:33,060 --> 02:22:34,160
But nothing changed.

2615
02:22:34,560 --> 02:22:34,860
Nothing.

2616
02:22:34,860 --> 02:22:38,820
My financial situation remained exactly as it had been.

2617
02:22:39,240 --> 02:22:41,440
I became frustrated then discouraged.

2618
02:22:41,900 --> 02:22:45,480
Had Abdullah been wrong, was I not applying his teaching correctly?

2619
02:22:45,480 --> 02:22:47,620
But hold this thought.

2620
02:22:47,620 --> 02:22:53,320
There is one specific emotion that reveals whether you are truly feeling wealthy or merely hoping

2621
02:22:53,320 --> 02:22:54,280
to become wealthy.

2622
02:22:54,680 --> 02:22:59,760
Without recognizing this emotion in yourself, you will practice for years and see no change.

2623
02:22:59,760 --> 02:23:04,800
I will show you exactly what that emotion is and how to detect it in just a moment.

2624
02:23:05,080 --> 02:23:07,960
I remember the morning when the truth finally struck me.

2625
02:23:08,380 --> 02:23:13,440
I was walking down Fifth Avenue and I passed by a store window displaying expensive suits.

2626
02:23:13,440 --> 02:23:16,940
As I looked at those suits, I caught myself thinking,

2627
02:23:17,460 --> 02:23:21,280
Someday when I have money, I will be able to afford clothes like that.

2628
02:23:21,480 --> 02:23:23,440
In that moment, the lightning struck.

2629
02:23:23,740 --> 02:23:27,200
You see, my friend, all those months I thought I was feeling wealthy,

2630
02:23:27,640 --> 02:23:29,960
but I was actually feeling the exact opposite.

2631
02:23:30,480 --> 02:23:32,220
I was feeling the lack of wealth.

2632
02:23:32,580 --> 02:23:34,460
I was feeling the waiting for wealth.

2633
02:23:34,720 --> 02:23:36,460
I was feeling the hoping for wealth.

2634
02:23:36,720 --> 02:23:38,640
But I was not feeling wealth itself.

2635
02:23:39,040 --> 02:23:41,600
Abdullah had not told me to think about having money.

2636
02:23:41,600 --> 02:23:45,020
He had not told me to hope for money or to wait for money.

2637
02:23:45,460 --> 02:23:46,980
He had told me to feel wealthy.

2638
02:23:47,440 --> 02:23:51,780
Not to feel like I was going to be wealthy, but to feel wealthy now, in this moment,

2639
02:23:51,960 --> 02:23:54,220
regardless of what my bank account showed.

2640
02:23:54,580 --> 02:23:56,400
The difference, my friend, is everything.

2641
02:23:57,320 --> 02:24:00,060
When you hope for something, you are affirming its absence.

2642
02:24:00,760 --> 02:24:04,340
When you wait for something, you are living in the consciousness of not having it.

2643
02:24:04,720 --> 02:24:07,400
When you think positive thoughts about future prosperity,

2644
02:24:07,820 --> 02:24:09,840
you are still living from present lack.

2645
02:24:09,840 --> 02:24:12,120
You have heard teachers speak of visualization.

2646
02:24:12,820 --> 02:24:15,840
You have heard them speak of affirmations and positive thinking.

2647
02:24:16,260 --> 02:24:17,120
Let me be plain.

2648
02:24:17,560 --> 02:24:20,600
Most who teach these things have not understood what they are teaching.

2649
02:24:21,120 --> 02:24:24,280
They confuse the act of visualizing with the state of consciousness.

2650
02:24:24,900 --> 02:24:28,120
They confuse the repetition of words with the assumption of being.

2651
02:24:28,580 --> 02:24:31,620
I tell you, you can visualize until your eyes grow tired.

2652
02:24:31,720 --> 02:24:35,900
But if you are visualizing from the state of lack, you will demonstrate only more lack.

2653
02:24:35,900 --> 02:24:40,360
Let me tell you about a woman who came to my lectures in Los Angeles many years ago.

2654
02:24:40,740 --> 02:24:44,980
She had been studying what she called prosperity teachings for over three years.

2655
02:24:45,520 --> 02:24:46,780
Three years, my friend.

2656
02:24:46,900 --> 02:24:51,300
She had read every book, attended every lecture, practiced every technique she could find.

2657
02:24:51,740 --> 02:24:55,000
Yet her financial situation had not improved by one dollar.

2658
02:24:55,380 --> 02:24:58,780
When she approached me after one of my lectures, she was nearly in tears.

2659
02:24:58,780 --> 02:25:01,720
Mr. Goddard, she said, I have tried everything.

2660
02:25:01,840 --> 02:25:03,520
I visualize money every day.

2661
02:25:03,640 --> 02:25:05,620
I affirm my abundance every morning.

2662
02:25:05,980 --> 02:25:08,060
I make vision boards and treasure maps.

2663
02:25:08,180 --> 02:25:10,280
I think only positive thoughts about money.

2664
02:25:10,600 --> 02:25:11,720
But nothing works.

2665
02:25:12,140 --> 02:25:13,360
What am I doing wrong?

2666
02:25:14,080 --> 02:25:15,800
I asked her a simple question.

2667
02:25:16,300 --> 02:25:18,860
When you are visualizing this money, how do you feel?

2668
02:25:18,860 --> 02:25:21,380
Well, she said, I feel hopeful.

2669
02:25:21,900 --> 02:25:24,140
I feel excited about when it will come to me.

2670
02:25:24,380 --> 02:25:25,980
And when you are not visualizing?

2671
02:25:26,160 --> 02:25:26,680
I asked.

2672
02:25:27,200 --> 02:25:27,880
She paused.

2673
02:25:28,080 --> 02:25:30,100
When I'm not visualizing, I feel worried.

2674
02:25:30,460 --> 02:25:32,220
I feel anxious about my bills.

2675
02:25:32,720 --> 02:25:35,200
I feel frustrated that the money hasn't come yet.

2676
02:25:36,060 --> 02:25:37,600
There was her answer, my friend.

2677
02:25:37,740 --> 02:25:41,080
She was spending 10 minutes a day feeling hopeful about future money,

2678
02:25:41,460 --> 02:25:45,860
and the remaining 23 hours and 50 minutes feeling anxious about present lack.

2679
02:25:45,860 --> 02:25:49,780
Which state do you think was being impressed upon her subconscious mind?

2680
02:25:50,580 --> 02:25:52,860
Here is the emotion I promised to reveal to you.

2681
02:25:53,300 --> 02:25:54,900
It is the feeling of expectation.

2682
02:25:55,580 --> 02:25:59,480
When you are truly wealthy in consciousness, you do not expect money to come.

2683
02:26:00,020 --> 02:26:02,720
You rest in the satisfaction of already having it.

2684
02:26:03,460 --> 02:26:05,600
Expectation always implies absence.

2685
02:26:06,540 --> 02:26:08,100
Satisfaction implies presence.

2686
02:26:08,480 --> 02:26:10,520
At first she resisted my explanation.

2687
02:26:11,240 --> 02:26:14,400
She had invested so much time and energy in her techniques,

2688
02:26:14,400 --> 02:26:16,460
her visualizations, her affirmations.

2689
02:26:16,900 --> 02:26:19,820
But these methods have worked for other people, she protested.

2690
02:26:20,120 --> 02:26:22,040
I told her what I am telling you now.

2691
02:26:22,540 --> 02:26:24,140
The method is not what matters.

2692
02:26:24,420 --> 02:26:25,740
The state is what matters.

2693
02:26:26,460 --> 02:26:28,980
You can visualize until your eyes grow tired,

2694
02:26:29,120 --> 02:26:30,860
but if you are visualizing from lack,

2695
02:26:30,980 --> 02:26:32,800
you will only demonstrate more lack.

2696
02:26:33,100 --> 02:26:37,240
You can affirm abundance with your lips while your consciousness rests in poverty,

2697
02:26:37,680 --> 02:26:39,720
and poverty is what you will experience.

2698
02:26:39,720 --> 02:26:44,200
I instructed her to stop all her techniques for one week.

2699
02:26:44,840 --> 02:26:48,820
Instead I told her to live from the assumption that she was already financially free.

2700
02:26:49,180 --> 02:26:51,460
Not that she was going to be financially free,

2701
02:26:51,780 --> 02:26:54,820
but that she was financially free now, in consciousness.

2702
02:26:54,820 --> 02:26:57,020
How do I do that?

2703
02:26:57,080 --> 02:26:57,620
She asked.

2704
02:26:58,140 --> 02:26:59,480
Very simply, I told her.

2705
02:26:59,840 --> 02:27:01,680
When you see something you want to buy,

2706
02:27:02,200 --> 02:27:04,400
instead of thinking I cannot afford that,

2707
02:27:04,580 --> 02:27:05,920
assume you can afford it.

2708
02:27:06,200 --> 02:27:07,640
You may choose not to buy it,

2709
02:27:07,700 --> 02:27:09,380
but assume you could if you wish to.

2710
02:27:10,160 --> 02:27:11,480
When you pay your bills,

2711
02:27:11,600 --> 02:27:13,900
instead of feeling the pinch of parting with money,

2712
02:27:14,480 --> 02:27:17,380
feel the satisfaction of easily meeting your obligations.

2713
02:27:17,900 --> 02:27:19,480
When you think about your future,

2714
02:27:19,640 --> 02:27:21,960
instead of worrying about financial security,

2715
02:27:21,960 --> 02:27:25,320
rest in the assumption that you are financially secure.

2716
02:27:25,640 --> 02:27:27,460
She came to see me three weeks later,

2717
02:27:27,680 --> 02:27:29,160
and her face was transformed.

2718
02:27:29,620 --> 02:27:30,640
In those three weeks,

2719
02:27:30,760 --> 02:27:33,640
she had received an unexpected bonus from her employer,

2720
02:27:34,120 --> 02:27:36,440
a refund check she had forgotten about,

2721
02:27:36,760 --> 02:27:39,820
and an offer for additional work that would double her income.

2722
02:27:40,100 --> 02:27:41,140
But more importantly,

2723
02:27:41,300 --> 02:27:45,560
she had discovered the secret that Abdullah had tried to teach me so many years before.

2724
02:27:45,560 --> 02:27:47,100
The secret is this.

2725
02:27:47,560 --> 02:27:49,240
Consciousness is the only reality.

2726
02:27:49,940 --> 02:27:51,340
What you are conscious of being,

2727
02:27:51,460 --> 02:27:51,900
you are.

2728
02:27:52,240 --> 02:27:53,860
If you are conscious of being poor,

2729
02:27:53,980 --> 02:27:54,580
you are poor,

2730
02:27:54,980 --> 02:27:57,020
regardless of the money in your bank account.

2731
02:27:57,420 --> 02:27:59,020
If you are conscious of being wealthy,

2732
02:27:59,140 --> 02:27:59,760
you are wealthy,

2733
02:27:59,920 --> 02:28:01,240
regardless of your present circumstances.

2734
02:28:02,380 --> 02:28:04,920
Now I must tell you something most teachers will not.

2735
02:28:05,720 --> 02:28:07,560
There is a precise moment in your day

2736
02:28:07,560 --> 02:28:11,100
when your true financial consciousness reveals itself completely.

2737
02:28:12,100 --> 02:28:13,000
Miss this moment,

2738
02:28:13,000 --> 02:28:15,660
and you will never know whether you are truly assuming wealth

2739
02:28:15,660 --> 02:28:17,720
or merely playing with the idea of it.

2740
02:28:18,060 --> 02:28:19,720
I will show you that moment now.

2741
02:28:20,800 --> 02:28:22,920
Most people have this backwards, my friend.

2742
02:28:23,540 --> 02:28:26,280
They believe they will be conscious of wealth when they have money.

2743
02:28:27,020 --> 02:28:27,700
I tell you,

2744
02:28:27,800 --> 02:28:29,960
you will have money when you are conscious of wealth.

2745
02:28:30,220 --> 02:28:32,380
Remember what I told you a few moments ago

2746
02:28:32,380 --> 02:28:35,520
about the difference between feeling wealthy and hoping for wealth.

2747
02:28:36,000 --> 02:28:39,360
Now this is where you see why this distinction matters so profoundly.

2748
02:28:39,800 --> 02:28:41,640
The moment I speak of is this.

2749
02:28:41,640 --> 02:28:43,840
The moment you wake in the morning

2750
02:28:43,840 --> 02:28:45,620
before you have had time to think

2751
02:28:45,620 --> 02:28:47,820
what is your natural feeling about money,

2752
02:28:48,220 --> 02:28:49,600
in that unguarded moment

2753
02:28:49,600 --> 02:28:52,080
what rises spontaneously in your consciousness,

2754
02:28:52,640 --> 02:28:53,960
relief that you have enough

2755
02:28:53,960 --> 02:28:55,700
or anxiety that you do not.

2756
02:28:56,040 --> 02:28:57,400
That moment, my friend,

2757
02:28:57,580 --> 02:28:59,300
that first feeling upon waking

2758
02:28:59,300 --> 02:29:01,920
reveals your true assumption about money.

2759
02:29:02,700 --> 02:29:03,600
Everything else,

2760
02:29:03,700 --> 02:29:05,580
all your techniques and visualizations

2761
02:29:05,580 --> 02:29:08,840
are merely what you are trying to convince yourself to believe,

2762
02:29:08,840 --> 02:29:11,680
but that first feeling is what you actually believe.

2763
02:29:12,060 --> 02:29:13,480
This is what the scripture means

2764
02:29:13,480 --> 02:29:16,100
when it speaks of the rich man and the eye of the needle.

2765
02:29:16,720 --> 02:29:19,840
The world will tell you this passage condemns wealth itself.

2766
02:29:20,340 --> 02:29:21,700
I tell you they are wrong.

2767
02:29:22,380 --> 02:29:24,740
The rich man who cannot enter the kingdom of heaven

2768
02:29:24,740 --> 02:29:27,240
is not the one who has money in his bank account.

2769
02:29:27,640 --> 02:29:30,480
The rich man is the one who is rich in his own conception,

2770
02:29:31,000 --> 02:29:34,120
the one who believes his security comes from external things

2771
02:29:34,120 --> 02:29:35,960
rather than from consciousness itself.

2772
02:29:35,960 --> 02:29:37,800
When you place your faith in money,

2773
02:29:37,940 --> 02:29:39,180
you make money your God,

2774
02:29:39,280 --> 02:29:42,040
and any God outside of consciousness will fail you.

2775
02:29:42,420 --> 02:29:44,900
Money can be lost, stolen, devalued.

2776
02:29:45,480 --> 02:29:46,240
But consciousness?

2777
02:29:46,780 --> 02:29:48,800
Consciousness is eternal, indestructible,

2778
02:29:48,920 --> 02:29:50,260
always available to you.

2779
02:29:50,540 --> 02:29:51,520
Now you may ask,

2780
02:29:51,620 --> 02:29:53,500
does this mean we should not work for money?

2781
02:29:53,920 --> 02:29:56,700
Does this mean we should not be practical about our finances?

2782
02:29:56,940 --> 02:29:58,000
Not at all, my friend.

2783
02:29:58,460 --> 02:29:59,760
Work by all means.

2784
02:30:00,160 --> 02:30:01,800
Be practical, be wise.

2785
02:30:01,800 --> 02:30:04,620
But work from the consciousness of wealth,

2786
02:30:04,800 --> 02:30:06,420
not from the consciousness of need.

2787
02:30:07,400 --> 02:30:09,640
Be practical from the assumption of abundance,

2788
02:30:09,940 --> 02:30:11,140
not from the fear of lack.

2789
02:30:11,300 --> 02:30:13,100
The world is yourself pushed out.

2790
02:30:14,020 --> 02:30:15,560
If you see lack in your world,

2791
02:30:15,660 --> 02:30:18,180
you are seeing your consciousness of lack made visible.

2792
02:30:18,580 --> 02:30:20,460
If you see limitation in your world,

2793
02:30:20,540 --> 02:30:23,660
you are seeing your consciousness of limitation externalized.

2794
02:30:24,360 --> 02:30:25,800
But change your consciousness,

2795
02:30:26,040 --> 02:30:27,440
and your world must change.

2796
02:30:27,440 --> 02:30:30,180
I have told you before, but I will tell you again.

2797
02:30:31,120 --> 02:30:32,320
Assumption, though false,

2798
02:30:32,800 --> 02:30:35,120
if persisted in, will harden into fact.

2799
02:30:35,440 --> 02:30:37,700
If you assume you are wealthy in consciousness,

2800
02:30:37,880 --> 02:30:39,800
that assumption persisted in

2801
02:30:39,800 --> 02:30:42,600
will externalize itself as wealth in your world.

2802
02:30:42,800 --> 02:30:44,700
Now I must insist on this, my friend.

2803
02:30:45,480 --> 02:30:46,640
Consciousness is cause,

2804
02:30:47,100 --> 02:30:49,240
and what you see in your world is effect.

2805
02:30:49,920 --> 02:30:50,980
This is not sentiment.

2806
02:30:51,220 --> 02:30:52,500
This is not positive thinking.

2807
02:30:52,980 --> 02:30:54,660
This is the fundamental principle

2808
02:30:54,660 --> 02:30:56,520
by which all things come into being.

2809
02:30:56,520 --> 02:30:59,160
Do not let anyone, including yourself,

2810
02:30:59,320 --> 02:31:00,300
talk you out of it.

2811
02:31:01,180 --> 02:31:03,220
Before I tell you how to apply this tonight,

2812
02:31:03,340 --> 02:31:06,000
there is one final detail about the technique itself.

2813
02:31:06,500 --> 02:31:09,120
Most who practice it make one crucial mistake

2814
02:31:09,120 --> 02:31:11,060
in the moment between assuming the state

2815
02:31:11,060 --> 02:31:12,020
and falling asleep.

2816
02:31:12,720 --> 02:31:15,260
This mistake causes the assumption to dissolve

2817
02:31:15,260 --> 02:31:16,540
instead of taking root.

2818
02:31:16,940 --> 02:31:18,420
I must show you this now,

2819
02:31:18,880 --> 02:31:21,560
for it separates those who see results in days

2820
02:31:21,560 --> 02:31:24,080
from those who practice for years without success.

2821
02:31:24,080 --> 02:31:28,180
Now, let me tell you how to apply this principle tonight.

2822
02:31:28,540 --> 02:31:29,800
When you retire this evening,

2823
02:31:29,940 --> 02:31:31,840
you will enter into that drowsy state

2824
02:31:31,840 --> 02:31:33,300
between waking and sleeping,

2825
02:31:33,700 --> 02:31:35,180
that state akin to sleep

2826
02:31:35,180 --> 02:31:36,780
which I have spoken of so often.

2827
02:31:37,580 --> 02:31:40,600
First, you will assume the feeling of being financially free,

2828
02:31:40,760 --> 02:31:42,200
not the feeling of getting money,

2829
02:31:42,320 --> 02:31:44,520
but the feeling of having financial freedom.

2830
02:31:45,520 --> 02:31:46,500
Feel as you would feel

2831
02:31:46,500 --> 02:31:48,960
if you had no financial concerns whatsoever.

2832
02:31:49,460 --> 02:31:52,000
Second, you will let your mind rest in that assumption.

2833
02:31:52,520 --> 02:31:54,200
Do not strain to hold the thought.

2834
02:31:54,360 --> 02:31:55,860
Do not repeat affirmations.

2835
02:31:56,360 --> 02:31:59,640
Simply rest in the naturalness of being financially secure.

2836
02:32:00,020 --> 02:32:01,800
Third, you will not concern yourself

2837
02:32:01,800 --> 02:32:03,400
with how this will come to pass.

2838
02:32:03,880 --> 02:32:05,720
Do not plan the ways or means.

2839
02:32:06,140 --> 02:32:07,620
Your business is to assume.

2840
02:32:08,280 --> 02:32:09,980
The how is not your concern.

2841
02:32:10,780 --> 02:32:13,440
And fourth, you will fall asleep in that assumption.

2842
02:32:13,440 --> 02:32:15,860
Let sleep come while you are resting

2843
02:32:15,860 --> 02:32:17,640
in the feeling of financial freedom.

2844
02:32:17,880 --> 02:32:19,940
Here is the crucial detail I promised you.

2845
02:32:20,240 --> 02:32:22,080
The moment you feel sleep approaching,

2846
02:32:22,600 --> 02:32:24,480
do not try to hold on to the assumption

2847
02:32:24,480 --> 02:32:25,620
with your conscious mind.

2848
02:32:26,080 --> 02:32:26,680
Let it go.

2849
02:32:27,120 --> 02:32:28,900
Release it completely into sleep.

2850
02:32:29,740 --> 02:32:31,460
Most people panic at this moment

2851
02:32:31,460 --> 02:32:33,360
and try to grip the assumption tighter.

2852
02:32:33,840 --> 02:32:34,800
This destroys it.

2853
02:32:35,180 --> 02:32:36,680
The assumption must be released

2854
02:32:36,680 --> 02:32:38,480
into the subconscious through sleep,

2855
02:32:38,900 --> 02:32:40,800
not held by the conscious mind.

2856
02:32:41,000 --> 02:32:42,280
If you do this faithfully,

2857
02:32:42,280 --> 02:32:43,260
night after night,

2858
02:32:43,360 --> 02:32:45,800
you will find that your consciousness begins to shift.

2859
02:32:46,440 --> 02:32:47,840
And as your consciousness shifts,

2860
02:32:47,960 --> 02:32:49,700
your world must shift to match it.

2861
02:32:50,060 --> 02:32:52,420
You will find yourself taking different actions.

2862
02:32:52,880 --> 02:32:55,460
Opportunities will appear that were not visible before.

2863
02:32:56,280 --> 02:32:58,100
People will respond to you differently.

2864
02:32:58,300 --> 02:33:00,800
Money will come to you through ways you never expected.

2865
02:33:01,180 --> 02:33:02,440
But remember my friend,

2866
02:33:02,640 --> 02:33:03,800
feeling is the secret.

2867
02:33:04,560 --> 02:33:05,880
Not the feeling of wanting.

2868
02:33:06,400 --> 02:33:07,560
Not the feeling of hoping.

2869
02:33:08,100 --> 02:33:10,300
The feeling of the wish fulfilled itself.

2870
02:33:10,300 --> 02:33:13,380
This is what Abdullah meant when he said,

2871
02:33:13,500 --> 02:33:15,140
I must feel wealthy to have money.

2872
02:33:15,680 --> 02:33:18,340
He meant I must live in the consciousness of wealth,

2873
02:33:18,520 --> 02:33:20,200
not in the consciousness of poverty,

2874
02:33:20,360 --> 02:33:21,220
hoping for wealth.

2875
02:33:21,580 --> 02:33:24,200
For six months I lived in the consciousness of poverty,

2876
02:33:24,700 --> 02:33:27,540
hoping and trying and visualizing my way to wealth.

2877
02:33:27,940 --> 02:33:31,400
The moment I shifted to living in the consciousness of wealth itself,

2878
02:33:31,600 --> 02:33:32,560
everything changed.

2879
02:33:32,860 --> 02:33:35,220
Do not make the mistake I made, my friend.

2880
02:33:35,220 --> 02:33:39,460
Do not spend months or years practicing from the wrong state of consciousness.

2881
02:33:40,160 --> 02:33:43,240
The moment you truly understand what I am telling you tonight,

2882
02:33:43,400 --> 02:33:44,980
you can begin living in the end.

2883
02:33:45,440 --> 02:33:48,120
You can begin assuming you are what you wish to be.

2884
02:33:48,400 --> 02:33:49,840
And now I tell you my friend,

2885
02:33:49,940 --> 02:33:53,340
what Abdullah was really teaching me in those few simple words.

2886
02:33:53,800 --> 02:33:56,120
He was not giving me a technique for getting money.

2887
02:33:56,540 --> 02:33:59,760
He was revealing the fundamental law of consciousness itself.

2888
02:33:59,760 --> 02:34:02,580
You do not feel wealthy to attract wealth.

2889
02:34:02,960 --> 02:34:06,120
You feel wealthy because you are wealthy in consciousness.

2890
02:34:07,040 --> 02:34:09,220
The moment you truly assume that state,

2891
02:34:09,660 --> 02:34:11,900
not hope for it, not work toward it,

2892
02:34:12,000 --> 02:34:13,960
but assume it as your present reality,

2893
02:34:14,440 --> 02:34:16,000
in that moment you have wealth,

2894
02:34:16,260 --> 02:34:18,760
everything else is simply the world catching up

2895
02:34:18,760 --> 02:34:20,860
to what you have already become in consciousness.

2896
02:34:21,700 --> 02:34:24,160
Tonight when you retire, do this just once.

2897
02:34:24,760 --> 02:34:27,480
Enter that drowsy state between waking and sleeping.

2898
02:34:27,480 --> 02:34:29,320
Assume you are financially free.

2899
02:34:29,740 --> 02:34:31,540
Not that you will be, but that you are.

2900
02:34:32,040 --> 02:34:33,440
Feel the naturalness of it.

2901
02:34:33,840 --> 02:34:36,320
Rest in that assumption, and let sleep come.

2902
02:34:37,280 --> 02:34:39,580
Tomorrow you may awaken to find that consciousness

2903
02:34:39,580 --> 02:34:41,160
has done its perfect work.

2904
02:34:41,700 --> 02:34:43,520
Or you may find that the assumption

2905
02:34:43,520 --> 02:34:45,840
must be persisted in for several nights.

2906
02:34:46,740 --> 02:34:48,760
Both are well, my friend, both are well.

2907
02:34:48,960 --> 02:34:50,120
The law is exact.

2908
02:34:50,620 --> 02:34:52,000
What you assume to be true

2909
02:34:52,000 --> 02:34:53,660
becomes true in your experience.

2910
02:34:53,900 --> 02:34:55,660
The world is yourself pushed out,

2911
02:34:55,660 --> 02:34:57,800
and imagining creates reality.

2912
02:34:58,240 --> 02:35:01,200
May you sleep tonight in the Sabbath rest of your assumption.

2913
02:35:01,840 --> 02:35:04,880
May you awaken knowing that what you have assumed in consciousness

2914
02:35:04,880 --> 02:35:07,460
must externalize itself in your world.

2915
02:35:07,860 --> 02:35:11,140
May you walk tomorrow in the certainty of the wish fulfilled.

2916
02:35:11,940 --> 02:35:13,720
Until we meet again, my friend.

2917
02:35:16,040 --> 02:35:17,640
Every morning for twenty minutes,

2918
02:35:17,780 --> 02:35:21,700
I would sit in my chair in that small apartment on West 72nd Street.

2919
02:35:21,700 --> 02:35:24,240
Every morning, not nineteen minutes,

2920
02:35:24,360 --> 02:35:25,460
not twenty-five minutes,

2921
02:35:25,580 --> 02:35:26,980
but exactly twenty minutes.

2922
02:35:27,060 --> 02:35:28,480
And I tell you, within three weeks,

2923
02:35:28,580 --> 02:35:30,220
everything in my world had changed.

2924
02:35:30,380 --> 02:35:30,760
Everything.

2925
02:35:31,240 --> 02:35:33,940
Now you may think you know what I did in those twenty minutes.

2926
02:35:34,040 --> 02:35:35,920
You may think it was prayer, or meditation,

2927
02:35:36,240 --> 02:35:37,460
or some form of concentration.

2928
02:35:38,000 --> 02:35:38,840
You would be wrong.

2929
02:35:39,220 --> 02:35:42,320
What I did was so simple that most who hear me dismiss it.

2930
02:35:42,560 --> 02:35:45,340
So practical that they search for something more mystical.

2931
02:35:45,340 --> 02:35:49,560
So precise that they add their own complications and destroy its power.

2932
02:35:50,080 --> 02:35:52,360
The technique I will give you tonight is not new.

2933
02:35:52,780 --> 02:35:54,380
I have spoken of revision before.

2934
02:35:55,040 --> 02:35:57,520
But the morning application, this exact method,

2935
02:35:57,680 --> 02:36:01,460
practiced for exactly twenty minutes at exactly the same time each morning,

2936
02:36:01,900 --> 02:36:04,500
this transforms revision from a pleasant exercise

2937
02:36:04,500 --> 02:36:07,640
into a force that will reconstruct your entire world.

2938
02:36:07,960 --> 02:36:09,420
But before I give you the method,

2939
02:36:09,560 --> 02:36:12,020
you must understand why twenty minutes in the morning

2940
02:36:12,020 --> 02:36:14,820
accomplishes what hours of evening revision cannot.

2941
02:36:15,540 --> 02:36:18,940
The difference, my friend, lies in the nature of assumption itself.

2942
02:36:19,460 --> 02:36:21,620
When you retire at night and practice revision,

2943
02:36:21,760 --> 02:36:23,480
you are working with a tired mind,

2944
02:36:23,880 --> 02:36:25,780
a mind that has been active all day,

2945
02:36:25,900 --> 02:36:28,380
a mind filled with the impressions of the day's events.

2946
02:36:28,760 --> 02:36:30,100
But in the morning, my friend,

2947
02:36:30,200 --> 02:36:32,020
in those first moments of consciousness,

2948
02:36:32,540 --> 02:36:34,500
the mind is fresh, it is receptive.

2949
02:36:34,980 --> 02:36:36,440
It is in that creative state,

2950
02:36:36,560 --> 02:36:38,220
most akin to the power itself.

2951
02:36:38,220 --> 02:36:41,400
I discovered this quite by accident in 1954.

2952
02:36:42,120 --> 02:36:43,980
I had been teaching revision for years,

2953
02:36:43,980 --> 02:36:47,540
teaching my audiences in New York to revise their day before sleep,

2954
02:36:47,980 --> 02:36:51,040
to rewrite the unwanted events into what they should have been.

2955
02:36:51,400 --> 02:36:52,680
And yes, it worked.

2956
02:36:53,100 --> 02:36:57,820
But slowly, sometimes taking months for the revision to manifest in their world.

2957
02:36:58,040 --> 02:37:02,220
Then came a period in my life when circumstances demanded immediate change.

2958
02:37:02,220 --> 02:37:04,840
I will not burden you with the details,

2959
02:37:05,020 --> 02:37:08,720
but I tell you I could not wait months for my assumption to harden into fact.

2960
02:37:09,220 --> 02:37:12,260
I needed results, and so I began to experiment.

2961
02:37:12,620 --> 02:37:14,580
Instead of revising only at night,

2962
02:37:14,700 --> 02:37:17,820
I began each morning with twenty minutes of deliberate revision,

2963
02:37:18,360 --> 02:37:22,060
twenty minutes of taking the previous day and reshaping it in imagination,

2964
02:37:22,520 --> 02:37:25,600
twenty minutes of living mentally in the corrected version

2965
02:37:25,600 --> 02:37:28,320
until it felt more real than what had actually occurred.

2966
02:37:28,320 --> 02:37:30,500
The results, my friend, were immediate,

2967
02:37:30,700 --> 02:37:34,000
where months of evening revision had produced gradual change,

2968
02:37:34,420 --> 02:37:37,940
three weeks of morning revision revolutionized my entire world.

2969
02:37:38,260 --> 02:37:39,400
And I understood why.

2970
02:37:39,840 --> 02:37:44,600
In the morning, consciousness emerges from sleep still malleable, still creative.

2971
02:37:45,240 --> 02:37:49,920
The logical mind has not yet erected its barriers of what is possible and what is not.

2972
02:37:50,360 --> 02:37:53,760
In this creative state, assumption encounters no resistance.

2973
02:37:53,760 --> 02:37:57,700
It sinks into the subconscious like seed into fertile soil.

2974
02:37:57,960 --> 02:38:00,440
But most who hear me make three critical errors.

2975
02:38:00,900 --> 02:38:02,260
They practice sporadically.

2976
02:38:02,740 --> 02:38:04,900
They practice with effort instead of ease.

2977
02:38:05,120 --> 02:38:08,320
And they abandon the work before it has time to bear fruit.

2978
02:38:08,720 --> 02:38:11,400
But before I tell you the technique itself, my friend,

2979
02:38:11,740 --> 02:38:14,660
there is a specific signal you must learn to recognize,

2980
02:38:15,040 --> 02:38:18,840
a signal that tells you whether your assumption has taken root in consciousness

2981
02:38:18,840 --> 02:38:21,200
or remains merely wishful thinking.

2982
02:38:21,200 --> 02:38:26,120
Without recognizing this signal, you will not know if you are working with the law or against it.

2983
02:38:26,440 --> 02:38:28,440
I will give you that signal in just a moment,

2984
02:38:28,560 --> 02:38:32,820
for it determines whether your morning work transforms your world or leaves it unchanged.

2985
02:38:33,100 --> 02:38:33,940
Listen carefully.

2986
02:38:34,360 --> 02:38:38,180
I will tell you of a woman who came to me through correspondence in 1957.

2987
02:38:38,900 --> 02:38:42,960
She had been divorced for three years and desired remarriage to a specific man.

2988
02:38:43,400 --> 02:38:46,380
A man who she wrote showed no interest in her whatsoever.

2989
02:38:46,380 --> 02:38:50,220
She had been practicing what she called revision for eight months.

2990
02:38:50,660 --> 02:38:53,700
Eight months, my friend, with no change in her circumstances.

2991
02:38:54,200 --> 02:38:58,580
When I examined her method, I discovered she revised twice a week when she remembered.

2992
02:38:59,140 --> 02:39:03,240
Sometimes for five minutes, sometimes for an hour, sometimes in the evening,

2993
02:39:03,440 --> 02:39:06,000
sometimes upon waking, sometimes in the afternoon.

2994
02:39:06,360 --> 02:39:07,080
No system.

2995
02:39:07,480 --> 02:39:08,120
No discipline.

2996
02:39:08,280 --> 02:39:08,880
No precision.

2997
02:39:08,880 --> 02:39:13,900
At first, she resisted when I told her she must revise for exactly 20 minutes each morning

2998
02:39:13,900 --> 02:39:15,400
at exactly the same time.

2999
02:39:15,780 --> 02:39:17,820
She said her schedule would not permit it.

3000
02:39:17,900 --> 02:39:20,180
She said 20 minutes was too long to concentrate.

3001
02:39:20,660 --> 02:39:22,720
She said she preferred her flexible approach.

3002
02:39:23,160 --> 02:39:26,680
I told her plainly, the law responds to precision, not preference.

3003
02:39:27,360 --> 02:39:32,660
I told her to choose 20 minutes between 6 and 8 each morning and guard those minutes as sacred.

3004
02:39:32,660 --> 02:39:37,860
I told her to sit in the same chair, enter that drowsy state and revise not just one event

3005
02:39:37,860 --> 02:39:40,680
but the entire previous day into what it should have been.

3006
02:39:41,700 --> 02:39:43,660
She wrote back that this seemed excessive.

3007
02:39:43,880 --> 02:39:45,580
One event she felt was sufficient.

3008
02:39:46,080 --> 02:39:50,260
Why revise an entire day when only one interaction with this man mattered?

3009
02:39:50,780 --> 02:39:54,120
You have heard me speak of revision and many have misunderstood me.

3010
02:39:54,200 --> 02:39:54,940
Let me be plain.

3011
02:39:55,360 --> 02:39:57,500
We do not revise individual events.

3012
02:39:57,640 --> 02:40:00,440
We revise the consciousness that created those events.

3013
02:40:00,440 --> 02:40:05,000
When you revise systematically, when you reshape day after day in imagination,

3014
02:40:05,380 --> 02:40:08,880
you are not changing circumstances, you are changing yourself

3015
02:40:08,880 --> 02:40:12,740
and when you change your world must change to reflect your new state of being.

3016
02:40:12,960 --> 02:40:16,520
I convinced her to attempt the full practice for exactly three weeks.

3017
02:40:17,000 --> 02:40:22,460
Every morning at 7 she would sit in her bedroom chair and spend 20 minutes revising the previous day,

3018
02:40:22,880 --> 02:40:25,840
not just her encounters with this man but every conversation,

3019
02:40:26,060 --> 02:40:28,820
every interaction, every moment into its ideal form.

3020
02:40:28,820 --> 02:40:32,900
The first week she reported felt mechanical, even foolish.

3021
02:40:33,260 --> 02:40:34,720
The second week brought doubt.

3022
02:40:35,400 --> 02:40:39,580
No change in her outer circumstances, no sign that her work was bearing fruit.

3023
02:40:40,300 --> 02:40:41,920
I told her what I tell you now.

3024
02:40:42,180 --> 02:40:45,840
The seed that is planted in the ground shows no sign of growth for days.

3025
02:40:46,500 --> 02:40:49,460
Yet beneath the surface invisible processes are at work.

3026
02:40:49,760 --> 02:40:51,520
In the third week everything shifted.

3027
02:40:51,680 --> 02:40:54,260
The man began calling, began suggesting meetings.

3028
02:40:54,260 --> 02:40:58,920
By the end of that week he had proposed, not gradually, not after months of courtship,

3029
02:40:58,980 --> 02:41:02,460
but suddenly, as though a switch had been turned in his consciousness,

3030
02:41:03,000 --> 02:41:08,440
as though her revised version of their relationship had become more real to him than their actual history.

3031
02:41:08,680 --> 02:41:10,640
And here was the signal I promised you.

3032
02:41:10,700 --> 02:41:15,260
In that third week she wrote to me something remarkable had happened to her morning practice.

3033
02:41:15,800 --> 02:41:18,720
The revised events no longer felt like imagination.

3034
02:41:18,720 --> 02:41:22,540
They felt like memory, more real than what had actually occurred.

3035
02:41:22,960 --> 02:41:24,340
This is the signal, my friend.

3036
02:41:24,800 --> 02:41:27,740
When your revision feels more natural than the original event,

3037
02:41:27,840 --> 02:41:30,200
when the corrected version becomes your true memory,

3038
02:41:30,540 --> 02:41:33,200
then you know the assumption has taken root in consciousness.

3039
02:41:33,780 --> 02:41:36,520
This is the power of systematic morning revision.

3040
02:41:36,960 --> 02:41:39,480
You are not merely correcting yesterday's events.

3041
02:41:39,860 --> 02:41:43,600
You are impressing upon the creative power of consciousness a new pattern,

3042
02:41:43,940 --> 02:41:47,720
a new assumption about who you are and how your world responds to you.

3043
02:41:47,720 --> 02:41:49,880
Now hold this thought, my friend.

3044
02:41:50,280 --> 02:41:52,220
I will give you the application in a moment,

3045
02:41:52,380 --> 02:41:56,300
but first you must understand why twenty minutes, no more, no less.

3046
02:41:56,980 --> 02:42:01,340
The conscious mind can maintain creative attention for approximately twenty minutes

3047
02:42:01,340 --> 02:42:06,000
before it begins to waver, less than twenty minutes and the impression is too shallow to take root.

3048
02:42:06,640 --> 02:42:10,460
More than twenty minutes and you begin to work with effort instead of ease.

3049
02:42:10,580 --> 02:42:14,060
The moment effort enters you have moved from assumption into wishing,

3050
02:42:14,060 --> 02:42:17,740
and wishes as I have told you before are confessions of lack.

3051
02:42:17,980 --> 02:42:23,100
Twenty minutes allows you to enter that drowsy state, maintain it and work within it without strain.

3052
02:42:23,580 --> 02:42:27,760
Twenty minutes allows you to revise thoroughly without exhausting the creative faculty.

3053
02:42:28,300 --> 02:42:33,620
Twenty minutes practice consistently will revolutionize your world faster than hours of sporadic effort.

3054
02:42:33,960 --> 02:42:36,020
Now I must insist on this, my friend.

3055
02:42:36,400 --> 02:42:37,480
This is not concentration.

3056
02:42:37,880 --> 02:42:40,240
This is not visualization in the ordinary sense.

3057
02:42:40,240 --> 02:42:41,380
This is assumption.

3058
02:42:41,580 --> 02:42:44,920
This is living mentally in the corrected version until it feels natural.

3059
02:42:45,460 --> 02:42:49,000
Do not let anyone, including yourself, talk you out of this distinction.

3060
02:42:49,740 --> 02:42:52,420
Now I must tell you something most teachers will not.

3061
02:42:52,620 --> 02:42:57,760
There is a specific moment within those twenty minutes when the assumption either hardens into fact

3062
02:42:57,760 --> 02:43:00,040
or evaporates into wishful thinking.

3063
02:43:00,600 --> 02:43:04,320
Miss this moment and your revision remains merely pleasant daydreaming.

3064
02:43:04,760 --> 02:43:08,920
Catch this moment and you command the creative power of consciousness itself.

3065
02:43:08,920 --> 02:43:14,740
I will tell you that moment next, and it changes everything about how you approach the morning work.

3066
02:43:14,980 --> 02:43:19,680
Remember what I told you a few moments ago about changing consciousness not circumstances?

3067
02:43:20,180 --> 02:43:21,580
Now this is where you see why.

3068
02:43:22,320 --> 02:43:26,580
I recall a gentleman who attended my lectures in Los Angeles in 1962.

3069
02:43:27,420 --> 02:43:31,860
A businessman who had been struggling with a particular client relationship for over a year.

3070
02:43:31,860 --> 02:43:36,640
This client, he told me, was hostile, demanding, impossible to satisfy.

3071
02:43:37,100 --> 02:43:41,920
Every interaction left him frustrated and his business relationship deteriorated further.

3072
02:43:42,240 --> 02:43:47,840
He began the morning revision practice, spending twenty minutes each day revising his encounters with this client.

3073
02:43:48,560 --> 02:43:50,860
Instead of hostility, he imagined courtesy.

3074
02:43:51,480 --> 02:43:53,640
Instead of demands, he imagined appreciation.

3075
02:43:54,340 --> 02:43:58,560
Instead of conflict, he imagined mutual respect and profitable collaboration.

3076
02:43:58,560 --> 02:44:01,400
At first he found this difficult.

3077
02:44:02,080 --> 02:44:06,780
The actual relationship was so contentious that imagining its opposite felt false.

3078
02:44:07,260 --> 02:44:14,620
He would sit in his chair and attempt the revision, but his mind would immediately return to the reality of how difficult this client truly was.

3079
02:44:15,380 --> 02:44:18,240
This is the critical point where most abandon the work.

3080
02:44:18,680 --> 02:44:24,940
They attempt revision but cannot maintain the feeling of the revised version because the outer facts seem too contrary.

3081
02:44:24,940 --> 02:44:27,960
They forget that we are not trying to change facts.

3082
02:44:28,100 --> 02:44:31,720
We are changing the consciousness that perceives and creates those facts.

3083
02:44:32,000 --> 02:44:33,120
I told him to persist.

3084
02:44:33,680 --> 02:44:36,900
I told him that the feeling of naturalness would come with practice.

3085
02:44:37,660 --> 02:44:41,420
Just as a new suit feels strange until you have worn it several times,

3086
02:44:41,560 --> 02:44:47,940
the revised version of any relationship will feel unnatural until you have lived in it repeatedly in imagination.

3087
02:44:47,940 --> 02:44:52,520
By the second week of practice, he reported that the revision was becoming easier.

3088
02:44:52,720 --> 02:44:57,160
He could maintain the feeling of pleasant collaboration with this client for the full 20 minutes.

3089
02:44:57,720 --> 02:45:00,720
By the third week, he said something remarkable had occurred.

3090
02:45:01,400 --> 02:45:05,660
He had begun to forget which interactions had actually happened and which he had revised.

3091
02:45:05,840 --> 02:45:09,160
The revised version felt more real to him than the original events.

3092
02:45:09,160 --> 02:45:13,160
And then in the fourth week, the client's behavior began to mirror the revision.

3093
02:45:13,360 --> 02:45:14,820
Phone calls became cordial.

3094
02:45:15,320 --> 02:45:16,820
Demands became requests.

3095
02:45:17,220 --> 02:45:20,700
Hostility gave way to genuine appreciation for his services.

3096
02:45:21,320 --> 02:45:25,680
Within a month, this client had become one of his most valued business relationships.

3097
02:45:26,060 --> 02:45:27,600
The client had not changed.

3098
02:45:28,000 --> 02:45:30,960
The businessman had changed his assumption about the client.

3099
02:45:31,300 --> 02:45:33,920
And the outer world conformed to his inner conviction.

3100
02:45:34,340 --> 02:45:36,200
And here is the moment I promised you.

3101
02:45:36,200 --> 02:45:39,720
It came for him as it comes for all who practice correctly.

3102
02:45:39,860 --> 02:45:43,960
At the end of each 20-minute session, just before rising from his chair,

3103
02:45:44,060 --> 02:45:45,740
he would feel a sense of satisfaction.

3104
02:45:46,200 --> 02:45:50,360
Not hope for the future, but satisfaction with what had already been accomplished.

3105
02:45:50,920 --> 02:45:56,020
This is the moment, my friend, when revision moves from imagination to satisfaction,

3106
02:45:56,240 --> 02:46:01,060
when you feel the naturalness of the wish fulfilled rather than the effort of trying to manifest it,

3107
02:46:01,360 --> 02:46:04,580
then you know the assumption has impressed itself upon consciousness.

3108
02:46:04,580 --> 02:46:09,020
This is what I mean when I tell you that the world is yourself pushed out.

3109
02:46:09,480 --> 02:46:14,520
Change your conception of any person, any situation, any circumstance through systematic revision,

3110
02:46:14,940 --> 02:46:19,340
and that person, situation or circumstance must change to match your new assumption.

3111
02:46:19,920 --> 02:46:24,080
But before I tell you how to apply this tonight, I must address one thing more.

3112
02:46:24,580 --> 02:46:25,920
The question of persistence.

3113
02:46:25,920 --> 02:46:31,860
Most who begin this practice, abandon it within days, because they do not see immediate results.

3114
02:46:32,520 --> 02:46:37,800
They practice for three days, see no change in their circumstances, and conclude the method does not work.

3115
02:46:38,280 --> 02:46:39,760
Make no mistake about this.

3116
02:46:39,860 --> 02:46:41,320
The law always works.

3117
02:46:41,520 --> 02:46:41,860
Always.

3118
02:46:42,360 --> 02:46:46,240
But it works according to its own timing, not according to your impatience.

3119
02:46:46,240 --> 02:46:50,500
The world will tell you that three weeks is too long to wait for results.

3120
02:46:51,100 --> 02:46:54,160
They will tell you that real manifestation should happen instantly.

3121
02:46:54,700 --> 02:46:55,820
I tell you they are wrong.

3122
02:46:56,240 --> 02:47:00,980
I have observed that sustained assumptions take exactly three weeks to harden into fact.

3123
02:47:01,400 --> 02:47:05,280
Three weeks of consistent daily impression upon the subconscious mind.

3124
02:47:05,740 --> 02:47:08,880
Three weeks of feeling the naturalness of the revised condition.

3125
02:47:09,320 --> 02:47:11,800
Three weeks of living mentally in the end result.

3126
02:47:12,100 --> 02:47:13,400
This is why most fail.

3127
02:47:13,400 --> 02:47:17,360
They give the law three days and expect three weeks worth of results.

3128
02:47:17,840 --> 02:47:20,920
They practice casually and expect consistent results.

3129
02:47:21,700 --> 02:47:25,400
They revise occasionally and wonder why their world remains unchanged.

3130
02:47:25,740 --> 02:47:30,220
The creative power of consciousness responds to persistence, not sporadic effort.

3131
02:47:30,780 --> 02:47:32,600
It responds to feeling, not thinking.

3132
02:47:33,100 --> 02:47:34,940
It responds to assumption, not hope.

3133
02:47:35,240 --> 02:47:39,760
Those who practice morning revision for exactly three weeks, without missing a single day,

3134
02:47:39,760 --> 02:47:42,720
without shortening the time, without altering the method,

3135
02:47:42,720 --> 02:47:47,680
those people witness what can only be called miraculous changes in their circumstances.

3136
02:47:48,260 --> 02:47:52,720
Before I tell you how to apply this tonight, there is one final piece that separates those

3137
02:47:52,720 --> 02:47:57,200
who see their world respond in three weeks from those who practice for months with no result.

3138
02:47:57,700 --> 02:48:01,140
It concerns what your consciousness is doing the very moment you wake,

3139
02:48:01,580 --> 02:48:03,260
before you even open your eyes.

3140
02:48:03,820 --> 02:48:07,680
Miss this piece and your morning revision fights against your natural state.

3141
02:48:07,680 --> 02:48:13,480
Master it and your revision works with the creative power from the first moment of practice.

3142
02:48:13,980 --> 02:48:15,360
I must address this now.

3143
02:48:15,640 --> 02:48:17,880
Remember that precision I spoke of earlier.

3144
02:48:18,460 --> 02:48:20,040
Here is where it matters most.

3145
02:48:20,440 --> 02:48:23,200
The moment you wake, before your feet touch the floor,

3146
02:48:23,320 --> 02:48:25,500
before you engage with any demand of the day,

3147
02:48:25,600 --> 02:48:28,080
your consciousness is in its most creative state.

3148
02:48:28,420 --> 02:48:30,300
This is when you must begin your work,

3149
02:48:30,420 --> 02:48:33,040
not after coffee, not after reading the morning news,

3150
02:48:33,040 --> 02:48:36,120
but in those first moments when consciousness is fresh from sleep.

3151
02:48:36,700 --> 02:48:39,340
Now, tonight when you retire, do nothing different.

3152
02:48:39,560 --> 02:48:40,340
Sleep naturally.

3153
02:48:40,760 --> 02:48:43,460
But tomorrow morning, before you engage with the world,

3154
02:48:43,720 --> 02:48:46,240
before you read the news or attend to correspondence,

3155
02:48:46,480 --> 02:48:47,700
you will begin this practice.

3156
02:48:48,380 --> 02:48:49,880
First, you will choose your time.

3157
02:48:50,360 --> 02:48:52,640
Between six and eight in the morning is ideal,

3158
02:48:52,760 --> 02:48:55,480
but choose the twenty minutes that you can guard consistently.

3159
02:48:55,960 --> 02:48:59,000
Second, you will sit comfortably in the same chair each morning.

3160
02:48:59,540 --> 02:49:02,080
This creates a physical anchor for the mental work.

3161
02:49:02,600 --> 02:49:05,500
Third, you will allow yourself to enter that drowsy state,

3162
02:49:05,640 --> 02:49:08,940
that state akin to sleep where the conscious mind relaxes its guard.

3163
02:49:09,320 --> 02:49:12,260
Fourth, in that creative state you will begin to revise.

3164
02:49:12,820 --> 02:49:13,840
Start with yesterday.

3165
02:49:14,020 --> 02:49:17,180
Take the first interaction or event that did not satisfy you

3166
02:49:17,180 --> 02:49:18,680
and revise it in imagination.

3167
02:49:19,280 --> 02:49:21,760
See it unfolding as you would have liked it to unfold.

3168
02:49:22,180 --> 02:49:23,940
Hear the words that should have been spoken.

3169
02:49:24,420 --> 02:49:26,640
Feel the satisfaction of the corrected version.

3170
02:49:26,640 --> 02:49:30,480
Then move to the next event requiring revision, then the next.

3171
02:49:30,720 --> 02:49:32,660
Do not strain to visualize clearly.

3172
02:49:32,820 --> 02:49:33,960
Do not work with effort.

3173
02:49:34,400 --> 02:49:38,560
Simply assume the feeling of the wish fulfilled regarding each revised event.

3174
02:49:39,020 --> 02:49:42,560
Live in the corrected version until it feels natural, then move on.

3175
02:49:42,840 --> 02:49:45,380
Continue this process for exactly twenty minutes.

3176
02:49:45,920 --> 02:49:49,060
When the time concludes, rise from your chair and begin your day.

3177
02:49:49,580 --> 02:49:51,420
Do not analyze what you have done.

3178
02:49:51,520 --> 02:49:52,940
Do not wonder if it worked.

3179
02:49:53,080 --> 02:49:54,820
Do not look for immediate signs.

3180
02:49:54,820 --> 02:49:58,000
Simply trust the law and continue the practice.

3181
02:49:58,440 --> 02:50:01,500
You will find that within days the revision becomes easier.

3182
02:50:01,960 --> 02:50:06,400
Within weeks the revised versions begin to feel more real than the original events.

3183
02:50:06,820 --> 02:50:10,960
Within three weeks your world will begin to reflect the pattern you have been impressing

3184
02:50:10,960 --> 02:50:13,300
upon consciousness through your daily practice.

3185
02:50:13,680 --> 02:50:16,500
Some of you will be tempted to revise for longer periods,

3186
02:50:16,920 --> 02:50:19,360
thinking more time will produce faster results.

3187
02:50:19,520 --> 02:50:20,260
This is an error.

3188
02:50:20,260 --> 02:50:24,180
Twenty minutes allows you to work in that creative state without effort.

3189
02:50:24,740 --> 02:50:29,380
Longer periods lead to mental fatigue and forced concentration which defeats the purpose.

3190
02:50:29,780 --> 02:50:34,780
Others will be tempted to skip days when circumstances seem pleasant when nothing requires revision.

3191
02:50:35,320 --> 02:50:36,320
This too is an error.

3192
02:50:36,760 --> 02:50:42,060
The purpose is not merely to correct unpleasant events but to establish a new pattern of consciousness.

3193
02:50:42,060 --> 02:50:45,740
Consistency in practice creates consistency in results.

3194
02:50:46,200 --> 02:50:51,060
Still others will begin this work and then abandon it when they do not see changes within the first week.

3195
02:50:51,460 --> 02:50:54,240
They forget that every seed requires time to sprout.

3196
02:50:54,420 --> 02:50:57,420
Every assumption requires time to harden into fact.

3197
02:50:58,100 --> 02:50:58,760
Three weeks.

3198
02:50:59,140 --> 02:51:03,760
Give the law three weeks of consistent application and you will never doubt its power again.

3199
02:51:03,760 --> 02:51:10,660
I have seen this method transform marriages, businesses, health, relationships and circumstances that seemed hopeless.

3200
02:51:11,260 --> 02:51:17,040
I have seen it work for those who could barely visualize and for those who considered themselves expert at mental work.

3201
02:51:17,040 --> 02:51:20,500
I have seen it succeed where years of other methods had failed.

3202
02:51:20,840 --> 02:51:24,100
But I have never seen it work for those who practice sporadically.

3203
02:51:24,260 --> 02:51:28,020
I have never seen it work for those who change the method to suit their preferences.

3204
02:51:28,540 --> 02:51:32,820
I have never seen it work for those who abandon it before the three weeks conclude.

3205
02:51:33,760 --> 02:51:35,100
The choice, my friend, is yours.

3206
02:51:35,740 --> 02:51:42,200
You can continue revising casually occasionally when you remember and continue receiving casual occasional results.

3207
02:51:42,600 --> 02:51:47,520
Or you can give this law the precision it deserves and witness the transformation of your entire world.

3208
02:51:48,020 --> 02:51:53,800
Twenty minutes each morning, the same time, the same chair, the same method, for three weeks without exception.

3209
02:51:54,220 --> 02:51:55,940
This is the price of a changed world.

3210
02:51:55,940 --> 02:52:00,300
This is the discipline that purchases freedom from unwanted circumstances.

3211
02:52:00,300 --> 02:52:04,120
And I tell you now what I have told audiences for decades.

3212
02:52:04,620 --> 02:52:10,380
The moment you make this commitment, the moment you decide to give the law three weeks of consistent application,

3213
02:52:10,860 --> 02:52:14,320
you will know within yourself that your circumstances must change.

3214
02:52:14,440 --> 02:52:15,760
Not because you hope they will.

3215
02:52:16,120 --> 02:52:18,260
Because you have assumed they already have.

3216
02:52:18,840 --> 02:52:23,500
And now I tell you, my friend, I tell you the secret you have just heard is not a secret at all.

3217
02:52:23,600 --> 02:52:26,880
It has been hiding in plain sight in every sentence I have spoken.

3218
02:52:26,880 --> 02:52:31,860
You are not practicing a technique, you are entering a state, the state of the wish fulfilled.

3219
02:52:32,380 --> 02:52:37,160
And from that creative state, consciousness creates without effort, without strain, without doubt.

3220
02:52:37,660 --> 02:52:42,560
The morning mind, fresh from sleep, slips into this state as naturally as water flows downhill.

3221
02:52:43,140 --> 02:52:47,540
This is why twenty minutes in the morning accomplishes what hours of evening work cannot.

3222
02:52:48,240 --> 02:52:51,760
You are working with the creative power at its most receptive moment.

3223
02:52:51,760 --> 02:52:58,560
Tomorrow morning try this once, just once, sit quietly for twenty minutes and revise yesterday into what it should have been.

3224
02:52:58,940 --> 02:53:02,180
Feel the satisfaction of the corrected version, that is all.

3225
02:53:02,880 --> 02:53:06,260
You may find that consciousness begins its perfect work immediately.

3226
02:53:06,820 --> 02:53:10,540
Or you may find that the assumption must be persisted in for days or weeks.

3227
02:53:10,880 --> 02:53:13,600
Both are well, my friend, both are the law in operation.

3228
02:53:14,100 --> 02:53:16,540
Remember always what I have told you tonight.

3229
02:53:16,720 --> 02:53:18,460
The world is yourself pushed out.

3230
02:53:18,460 --> 02:53:20,880
Consciousness is the only reality.

3231
02:53:21,440 --> 02:53:22,980
Imagining creates reality.

3232
02:53:23,340 --> 02:53:28,260
What you assume in the silence of your morning chair, the world must reflect back to you as fact.

3233
02:53:28,880 --> 02:53:31,680
Twenty minutes, every morning, for three weeks.

3234
02:53:32,200 --> 02:53:35,720
Give the law this precision and it will give you a transformed world.

3235
02:53:35,980 --> 02:53:39,660
May you wake tomorrow ready to assume the feeling of your wish fulfilled.

3236
02:53:40,220 --> 02:53:44,720
May your morning revision become the foundation of a life beyond your current imagination.

3237
02:53:44,720 --> 02:53:48,460
May consciousness reveal to you its infinite power to create.

3238
02:53:48,860 --> 02:53:51,220
And until we meet again, my friend, live in the end.

3239
02:54:00,300 --> 02:54:05,840
There came to me last week a man who had been applying what he called my technique for over a year.

3240
02:54:06,560 --> 02:54:08,240
He had visualized wealth.

3241
02:54:08,740 --> 02:54:10,060
He had written affirmations.

3242
02:54:10,280 --> 02:54:14,740
He had created, as he said, a vision of abundance in his mind every single day.

3243
02:54:14,920 --> 02:54:17,180
And yet his bank account remained unchanged.

3244
02:54:17,560 --> 02:54:18,440
He was exhausted.

3245
02:54:18,900 --> 02:54:20,100
He felt he had failed.

3246
02:54:20,100 --> 02:54:22,980
But I tell you tonight, he had not failed.

3247
02:54:23,360 --> 02:54:25,840
He had never actually applied the law at all.

3248
02:54:26,480 --> 02:54:29,140
What he had done feels to most people like work.

3249
02:54:29,360 --> 02:54:31,840
What I will show you tonight feels like cheating.

3250
02:54:32,440 --> 02:54:34,820
And that is precisely why it works.

3251
02:54:35,360 --> 02:54:36,740
Listen carefully, my friend.

3252
02:54:37,140 --> 02:54:40,360
The technique I am about to describe will offend your reason.

3253
02:54:40,700 --> 02:54:41,900
It will seem too simple.

3254
02:54:42,320 --> 02:54:45,520
It will seem dishonest as though you are lying to yourself.

3255
02:54:45,520 --> 02:54:50,700
But an assumption though false, if persisted in, will harden into fact.

3256
02:54:50,960 --> 02:54:54,080
Most of you hearing me now have been working to get wealth.

3257
02:54:54,360 --> 02:54:56,860
Tonight I will show you how to work from wealth.

3258
02:54:57,040 --> 02:54:57,940
There is a difference.

3259
02:54:58,480 --> 02:54:59,980
And that difference is everything.

3260
02:55:00,980 --> 02:55:04,340
Now why do I say this man never applied the law at all?

3261
02:55:04,340 --> 02:55:08,120
Because everything he did began from the premise that he lacked money.

3262
02:55:08,780 --> 02:55:11,780
Every visualization, every affirmation, every effort.

3263
02:55:12,120 --> 02:55:14,300
He was trying to get what he did not have.

3264
02:55:14,500 --> 02:55:17,020
And so in consciousness he affirmed lack.

3265
02:55:17,660 --> 02:55:19,660
The world is yourself pushed out.

3266
02:55:20,060 --> 02:55:23,980
If you are conscious of lacking, the world must reflect that lack back to you.

3267
02:55:24,360 --> 02:55:25,660
It can do nothing else.

3268
02:55:26,140 --> 02:55:29,920
The technique I will show you tonight begins from an entirely different premise.

3269
02:55:30,640 --> 02:55:32,080
You do not try to get wealth.

3270
02:55:32,340 --> 02:55:34,100
You assume you already have it.

3271
02:55:34,420 --> 02:55:36,360
And this my friend feels like cheating.

3272
02:55:36,620 --> 02:55:37,720
It feels dishonest.

3273
02:55:38,060 --> 02:55:40,120
It feels as though you are lying to yourself.

3274
02:55:40,820 --> 02:55:42,240
But let me ask you this.

3275
02:55:42,620 --> 02:55:45,800
When you sit in a chair, do you doubt the chair will hold you?

3276
02:55:46,360 --> 02:55:46,700
No.

3277
02:55:47,040 --> 02:55:47,980
You simply sit.

3278
02:55:48,200 --> 02:55:49,060
That is assumption.

3279
02:55:49,740 --> 02:55:52,020
You assume the chair supports you and it does.

3280
02:55:52,120 --> 02:55:52,920
You do not effort.

3281
02:55:53,060 --> 02:55:53,880
You do not strain.

3282
02:55:53,880 --> 02:55:55,300
You simply assume.

3283
02:55:55,600 --> 02:55:57,740
Now apply this same principle to money.

3284
02:55:58,360 --> 02:55:59,400
Assume you have it.

3285
02:55:59,400 --> 02:56:00,300
Not tomorrow.

3286
02:56:00,700 --> 02:56:02,280
Not when conditions change.

3287
02:56:02,660 --> 02:56:03,000
Now.

3288
02:56:03,700 --> 02:56:07,680
Assume it with the same naturalness with which you assume the chair beneath you.

3289
02:56:08,000 --> 02:56:11,760
And persist in that assumption until the outer world conforms.

3290
02:56:12,220 --> 02:56:13,180
This is the law.

3291
02:56:13,560 --> 02:56:15,280
Consciousness is the only reality.

3292
02:56:15,880 --> 02:56:19,360
Money is not a thing outside of you that you must chase or attract.

3293
02:56:19,860 --> 02:56:21,600
Money is a state of consciousness.

3294
02:56:21,800 --> 02:56:22,640
Make no mistake.

3295
02:56:23,080 --> 02:56:26,000
Most people will reject this the moment they hear it.

3296
02:56:26,000 --> 02:56:28,520
They will say, but Neville, I have bills to pay.

3297
02:56:28,620 --> 02:56:29,260
I have debts.

3298
02:56:29,400 --> 02:56:33,100
I cannot simply pretend I am wealthy when my bank account is empty.

3299
02:56:33,580 --> 02:56:36,460
And to them I say, you have misunderstood me entirely.

3300
02:56:36,840 --> 02:56:38,520
I am not asking you to pretend.

3301
02:56:38,520 --> 02:56:42,540
I am asking you to assume there is a vast difference.

3302
02:56:42,740 --> 02:56:43,820
Pretense is surface.

3303
02:56:44,060 --> 02:56:46,820
Pretense is the mind saying words it does not believe.

3304
02:56:47,000 --> 02:56:48,140
Assumption is depth.

3305
02:56:48,420 --> 02:56:54,140
Assumption is consciousness inhabiting a state and remaining there until that state externalizes

3306
02:56:54,140 --> 02:56:54,820
as fact.

3307
02:56:54,820 --> 02:57:00,240
When I say assume you are wealthy, I mean enter the state of wealth in your consciousness.

3308
02:57:00,820 --> 02:57:02,640
Feel as a wealthy person feels.

3309
02:57:03,060 --> 02:57:04,060
Not hope to feel.

3310
02:57:04,400 --> 02:57:05,340
Not wish to feel.

3311
02:57:05,700 --> 02:57:06,620
Feel now.

3312
02:57:06,980 --> 02:57:08,480
But hold this thought, my friend.

3313
02:57:08,860 --> 02:57:13,560
There is a specific signal, a feeling you must learn to recognize that tells you whether

3314
02:57:13,560 --> 02:57:17,680
the assumption has actually taken root or whether you are merely pretending.

3315
02:57:18,220 --> 02:57:22,240
Without that signal, you will practice this technique and wonder why nothing changes.

3316
02:57:22,240 --> 02:57:27,000
I will give you that signal in just a moment after I show you where most go wrong.

3317
02:57:27,860 --> 02:57:32,580
Let me tell you of a woman who came to me many years ago when I was lecturing in New York.

3318
02:57:32,860 --> 02:57:35,220
She had been widowed and left with very little.

3319
02:57:35,640 --> 02:57:36,820
She had two young children.

3320
02:57:37,280 --> 02:57:39,740
She told me she had been praying for money for months.

3321
02:57:40,200 --> 02:57:42,520
She had visualized checks arriving in the mail.

3322
02:57:42,900 --> 02:57:47,680
She had written out affirmations on cards and read them aloud each morning, and yet nothing

3323
02:57:47,680 --> 02:57:48,440
had changed.

3324
02:57:48,760 --> 02:57:50,440
She was exhausted from the effort.

3325
02:57:50,440 --> 02:57:54,140
She felt she had failed God, failed herself, failed her children.

3326
02:57:54,580 --> 02:57:55,920
I asked her one question.

3327
02:57:56,320 --> 02:57:59,040
I said, when you visualize the check, how do you feel?

3328
02:57:59,400 --> 02:58:00,060
She paused.

3329
02:58:00,260 --> 02:58:01,940
Then she said, I feel desperate.

3330
02:58:02,100 --> 02:58:03,640
I feel I need it so badly.

3331
02:58:04,100 --> 02:58:05,400
There you see was the error.

3332
02:58:05,800 --> 02:58:09,360
She was visualizing from the state of need, and need is lack.

3333
02:58:09,940 --> 02:58:11,360
Lack perpetuates lack.

3334
02:58:11,860 --> 02:58:14,320
I told her to stop visualizing entirely.

3335
02:58:14,460 --> 02:58:15,980
I told her to stop affirming.

3336
02:58:16,420 --> 02:58:18,540
She looked at me as though I had lost my reason.

3337
02:58:18,540 --> 02:58:21,780
She said, but Neville, if I stop doing these things, what will I do?

3338
02:58:22,180 --> 02:58:23,500
I said, you will assume.

3339
02:58:23,840 --> 02:58:25,020
She did not understand.

3340
02:58:25,460 --> 02:58:26,800
At first, she resisted.

3341
02:58:26,880 --> 02:58:28,440
She said, it could not be that simple.

3342
02:58:28,880 --> 02:58:29,920
But I persisted.

3343
02:58:30,000 --> 02:58:32,880
I instructed her to go home that night and lie in her bed.

3344
02:58:32,880 --> 02:58:38,700
I told her to enter the drowsy state, that state akin to sleep just before you lose consciousness.

3345
02:58:39,340 --> 02:58:44,460
And from that state, I told her to assume she already had the money she needed, not to beg

3346
02:58:44,460 --> 02:58:49,920
for it, not to visualize it coming, but to feel the relief of already having it, to feel

3347
02:58:49,920 --> 02:58:55,560
the calm certainty that her children were provided for, to feel financially secure, and then in

3348
02:58:55,560 --> 02:58:57,000
that feeling to fall asleep.

3349
02:58:57,000 --> 02:58:59,600
She came back to me two weeks later.

3350
02:58:59,980 --> 02:59:01,780
She had done exactly as I instructed.

3351
02:59:02,340 --> 02:59:07,020
And within those two weeks, a distant cousin she had not heard from in years contacted her.

3352
02:59:07,420 --> 02:59:11,980
This cousin had recently sold a piece of property and felt, as he said, impressed to

3353
02:59:11,980 --> 02:59:13,800
send her a portion of the proceeds.

3354
02:59:14,040 --> 02:59:16,120
It was more than enough to meet her need.

3355
02:59:16,460 --> 02:59:17,900
She had not manipulated him.

3356
02:59:18,000 --> 02:59:19,320
She had not contacted him.

3357
02:59:19,640 --> 02:59:23,860
She had simply assumed the state of wealth, and the bridge of incidents was constructed

3358
02:59:23,860 --> 02:59:25,320
without her conscious effort.

3359
02:59:25,320 --> 02:59:28,020
You see, my friend, she did not create the means.

3360
02:59:28,480 --> 02:59:31,120
She assumed the end, and the means appeared.

3361
02:59:31,700 --> 02:59:34,160
This is what I mean when I say it feels like cheating.

3362
02:59:34,500 --> 02:59:36,180
She did nothing in the outer world.

3363
02:59:36,500 --> 02:59:37,380
She did not labor.

3364
02:59:37,620 --> 02:59:38,580
She did not scheme.

3365
02:59:39,100 --> 02:59:42,960
She simply rested in a state of consciousness, and the Lord did the work.

3366
02:59:43,200 --> 02:59:46,540
Now you may ask, what is this state of consciousness I speak of?

3367
02:59:46,780 --> 02:59:47,660
Let me be clear.

3368
02:59:48,300 --> 02:59:49,760
Consciousness is not your thinking.

3369
02:59:50,120 --> 02:59:51,220
It is not your wishing.

3370
02:59:51,560 --> 02:59:52,720
It is not your hoping.

3371
02:59:52,720 --> 02:59:55,500
Consciousness is what you are aware of being.

3372
02:59:56,100 --> 02:59:58,280
Right now, what are you conscious of being?

3373
02:59:58,680 --> 03:00:02,980
Are you conscious of being someone who lacks money, or are you conscious of being someone

3374
03:00:02,980 --> 03:00:05,500
who has money, not what you hope to be?

3375
03:00:05,820 --> 03:00:11,100
What you are conscious of being now, the world reflects your state of consciousness, not your

3376
03:00:11,100 --> 03:00:11,420
wishes.

3377
03:00:11,420 --> 03:00:16,920
I have told you before, but I will tell you again, the world is yourself pushed out.

3378
03:00:16,920 --> 03:00:19,360
What you are conscious of being you are.

3379
03:00:19,800 --> 03:00:22,200
Change your consciousness and you change your world.

3380
03:00:22,700 --> 03:00:25,260
It is as simple and as difficult as that.

3381
03:00:26,020 --> 03:00:30,940
Now I must insist on this my friend, because I have seen too many who claim to apply the

3382
03:00:30,940 --> 03:00:32,160
law and yet they do not.

3383
03:00:32,520 --> 03:00:35,420
Most people hear this and immediately they begin to effort.

3384
03:00:35,920 --> 03:00:38,260
They try to force themselves to feel wealthy.

3385
03:00:38,260 --> 03:00:43,660
They strain, they repeat affirmations they do not believe, they create vision boards and

3386
03:00:43,660 --> 03:00:45,340
stare at them with clenched fists.

3387
03:00:45,720 --> 03:00:48,360
And this my friend is the very opposite of assumption.

3388
03:00:48,880 --> 03:00:53,780
Do not let anyone, including yourself, talk you into believing that effort is required.

3389
03:00:54,500 --> 03:00:55,840
Effort implies lack.

3390
03:00:56,560 --> 03:01:00,420
If you must strain to feel wealthy, you are affirming you are not wealthy.

3391
03:01:01,080 --> 03:01:02,300
Do you see the contradiction?

3392
03:01:02,300 --> 03:01:04,560
Now here is where the lecture turns.

3393
03:01:04,900 --> 03:01:09,460
Most who hear me stop right here in their understanding and miss the deeper truth.

3394
03:01:10,240 --> 03:01:12,400
They understand that assumption is not effort.

3395
03:01:12,840 --> 03:01:16,000
But they do not understand what assumption actually is.

3396
03:01:16,440 --> 03:01:21,320
There is a precise quality to the feeling of assumption and it is this quality that separates

3397
03:01:21,320 --> 03:01:24,000
those who manifest in days from those who never do.

3398
03:01:24,780 --> 03:01:26,560
I will give you that quality now.

3399
03:01:27,160 --> 03:01:28,520
Assumption is effortless.

3400
03:01:28,860 --> 03:01:30,980
When you assume a thing, you rest in it.

3401
03:01:30,980 --> 03:01:33,180
You do not labor to maintain it.

3402
03:01:33,520 --> 03:01:35,280
You simply remain in that state.

3403
03:01:35,900 --> 03:01:38,220
Let me give you an example from my own life.

3404
03:01:38,720 --> 03:01:42,060
When I was a young man in Barbados, I wanted to come to America.

3405
03:01:42,300 --> 03:01:43,260
I had no means.

3406
03:01:43,380 --> 03:01:44,740
I had no money for passage.

3407
03:01:45,200 --> 03:01:46,300
I had no connections.

3408
03:01:46,780 --> 03:01:48,480
But I assumed I was in America.

3409
03:01:48,980 --> 03:01:51,420
I did not try to figure out how I would get there.

3410
03:01:51,700 --> 03:01:53,200
I did not scheme or plot.

3411
03:01:53,480 --> 03:01:56,900
I simply assumed in my imagination that I was already here.

3412
03:01:57,260 --> 03:02:00,120
I felt the ground of New York beneath my feet.

3413
03:02:00,120 --> 03:02:02,260
I heard the sounds of the city.

3414
03:02:02,460 --> 03:02:03,760
I inhabited that state.

3415
03:02:03,980 --> 03:02:08,780
And within a short time, my family who had previously refused to help me, suddenly and

3416
03:02:08,780 --> 03:02:11,460
without explanation provided the money for my passage.

3417
03:02:12,100 --> 03:02:13,500
I did not convince them.

3418
03:02:13,580 --> 03:02:14,360
I did not beg.

3419
03:02:14,520 --> 03:02:16,460
I assumed the end and the means appeared.

3420
03:02:16,760 --> 03:02:17,620
This is the law.

3421
03:02:17,880 --> 03:02:19,120
It has never failed me.

3422
03:02:19,200 --> 03:02:19,960
Not once.

3423
03:02:20,240 --> 03:02:21,360
Now I tell you tonight.

3424
03:02:21,480 --> 03:02:23,400
You can apply this same law to money.

3425
03:02:23,740 --> 03:02:25,520
But you must understand what you are doing.

3426
03:02:25,520 --> 03:02:27,960
You are not trying to manipulate the outer world.

3427
03:02:28,340 --> 03:02:30,580
You are not trying to force conditions to change.

3428
03:02:30,940 --> 03:02:32,700
You are changing your state of consciousness.

3429
03:02:33,180 --> 03:02:36,520
And when you change your state, the outer world must reflect that change.

3430
03:02:36,600 --> 03:02:37,160
It is law.

3431
03:02:37,900 --> 03:02:39,440
Here is what most do wrong.

3432
03:02:39,800 --> 03:02:40,780
They assume once.

3433
03:02:40,880 --> 03:02:42,800
They enter the feeling of wealth for a moment.

3434
03:02:43,240 --> 03:02:46,060
And then they immediately return to the old state of lack.

3435
03:02:46,400 --> 03:02:47,700
They check their bank account.

3436
03:02:47,820 --> 03:02:48,960
They worry about bills.

3437
03:02:48,960 --> 03:02:53,960
They affirm lack a hundred times a day and wonder why one moment of assumption did not

3438
03:02:53,960 --> 03:02:54,860
change their world.

3439
03:02:55,260 --> 03:02:57,580
My friend, assumption must be persisted in.

3440
03:02:57,720 --> 03:03:01,520
An assumption though false, if persisted in, will harden into fact.

3441
03:03:01,920 --> 03:03:03,000
But you must persist.

3442
03:03:03,440 --> 03:03:04,780
The second error is this.

3443
03:03:05,140 --> 03:03:07,740
They assume the wealth and then they test the assumption.

3444
03:03:08,160 --> 03:03:10,160
They look for evidence in the outer world.

3445
03:03:10,300 --> 03:03:14,440
And when they do not see it immediately, they abandon the assumption and return to doubt.

3446
03:03:14,900 --> 03:03:15,780
Do not do this.

3447
03:03:15,900 --> 03:03:16,700
Live from the end.

3448
03:03:17,060 --> 03:03:18,000
Do not look back.

3449
03:03:18,000 --> 03:03:21,520
If you have assumed you are wealthy, then you are wealthy in consciousness.

3450
03:03:21,800 --> 03:03:23,400
The outer world will catch up.

3451
03:03:23,780 --> 03:03:25,820
But you must remain faithful to the state.

3452
03:03:26,480 --> 03:03:30,120
Remember what I told you a few moments ago about that woman who came to me.

3453
03:03:30,420 --> 03:03:31,800
She did not test the law.

3454
03:03:32,180 --> 03:03:35,000
She did not check her mailbox each day looking for the money.

3455
03:03:35,140 --> 03:03:37,300
She simply assumed, and the cousin appeared.

3456
03:03:37,800 --> 03:03:41,420
Now this is where you see why faithfulness to the inner state is everything.

3457
03:03:41,700 --> 03:03:45,140
The third error, and this is where I see the greatest failure, is this.

3458
03:03:45,260 --> 03:03:47,640
They try to dictate how the money will come.

3459
03:03:48,000 --> 03:03:52,560
They assume they will receive a raise, or they assume a specific person will give them money.

3460
03:03:53,080 --> 03:03:56,600
And when it does not come through that channel, they believe the law has failed.

3461
03:03:56,600 --> 03:04:03,060
The world will tell you that you must plan, that you must control the means, that you must know the how, before you can have the end.

3462
03:04:03,440 --> 03:04:04,820
I tell you they are wrong.

3463
03:04:04,960 --> 03:04:07,180
The law does not require you to know the how.

3464
03:04:07,580 --> 03:04:10,080
The law requires only that you assume the end.

3465
03:04:10,160 --> 03:04:11,480
You do not create the means.

3466
03:04:11,840 --> 03:04:13,960
You assume the end, and the means will appear.

3467
03:04:13,960 --> 03:04:16,160
I have seen this happen countless times.

3468
03:04:16,160 --> 03:04:19,980
A man assumes wealth, and an unexpected inheritance arrives.

3469
03:04:19,980 --> 03:04:25,680
A woman assumes financial security, and a business opportunity she never conceived of presents itself.

3470
03:04:26,000 --> 03:04:27,740
The law will construct the bridge.

3471
03:04:28,080 --> 03:04:29,820
But you must not dictate the root.

3472
03:04:30,100 --> 03:04:31,040
Assume the end.

3473
03:04:31,240 --> 03:04:32,180
Only the end.

3474
03:04:32,820 --> 03:04:36,620
Before I tell you how to apply this tonight, there is one final piece.

3475
03:04:36,620 --> 03:04:44,060
It is the piece that separates those who see their world respond in two weeks from those who practice for years, and see nothing.

3476
03:04:44,460 --> 03:04:52,240
There is a specific time of day, a specific state of mind, when the assumption either takes root in the subconscious, or evaporates entirely.

3477
03:04:52,780 --> 03:04:56,780
I must show you that moment now, for without it the technique remains theory.

3478
03:04:57,220 --> 03:04:59,360
Now let me tell you how to apply this tonight.

3479
03:04:59,500 --> 03:05:00,760
You need only do this.

3480
03:05:00,760 --> 03:05:10,400
When you retire to your bed this evening, you will enter that drowsy, sleepy state, that drowsiness, just before you lose consciousness entirely, you know this state.

3481
03:05:10,660 --> 03:05:18,980
In that state, the conscious mind relaxes its grip, the subconscious is impressionable, and it is in this state that assumption becomes most powerful.

3482
03:05:19,680 --> 03:05:21,880
From that drowsy state, you will do this.

3483
03:05:21,980 --> 03:05:26,000
First, you will bring to mind a scene that implies your wealth is already fulfilled.

3484
03:05:26,000 --> 03:05:30,780
Not a scene of receiving money, a scene that implies you already have it.

3485
03:05:31,140 --> 03:05:34,280
You see yourself looking at a bank statement that satisfies you.

3486
03:05:34,760 --> 03:05:37,120
You feel the relief of knowing your bills are paid.

3487
03:05:37,540 --> 03:05:40,820
You simply rest in the calm certainty of financial security.

3488
03:05:41,240 --> 03:05:42,920
Choose one scene, one feeling.

3489
03:05:43,080 --> 03:05:44,240
Do not complicate it.

3490
03:05:44,700 --> 03:05:50,700
Second, you will enter that scene in your imagination, not as an observer, as the one living it.

3491
03:05:51,040 --> 03:05:53,120
Feel it, feel the naturalness of it.

3492
03:05:53,120 --> 03:06:00,860
Do not strain, do not effort, simply rest in the feeling as though it is already true, because in consciousness it is true.

3493
03:06:01,340 --> 03:06:03,760
Third, you will not try to hold the thought.

3494
03:06:04,140 --> 03:06:05,520
You will not grip it tightly.

3495
03:06:05,980 --> 03:06:13,020
You will simply remain in that gentle feeling, that quiet assumption, and as you remain in it, you will let yourself drift into sleep.

3496
03:06:13,400 --> 03:06:16,440
You will fall asleep within the assumption of the wish fulfilled.

3497
03:06:16,440 --> 03:06:24,320
And fourth, you will repeat this every night, not once, not twice, every night until the assumption hardens into fact.

3498
03:06:25,100 --> 03:06:26,200
Persistence, my friend.

3499
03:06:26,800 --> 03:06:27,940
Persistence is the key.

3500
03:06:28,480 --> 03:06:32,940
The outer world will conform, but you must remain faithful to the inner state.

3501
03:06:33,320 --> 03:06:36,640
Do not check your bank account the next morning to see if it worked.

3502
03:06:37,140 --> 03:06:38,500
Do not test the law.

3503
03:06:38,960 --> 03:06:39,920
Live from the end.

3504
03:06:39,920 --> 03:06:42,780
If you have assumed you are wealthy, then you are wealthy.

3505
03:06:43,260 --> 03:06:44,500
Act from that conviction.

3506
03:06:45,040 --> 03:06:46,320
Feel from that conviction.

3507
03:06:46,840 --> 03:06:49,660
And let the outer world rearrange itself to match.

3508
03:06:50,500 --> 03:06:51,600
This is the technique.

3509
03:06:52,200 --> 03:06:53,180
Simple, is it not?

3510
03:06:53,360 --> 03:06:56,200
And yet I tell you, most who hear me will not do it.

3511
03:06:56,800 --> 03:06:58,280
They will say it is too simple.

3512
03:06:58,680 --> 03:07:00,260
They will say it cannot work.

3513
03:07:00,620 --> 03:07:04,300
Or they will do it once, see no immediate change, and abandon it.

3514
03:07:04,300 --> 03:07:14,660
But those who persist, those who dare to assume in the face of contradiction, those who remain faithful to the inner state regardless of outer appearances, they will prove the law.

3515
03:07:15,040 --> 03:07:17,460
I have seen it proven time and time again.

3516
03:07:17,920 --> 03:07:22,160
You have heard me speak of assumption, and many have misunderstood me.

3517
03:07:22,840 --> 03:07:23,660
Let me be plain.

3518
03:07:24,180 --> 03:07:31,360
The reason this feels like cheating, my friend, is because you have been taught that wealth must be earned through sweat and toil.

3519
03:07:31,360 --> 03:07:37,640
You have been taught that money comes only through hard work, through struggle, through sacrifice.

3520
03:07:38,340 --> 03:07:40,180
I do not deny that you may work.

3521
03:07:40,360 --> 03:07:44,980
But I tell you, if you work from the assumption of wealth, your work will be blessed.

3522
03:07:45,920 --> 03:07:49,980
If you work from the assumption of lack, your work will perpetuate lack.

3523
03:07:50,300 --> 03:07:53,540
There is no such thing as attracting money from outside yourself.

3524
03:07:54,280 --> 03:07:55,300
Put it from your mind.

3525
03:07:55,960 --> 03:07:58,340
Money does not exist outside of consciousness.

3526
03:07:58,340 --> 03:08:04,480
The outer world, the world of banks and checks and bills, is only a shadow cast by consciousness.

3527
03:08:05,420 --> 03:08:08,000
Change the consciousness, and the shadow must change.

3528
03:08:08,400 --> 03:08:10,400
You are not at the mercy of conditions.

3529
03:08:10,980 --> 03:08:13,180
Conditions are at the mercy of your assumptions.

3530
03:08:13,900 --> 03:08:18,300
I say to you tonight with absolute certainty, and this is not opinion, it is law.

3531
03:08:18,760 --> 03:08:20,700
What you are conscious of being, you are.

3532
03:08:21,260 --> 03:08:22,280
This law works.

3533
03:08:22,480 --> 03:08:24,340
I have proven it in my own life.

3534
03:08:24,340 --> 03:08:30,340
I have seen it proven in the lives of countless men and women who have heard me and applied what I have told them.

3535
03:08:30,680 --> 03:08:31,780
It is not theory.

3536
03:08:32,140 --> 03:08:32,800
It is law.

3537
03:08:33,180 --> 03:08:34,480
And law does not fail.

3538
03:08:34,860 --> 03:08:39,560
And now I tell you, my friend, the secret of why this technique feels like cheating.

3539
03:08:39,980 --> 03:08:47,160
It is because the world has taught you that you must earn everything, that you must work for it, that you must deserve it before you can have it.

3540
03:08:47,160 --> 03:08:50,300
But the law I have shown you tonight requires none of that.

3541
03:08:50,860 --> 03:08:52,620
The law requires only assumption.

3542
03:08:53,000 --> 03:08:56,820
You assume the wish fulfilled, and the law does the rest.

3543
03:08:57,320 --> 03:08:58,780
You do not create the bridge.

3544
03:08:59,080 --> 03:09:00,620
You do not orchestrate the means.

3545
03:09:00,960 --> 03:09:04,100
You simply enter the state of the wish fulfilled and remain there.

3546
03:09:04,500 --> 03:09:07,480
And from that state, the world has no choice but to conform.

3547
03:09:08,020 --> 03:09:12,980
This is why it feels dishonest, because consciousness, not effort, is the creative power.

3548
03:09:12,980 --> 03:09:16,460
Tonight when you retire to your bed, do this just once.

3549
03:09:17,140 --> 03:09:18,560
Enter that drowsy state.

3550
03:09:19,000 --> 03:09:21,440
Assume you already have the wealth you desire.

3551
03:09:21,980 --> 03:09:28,040
Feel the relief of it, the calm certainty, the naturalness, and then fall asleep in that assumption.

3552
03:09:28,480 --> 03:09:29,180
That is all.

3553
03:09:29,460 --> 03:09:32,960
In the morning you may find that nothing has changed in the outer world.

3554
03:09:33,480 --> 03:09:34,500
Do not be discouraged.

3555
03:09:35,200 --> 03:09:37,320
The assumption must be persisted in.

3556
03:09:37,740 --> 03:09:40,920
Return to it night after night until it hardens into fact.

3557
03:09:40,920 --> 03:09:46,900
Or you may find, as so many have found, that the bridge of incidents begins to appear within days.

3558
03:09:47,280 --> 03:09:48,640
Both are well, my friend.

3559
03:09:49,160 --> 03:09:50,100
Both are well.

3560
03:09:50,780 --> 03:09:53,520
Remember always, imagining creates reality.

3561
03:09:54,340 --> 03:09:56,140
The world is yourself pushed out.

3562
03:09:56,940 --> 03:10:00,340
What you assume in consciousness must externalize as fact.

3563
03:10:00,580 --> 03:10:01,540
This is not hope.

3564
03:10:01,880 --> 03:10:02,640
This is law.

3565
03:10:03,600 --> 03:10:06,420
May you sleep tonight in the Sabbath rest of your assumption.

3566
03:10:06,820 --> 03:10:10,080
May the wish fulfilled become as natural to you as breathing.

3567
03:10:10,080 --> 03:10:14,920
And may you wake to find that the outer world has conformed to your inner conviction.

3568
03:10:15,560 --> 03:10:18,560
Until we meet again, my friend, live from the end.
